        "sentence_en": "The old chest held blankets and winter clothes.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "صندوق قدیمی پتوها و لباس زمستانی را نگه داشت.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.193Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-10T00:59:29.835Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 138,
        "sentence_en": "He filled his canteen before the long hike.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او قبل از پیاده‌روی طولانی قمقمه‌اش را پر کرد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.193Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-10T00:59:29.634Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 139,
        "sentence_en": "He brought a flask of hot tea to work.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او یک فلاسک چای داغ به محل کار آورد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.194Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-10T00:59:29.536Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 140,
        "sentence_en": "Grab a can of soda from the fridge.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "یک قوطی نوشابه از یخچال بردار.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.194Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-10T00:59:29.378Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 141,
        "sentence_en": "We opened a can of beans for dinner.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "برای شام یک قوطی کنسرو لوبیا باز کردیم.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.194Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-08T03:26:54.436Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 142,
        "sentence_en": "He opened the jar and spread the jam.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او شیشه را باز کرد و مربا را مالید.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.195Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-10T00:59:29.326Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 143,
        "sentence_en": "Her suitcase got lost on the flight.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "چمدان او در پرواز گم شد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.195Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-10T00:59:29.211Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 144,
        "sentence_en": "He slung his backpack over one shoulder.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او کوله‌پشتی‌اش را روی یک شانه انداخت.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.195Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-10T00:59:29.146Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 145,
        "sentence_en": "He packed his duffel bag for the weekend trip.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او کیف سفری‌اش را برای سفر آخر هفته بست.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.196Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-10T00:59:29.086Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 146,
        "sentence_en": "She tossed her phone into her handbag.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او گوشی‌اش را داخل کیف دستی‌اش انداخت.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.196Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-10T00:59:28.937Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 147,
        "sentence_en": "I can't find my wallet anywhere.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "من کیف پولم را هیچ جا پیدا نمی‌کنم.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.196Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-06-26T05:23:22.587Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 148,
        "sentence_en": "My pencil case is full of markers and pens.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "جامدادی‌ام پر از ماژیک و خودکار است.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.197Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-08T03:26:54.557Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 149,
        "sentence_en": "They rolled the barrel into the storage room.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "آنها بشکه را به داخل انبار غلتاندند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.197Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-05-05T07:22:15.625Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 150,
        "sentence_en": "The water tank behind the house started leaking.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "مخزن آب پشت خانه شروع به نشت کردن کرد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.197Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-10T00:59:28.733Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 151,
        "sentence_en": "A tanker truck blocked the road for a minute.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "یک کامیون تانکری برای یک دقیقه جاده را مسدود کرد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.198Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-10T00:59:28.587Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 152,
        "sentence_en": "The farm stored grain in a tall silo.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "مزرعه غله را در یک سیلوی بلند ذخیره کرد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.198Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-10T00:59:28.459Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 153,
        "sentence_en": "I left the scissors in the top drawer.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "من قیچی را در کشو بالایی گذاشتم.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.198Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-08T03:26:54.632Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 154,
        "sentence_en": "The mugs are in the cabinet above the sink.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "لیوان‌ها در کابینت بالای سینک هستند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.199Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-10T00:59:28.361Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 155,
        "sentence_en": "I attached the file to the email.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "من فایل را به ایمیل پیوست کردم.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.199Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-10T00:59:28.298Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 156,
        "sentence_en": "I checked the mailbox for your letter.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "من صندوق پست را برای نامه‌ات بررسی کردم.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.200Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-10T00:59:28.239Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 157,
        "sentence_en": "She locked her passport in the safe.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او گذرنامه‌اش را در گاوصندوق قفل کرد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.200Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-10T00:59:28.176Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 158,
        "sentence_en": "Can you pour me a glass of water?",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "می‌تونی یک لیوان آب برام بریزی؟",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.200Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-08T03:26:54.693Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 159,
        "sentence_en": "Sand got into my shoes at the beach.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "شن داخل کفش‌هایم در ساحل رفت.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.201Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-08T03:26:54.695Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 160,
        "sentence_en": "The kids built castles in the sand all afternoon.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "بچه‌ها تمام بعدازظهر در شن قلعه ساختند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.201Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-10T00:59:28.073Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 161,
        "sentence_en": "My car was covered in mud after the rain.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "ماشین من بعد از باران در گل پوشیده شد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.201Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-10T00:59:28.018Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 162,
        "sentence_en": "She shaped the clay into a small bowl.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او خاک رس را به یک کاسهٔ کوچک شکل داد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.202Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-10T00:59:27.956Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 163,
        "sentence_en": "Add a pinch of salt to the soup.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "کمی نمک به سوپ اضافه کن.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.202Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-10T00:59:27.846Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 164,
        "sentence_en": "Put some ice in my drink, please.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "لطفاً کمی یخ در نوشیدنی من بگذار.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.202Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-10T00:59:27.779Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 165,
        "sentence_en": "A yellow leaf floated down onto the sidewalk.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "یک برگ زرد پایین آمد و روی پیاده‌رو شناور شد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.203Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-10T00:59:27.723Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 166,
        "sentence_en": "The root cracked the sidewalk over time.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "ریشه با گذشت زمان پیاده‌رو را ترک انداخت.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.203Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-10T00:59:27.668Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 167,
        "sentence_en": "Cut the stem and put the roses in water.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "ساقه را ببُر و رزها را در آب بگذار.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.203Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-08T03:26:54.769Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 168,
        "sentence_en": "The bark felt rough under my fingers.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "پوست درخت زیر انگشتانم زبر حس شد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.203Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-05-05T07:29:15.133Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 169,
        "sentence_en": "The grass is wet, so don't sit there.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "چمن خیس است، پس آنجا ننشین.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.204Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-08T03:26:54.789Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 170,
        "sentence_en": "We planted a shrub near the front steps.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "ما یک بوته نزدیک پله جلویی کاشتیم.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.204Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-10T00:59:27.514Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 171,
        "sentence_en": "Moss covered the rocks by the creek.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "خزه سنگ‌ها را کنار جویبار پوشاند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.204Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-10T00:59:27.380Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 172,
        "sentence_en": "I always keep fresh fruit on the counter.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "من همیشه میوهٔ تازه را روی پیشخوان نگه می‌دارم.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.205Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-10T00:59:27.292Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 173,
        "sentence_en": "A tiny seed sprouted in the pot.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "یک دانهٔ کوچک در گلدان جوانه زد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.205Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-10T00:59:27.144Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 174,
        "sentence_en": "She spit the cherry pit into a napkin.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او هستهٔ گیلاس را داخل یک دستمال تف کرد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.205Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-06-25T14:03:31.963Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 175,
        "sentence_en": "He has a nut allergy, so he skips dessert.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او به آجیل حساسیت دارد، برای همین دسر را نمی‌خورد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.205Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-10T00:59:26.920Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 176,
        "sentence_en": "A squirrel carried an acorn up the tree.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "یک سنجاب یک بلوط را از درخت بالا برد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.206Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-24T18:26:06.538Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 177,
        "sentence_en": "They drove toward the mountain as the sun set.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "آنها به سمت کوه رانندگی کردند وقتی خورشید غروب کرد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.206Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-10T00:59:26.799Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 178,
        "sentence_en": "We walked up the hill to catch our breath.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "ما از تپه راه رفتیم تا نفسمان را بگیریم.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.206Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-10T00:59:26.602Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 179,
        "sentence_en": "We climbed onto a rock to get a better view.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "ما روی یک سنگ بالا رفتیم تا دید بهتری داشته باشیم.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.207Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-07-06T17:57:19.452Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 180,
        "sentence_en": "A pebble was stuck in my sandal.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "یک سنگ‌ریزه در صندل من گیر کرده بود.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.207Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-09T23:56:59.862Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 181,
        "sentence_en": "They explored a cave with headlamps.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "آنها با چراغ‌های پیشانی یک غار را کاوش کردند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.208Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-09T23:56:59.826Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 182,
        "sentence_en": "He dropped his phone and it hit the ground.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او گوشی‌اش را انداخت و آن به زمین برخورد کرد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.208Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-09T23:56:59.789Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 183,
        "sentence_en": "We filled our bottles at a cold spring.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "ما بطری‌هایمان را در یک چشمه سرد پر کردیم.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.208Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-08T03:26:55.798Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 184,
        "sentence_en": "The river rose overnight after the storm.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "رودخانه بعد از طوفان در طول شب بالا آمد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.209Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-09T23:56:59.748Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 185,
        "sentence_en": "You could smell the sea from the boardwalk.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "می‌توانستی دریا را از پیاده‌روی چوبی بو کنی.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.210Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-09T23:56:59.704Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 186,
        "sentence_en": "We rented a cabin by the lake.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "ما یک کلبه کنار دریاچه اجاره کردیم.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.210Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-09T23:56:59.672Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 187,
        "sentence_en": "Ducks were swimming in the pond.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "اردک‌ها در برکه شنا می‌کردند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.211Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-08T03:26:55.862Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 188,
        "sentence_en": "The waterfall was loud enough to drown out our voices.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "صدای آبشار آن‌قدر بلند بود که صداهای ما را خفه کند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.211Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-09T23:56:59.658Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 189,
        "sentence_en": "This sweater is made from soft wool.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "این پلیور از پشم نرم ساخته شده است.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.211Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-09T23:56:59.612Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 190,
        "sentence_en": "A feather drifted down onto his jacket.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "یک پر شناور شد و روی کت او پایین آمد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.212Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-06-26T06:44:52.711Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 191,
        "sentence_en": "The drum was stretched tight with deer hide.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "طبل با پوست گوزن محکم کشیده شده بود.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.212Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-09T23:56:59.566Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 192,
        "sentence_en": "The dog buried a bone in the backyard.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "سگ یک استخوان را در حیاط پشتی دفن کرد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.212Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-09T23:56:59.522Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 193,
        "sentence_en": "She found a shell in the wet sand.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او یک صدف در شن خیس پیدا کرد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.213Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-08T03:26:55.926Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 194,
        "sentence_en": "They found a meteorite in the desert.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "آنها یک سنگ آسمانی در بیابان پیدا کردند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.213Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-08T03:26:55.929Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 195,
        "sentence_en": "My car wouldn't start this morning.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "ماشین من امروز صبح روشن نشد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.213Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-09T23:56:59.492Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 196,
        "sentence_en": "That vehicle is blocking the driveway.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "آن وسیلهٔ نقلیه ورودی ماشین‌رو را بسته است.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.214Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-09T23:56:59.477Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 197,
        "sentence_en": "He rides his bicycle to work most days.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او بیشتر روزها با دوچرخه‌اش به محل کار سوار می‌شود.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.214Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-09T23:56:59.442Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 198,
        "sentence_en": "A motorcycle zipped past us at the light.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "یک موتورسیکلت از کنار ما کنار چراغ با سرعت گذشت.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.214Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-09T23:56:59.425Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 199,
        "sentence_en": "She rented a scooter to get around downtown.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او یک اسکوتر اجاره کرد تا در مرکز شهر رفت‌وآمد کند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.214Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-09T23:56:59.361Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 200,
        "sentence_en": "A truck delivered the couch this afternoon.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "یک کامیون این بعدازظهر کاناپه را تحویل داد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.215Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-09T23:56:59.346Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 201,
        "sentence_en": "He loaded the boxes into his pickup truck.",
