        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "دستگاه کپی دقیقاً پیش از جلسه گیر کرد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.308Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-11T13:38:01.935Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 394,
        "sentence_en": "They sent the form by fax yesterday.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "آن‌ها فرم را دیروز با فکس فرستادند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.309Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-06-27T16:32:37.128Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 395,
        "sentence_en": "I forgot my charger at the office.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "شارژرم را در اداره جا گذاشتم.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.309Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-11T12:50:26.992Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 396,
        "sentence_en": "Plug the lamp into the power strip.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "لامپ را به چندراهی وصل کن.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.309Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-11T13:38:01.678Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 397,
        "sentence_en": "Use a surge protector for your computer.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "برای کامپیوترت از محافظ برق استفاده کن.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.310Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-11T12:50:27.050Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 398,
        "sentence_en": "We ate dinner at the kitchen table.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "ما شام را کنار میز آشپزخانه خوردیم.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.310Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-11T13:38:01.605Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 399,
        "sentence_en": "He set his coffee on the coffee table.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او قهوه‌اش را روی میز جلو مبلی گذاشت.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.310Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-11T12:50:27.109Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 400,
        "sentence_en": "He lay on the bed and scrolled his phone.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او روی تخت دراز کشید و گوشی‌اش را اسکرول کرد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.311Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-11T13:38:01.537Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 401,
        "sentence_en": "He shook out the rug on the porch.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او قالی را روی ایوان تکاند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.311Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.311Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 402,
        "sentence_en": "We installed carpet in the kids’ room.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "ما در اتاق بچه‌ها موکت نصب کردیم.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.313Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.313Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 403,
        "sentence_en": "He tilted the blinds to let in light.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او کرکره‌ها را کج کرد تا نور بیاید.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.314Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.314Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 404,
        "sentence_en": "Turn on the lamp; it's getting dark.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "چراغ را روشن کن؛ دارد تاریک می‌شود.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.314Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.314Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 405,
        "sentence_en": "I need a softer pillow for my neck.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "برای گردنم به یک بالش نرم‌تر نیاز دارم.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.314Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.314Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 406,
        "sentence_en": "He pulled the blanket over his shoulders.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او پتو را روی شانه هایش کشید.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.315Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-07-13T17:27:33.910Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 407,
        "sentence_en": "He changed the bedsheet after spilling coffee.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او بعد از ریختن قهوه ملحفه را عوض کرد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.315Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.315Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 408,
        "sentence_en": "Hang your jacket on the coat rack.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "ژاکتت را روی چوب لباسی آویزان کن.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.316Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.316Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 409,
        "sentence_en": "Wipe your feet on the doormat.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "پاهایت را روی پادری پاک کن.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.316Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.316Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 410,
        "sentence_en": "Take the trash out before it starts smelling.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "زباله را بیرون ببر قبل از اینکه بو بگیرد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.316Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.316Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 411,
        "sentence_en": "The trash can is full already.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "سطل زباله همین حالا هم پر است.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.316Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.316Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 412,
        "sentence_en": "He swept the kitchen with a broom.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او با یک جارو آشپزخانه را جارو کرد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.317Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.317Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 413,
        "sentence_en": "She used a dustpan to pick up the crumbs.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او از خاک انداز برای جمع کردن خرده‌ها استفاده کرد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.317Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.317Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 414,
        "sentence_en": "We spread gravel on the driveway to stop puddles.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "برای جلوگیری از آب‌گرفتگی روی مسیر ورودی شن ریختیم.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.317Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.317Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 415,
        "sentence_en": "She molded the clay into a small cup.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او گل را به شکل یک فنجان کوچک درآورد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.318Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.318Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 416,
        "sentence_en": "They used gypsum to patch the damaged wall.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "آن‌ها از گچ برای ترمیم دیوار آسیب‌دیده استفاده کردند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.318Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.318Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 417,
        "sentence_en": "The museum displayed a chunk of coal from a mine.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "موزه یک تکه زغال سنگ از یک معدن را نمایش داد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.319Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.319Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 418,
        "sentence_en": "This cutting board is made from bamboo.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "این تخته برش از بامبو ساخته شده است.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.319Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.319Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 419,
        "sentence_en": "I prefer cotton sheets in the summer.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "من در تابستان ملحفه‌های پنبه‌ای را ترجیح می‌دهم.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.319Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.319Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 420,
        "sentence_en": "He wore a linen shirt to the summer wedding.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او برای عروسی تابستانی یک پیراهن کتان پوشید.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.320Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.320Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 421,
        "sentence_en": "This fabric feels soft against my skin.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "این پارچه روی پوستم نرم است.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.320Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.320Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 422,
        "sentence_en": "She bought a silk blouse for the event.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او برای مراسم یک بلوز ابریشم خرید.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.320Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.320Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 423,
        "sentence_en": "She bought yarn to knit a baby blanket.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او نخ خرید تا یک پتو نوزاد ببافد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.321Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.321Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 424,
        "sentence_en": "The fence is made of iron and it's heavy.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "حصار از آهن ساخته شده و سنگین است.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.321Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.321Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 425,
        "sentence_en": "The bridge is supported by thick steel beams.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "پل با تیرهای فولاد ضخیم نگه داشته شده است.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.321Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.321Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 426,
        "sentence_en": "Aluminum foil is great for covering leftovers.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "فویل آلومینیوم برای پوشاندن غذاهای باقی‌مانده عالی است.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.322Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.322Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 427,
        "sentence_en": "Copper pipes can turn green over time.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "لوله‌های مسی با گذشت زمان می‌توانند سبز شوند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.322Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.322Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 428,
        "sentence_en": "The doorknob is brass, so it shines nicely.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "دستگیره در برنج (فلز) است، پس خوب برق می‌زند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.322Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.322Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 429,
        "sentence_en": "The bronze statue looked darker after the rain.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "مجسمه برنز بعد از باران تیره‌تر به نظر می‌رسید.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.323Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.323Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 430,
        "sentence_en": "She wears a silver ring every day.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او هر روز یک انگشتر نقره می‌پوشد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.323Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.323Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 431,
        "sentence_en": "He bought a gold chain for his anniversary.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او برای سالگردش یک زنجیر طلا خرید.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.324Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.324Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 432,
        "sentence_en": "Old paint sometimes contained lead, so be careful.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "رنگ قدیمی گاهی سرب داشت، پس مراقب باش.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.324Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.324Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 433,
        "sentence_en": "The roof has a zinc coating to prevent rust.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "سقف یک پوشش روی دارد تا از زنگ‌زدگی جلوگیری کند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.324Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.324Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 434,
        "sentence_en": "Please recycle the plastic bottle when you're done.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "لطفاً وقتی تمام شد، بطری پلاستیک را بازیافت کن.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.325Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.325Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 435,
        "sentence_en": "The rubber sole kept me from slipping.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "کف لاستیکی باعث شد لیز نخورم.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.325Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.325Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 436,
        "sentence_en": "He packed a nylon jacket for the hike.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او برای پیاده‌روی یک کت نایلون بسته‌بندی کرد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.326Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.326Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 437,
        "sentence_en": "They repaired the boat with fiberglass last weekend.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "آن‌ها آخر هفته گذشته قایق را با فایبرگلاس تعمیر کردند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.326Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.326Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 438,
        "sentence_en": "Use silicone sealant around the sink to stop leaks.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "برای جلوگیری از نشتی دور سینک از سیلیکون استفاده کن.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.327Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.327Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 439,
        "sentence_en": "The glass cracked when it hit the tile floor.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "وقتی شیشه به کف کاشی خورد ترک برداشت.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.327Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.327Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 440,
        "sentence_en": "Her crystal necklace sparkled under the lights.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "گردنبند کریستال او زیر نورها برق زد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.328Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.328Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 441,
        "sentence_en": "He checked the oil before the road trip.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او قبل از سفر جاده‌ای روغن را چک کرد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.328Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.328Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 442,
        "sentence_en": "The country exports petroleum to fund its budget.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "آن کشور نفت صادر می‌کند تا بودجه‌اش را تأمین کند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.329Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.329Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 443,
        "sentence_en": "Gasoline prices jumped again this week.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "قیمت بنزین این هفته دوباره بالا رفت.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.329Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.329Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 444,
        "sentence_en": "The generator runs on diesel during outages.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "ژنراتور هنگام قطعی‌ها با گازوئیل کار می‌کند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.329Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-23T23:44:27.043Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 445,
        "sentence_en": "That building used to be an old factory.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "آن ساختمان قبلاً یک کارخانه قدیمی بود.",
