        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.330Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 446,
        "sentence_en": "A stain spread across the ceiling after the leak.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "بعد از نشتی، یک لکه روی سقف پخش شد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.330Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.330Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 447,
        "sentence_en": "The roof needs repairs after last night's storm.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "سقف بعد از طوفان دیشب نیاز به تعمیر دارد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.330Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.330Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 448,
        "sentence_en": "The door frame is cracked near the bottom.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "چارچوب در نزدیک پایین ترک خورده است.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.331Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.331Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 449,
        "sentence_en": "She ran up the stairs two at a time.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او از پله‌ها دوتا یکی بالا دوید.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.331Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.331Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 450,
        "sentence_en": "The stairway was blocked, so we used the elevator.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "راه پله بسته بود، پس از آسانسور استفاده کردیم.",
