        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.333Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 455,
        "sentence_en": "He left the package on the front porch.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او بسته را روی ایوان جلویی گذاشت.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.334Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.334Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 456,
        "sentence_en": "A marble column stood at the entrance.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "یک ستون مرمری در ورودی ایستاده بود.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.334Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.334Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 457,
        "sentence_en": "The beam cracked and the ceiling started sagging.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "تیر ترک خورد و سقف شروع به افتادگی کرد.",
