        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.335Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 460,
        "sentence_en": "Ceramic tile is easy to wipe clean.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "سرامیک را به‌راحتی می‌شود تمیز کرد.",
