        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.335Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 461,
        "sentence_en": "Their brick house stays cool in summer.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "خانه آجری آن‌ها در تابستان خنک می‌ماند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.335Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.335Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 462,
        "sentence_en": "The driveway is poured concrete, so it won't shift.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "مسیر ورودی بتنِ ریخته‌شده است، پس جابه‌جا نمی‌شود.",
