        "updatedAt": "2026-04-23T06:56:59.354Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 463,
        "sentence_en": "The facade was renovated to match the original design.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "نما بازسازی شد تا با طراحی اصلی هماهنگ باشد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.336Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-06-27T12:19:36.824Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 464,
        "sentence_en": "The entrance canopy kept us dry in the rain.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "سردر در باران ما را خشک نگه داشت.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.337Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.337Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 465,
        "sentence_en": "They built a ramp for wheelchair access.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "آن‌ها برای دسترسی ویلچر یک رمپ ساختند.",
