        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.339Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 471,
        "sentence_en": "He knocked on the door and waited quietly.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او به درِ ضربه زد و آرام منتظر ماند.",
