        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.344Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 484,
        "sentence_en": "This shampoo makes my hair feel really clean.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "این شامپو موهایم را واقعاً تمیز حس می‌کند.",
