        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.344Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 485,
        "sentence_en": "I leave the hair conditioner in for two minutes.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "نرم کننده مو را دو دقیقه روی موها می‌گذارم.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.344Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.344Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 486,
        "sentence_en": "He keeps dental floss in his desk at work.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او نخ دندان را در کشوی میزش در محل کار نگه می‌دارد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.345Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.345Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 487,
        "sentence_en": "She swished mouthwash for thirty seconds and spit it out.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او دهان شویه را سی ثانیه در دهان چرخاند و بیرون تف کرد.",
