        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.346Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 490,
        "sentence_en": "The kids lined up at the fountain for water.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "بچه‌ها برای آب در صف آبخوری ایستادند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.346Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.346Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 491,
        "sentence_en": "Traffic backed up as we crossed the bridge.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "وقتی از پل رد می‌شدیم، ترافیک سنگین شد.",
