        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.348Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 496,
        "sentence_en": "He grabbed a tissue and wiped his nose.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او یک دستمال کاغذی برداشت و بینی‌اش را پاک کرد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.348Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.348Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 497,
        "sentence_en": "We ran out of toilet paper at the worst time.",
