        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.353Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 514,
        "sentence_en": "The soap dispenser is clogged again.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "پمپ صابون دوباره گرفته است.",
