        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.355Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 519,
        "sentence_en": "The nurse filled a syringe and checked the label.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "پرستار سرنگ را پر کرد و برچسب را چک کرد.",
