        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.356Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 522,
        "sentence_en": "He took a pill with a glass of water.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او یک قرص را با یک لیوان آب خورد.",
