        "id": 706,
        "sentence_en": "A shiny beetle crawled under the log in seconds.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "یک سوسک براق در چند ثانیه زیر کنده خزید.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.469Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.469Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 707,
        "sentence_en": "These aphids are ruining my roses in the backyard.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "این شتهها رزهای من را در حیاط پشتی خراب می‌کنند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.469Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.469Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 708,
        "sentence_en": "The vet said our dog might have a flea.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "دامپزشک گفت سگ ما ممکن است کک داشته باشد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.470Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.470Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 709,
        "sentence_en": "They checked his hair and found a louse.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "آن‌ها موهایش را بررسی کردند و یک شپش پیدا کردند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.470Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.470Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 710,
        "sentence_en": "A spider built a web in the corner of the shower.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "یک عنکبوت گوشه دوش یک تار ساخت.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.470Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.470Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 711,
        "sentence_en": "We spotted a scorpion near the tent and backed up.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "ما یک عقرب نزدیک چادر دیدیم و عقب رفتیم.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.471Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.471Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 712,
        "sentence_en": "A leech latched onto my leg in the lake.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "یک زالو در دریاچه به پایم چسبید.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.471Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.471Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 713,
        "sentence_en": "A snail inched across the sidewalk after the storm.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "بعد از طوفان یک حلزون روی پیاده‌رو خزید.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.471Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.471Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 714,
        "sentence_en": "A slug left a shiny trail on the patio.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "یک حلزون بی صدف روی پاسیو یک رد براق جا گذاشت.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.472Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.472Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 715,
        "sentence_en": "I found a millipede under the flower pot.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "من یک هزارپا زیر گلدان پیدا کردم.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.472Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.472Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 716,
        "sentence_en": "A centipede darted across the bathroom floor.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "یک صدپا از روی کف حمام رد شد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.472Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.472Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 717,
        "sentence_en": "She rents an apartment near the subway station.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او یک آپارتمان نزدیک ایستگاه مترو اجاره می‌کند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.473Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.473Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 718,
        "sentence_en": "This neighborhood is quiet, but it's close to everything.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "این محله ساکت است، اما به همه چیز نزدیک است.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.473Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.473Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 719,
        "sentence_en": "We took the alley to avoid the traffic on Main.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "برای اینکه از ترافیک خیابان مین دوری کنیم از کوچه رفتیم.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.473Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.473Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 720,
        "sentence_en": "The coffee shop is across the street.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "کافی شاپ آن طرف خیابان است.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.474Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-06-26T06:56:03.157Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 721,
        "sentence_en": "They met in the square to watch the parade.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "آن‌ها در میدان همدیگر را دیدند تا رژه را تماشا کنند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.474Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.474Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 722,
        "sentence_en": "Let's walk through the park before it gets dark.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "بیایید قبل از تاریک شدن از پارک رد شویم.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.474Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.474Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 723,
        "sentence_en": "The kids ran to the playground after school.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "بچه‌ها بعد از مدرسه به زمین بازی دویدند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.475Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.475Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 724,
        "sentence_en": "There's no parking on this block after 6 p.m.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "بعد از ساعت ۶ عصر در این بلوک پارکینگ نیست.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.475Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.475Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 725,
        "sentence_en": "Is there a restroom near the front entrance?",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "نزدیک ورودیِ جلو دستشویی هست؟",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.475Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.475Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 726,
        "sentence_en": "My cousin works at a factory that makes tires.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "پسرعمویم در کارخانهی کار می‌کند که لاستیک می‌سازد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.476Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.476Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 727,
        "sentence_en": "I left my laptop at the office last night.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "من دیشب لپ‌تاپم را در دفتر جا گذاشتم.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.476Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.476Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 728,
        "sentence_en": "Her company is hiring for a new sales role.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "شرکت او برای یک نقش فروش جدید نیرو می‌گیرد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.476Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.476Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 729,
        "sentence_en": "I have to go to the office to renew my ID.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "باید برای تمدید کارت شناسایی‌ام به اداره بروم.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.477Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.477Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 730,
        "sentence_en": "I stopped by the bank to deposit a check.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "من برای واریز یک چک به بانک سر زدم.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.477Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.477Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 731,
        "sentence_en": "Our insurance covered most of the repair costs.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "بیمه ما بیشتر هزینه‌های تعمیر را پوشش داد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.478Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.478Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 732,
        "sentence_en": "We need a notary to sign these forms today.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "ما امروز برای امضای این فرم‌ها به دفتر اسناد رسمی نیاز داریم.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.478Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.478Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 733,
        "sentence_en": "She booked the trip through a local agency.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او سفر را از طریق یک نمایندگی محلی رزرو کرد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.478Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.478Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 734,
        "sentence_en": "He bought his truck at a dealership outside town.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او کامیونش را در یک نمایندگی فروش خارج از شهر خرید.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.478Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.478Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 735,
        "sentence_en": "She booked a haircut at the hair salon nearby.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او در آرایشگاه نزدیک، برای کوتاهی مو وقت گرفت.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.479Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.479Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 736,
        "sentence_en": "They went to a beauty salon before the wedding.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "آن‌ها قبل از عروسی به سالن زیبایی رفتند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.479Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.479Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 737,
        "sentence_en": "He gets his hair cut at the barber shop.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او موهایش را در سلمانی کوتاه می‌کند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.479Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.479Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 738,
        "sentence_en": "I dropped my suit off at the dry cleaner.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "من کت‌وشلوارم را به خشکشویی دادم.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.480Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.480Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 739,
        "sentence_en": "I dropped my clothes off at the laundry on Elm.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "من لباس‌هایم را در لباسشویی خیابان اِلْم گذاشتم.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.480Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.480Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 740,
        "sentence_en": "The tailor shop fixed my pants hem in a day.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "خیاطی لبه شلوارم را در یک روز درست کرد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.480Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-06-25T14:10:52.623Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 741,
        "sentence_en": "This shoe repair place can fix heels fast.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "این کفاشی می‌تواند پاشنه‌ها را سریع درست کند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.481Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.481Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 742,
        "sentence_en": "A locksmith came out and opened the door.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "یک کلیدسازی آمد و در را باز کرد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.481Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.481Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 743,
        "sentence_en": "My phone is at the repair shop for a new screen.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "گوشی‌ام برای یک صفحه‌نمایش جدید در تعمیرگاه است.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.481Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.481Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 744,
        "sentence_en": "Auto repair is expensive if you wait too long.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "تعمیرگاه خودرو اگر خیلی صبر کنی گران است.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.482Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.482Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 745,
        "sentence_en": "I took the car to a car wash after the storm.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "من بعد از طوفان ماشین را به کارواش بردم.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.482Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.482Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 746,
        "sentence_en": "This store closes at nine, so let's go now.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "این فروشگاه ساعت نه تعطیل می‌شود، پس الان برویم.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.482Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.482Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 747,
        "sentence_en": "There's a small shop on the corner with great coffee.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "یک مغازه کوچک سرِ کوچه هست که قهوه خوبی دارد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.483Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.483Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 748,
        "sentence_en": "I ran into my neighbor at the supermarket.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "من در سوپرمارکت به همسایه‌ام برخوردم.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.483Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.483Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 749,
        "sentence_en": "The bakery smells amazing early in the morning.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "صبح زود بوی نانوایی فوق‌العاده است.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.483Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.483Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 750,
        "sentence_en": "We wandered through the bazaar and bought spices.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "ما در بازار قدم زدیم و ادویه خریدیم.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.484Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.484Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 751,
        "sentence_en": "The market had fresh tomatoes and local cheese.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "بازارچه گوجه‌فرنگی تازه و پنیر محلی داشت.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.484Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.484Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 752,
        "sentence_en": "We met at the mall and grabbed lunch first.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "ما در مرکز خرید همدیگر را دیدیم و اول ناهار گرفتیم.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.484Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.484Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 753,
        "sentence_en": "The mall was packed because it was raining.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "پاساژ شلوغ بود چون باران می‌بارید.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.485Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.485Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 754,
        "sentence_en": "I prefer the local cafe over a chain store.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "من کافه محلی را به فروشگاه زنجیره ای ترجیح می‌دهم.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.486Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.486Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 755,
        "sentence_en": "We tried a new restaurant that just opened.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "ما یک رستوران جدید را که تازه باز شده بود امتحان کردیم.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.486Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.486Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 756,
        "sentence_en": "We grabbed fast food on the way to the game.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "ما در راهِ بازی فست فود گرفتیم.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.486Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.486Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 757,
        "sentence_en": "Let's meet at the cafe across from the library.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "بیایید در کافه روبه‌روی کتابخانه همدیگر را ببینیم.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.487Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.487Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 758,
        "sentence_en": "He works from a coffeehouse when he's tired of home.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "وقتی از خانه خسته می‌شود از یک قهوه خانه کار می‌کند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.487Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.487Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 759,
        "sentence_en": "We sat in a teahouse and talked for hours.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "ما در یک چایخانه نشستیم و ساعت‌ها حرف زدیم.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.487Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.487Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 760,
        "sentence_en": "They took us to a traditional restaurant near the old square.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "آن‌ها ما را به یک سفره خانه نزدیک میدان قدیمی بردند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.488Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.488Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 761,
        "sentence_en": "I ate in the cafeteria because the line was short.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "چون صف کوتاه بود، در سلف سرویس غذا خوردم.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.488Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.488Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 762,
        "sentence_en": "The school starts at eight, so set an alarm.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "مدرسه ساعت هشت شروع می‌شود، پس زنگ بگذار.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.488Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.488Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 763,
        "sentence_en": "She teaches at an elementary school on the east side.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او در سمت شرق شهر در یک دبستان تدریس می‌کند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.489Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.489Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 764,
        "sentence_en": "He met his best friend in high school.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او بهترین دوستش را در دبیرستان پیدا کرد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.489Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.489Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 765,
        "sentence_en": "She got into the university she really wanted.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او وارد دانشگاهی شد که واقعاً می‌خواست.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.489Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.489Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 766,
        "sentence_en": "He works on the faculty and teaches two classes.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او در دانشکده کار می‌کند و دو کلاس درس می‌دهد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.490Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.490Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 767,
        "sentence_en": "He enrolled in a training institute for web development.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او برای توسعه وب در یک آموزشگاه ثبت‌نام کرد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.490Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.490Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 768,
        "sentence_en": "I returned the books to the library before work.",
