        "updatedAt": "2026-06-25T14:44:42.695Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 863,
        "sentence_en": "We drove through open grassland for miles.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "ما کیلومترها از میان چمنزار باز رانندگی کردیم.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.525Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.525Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 864,
        "sentence_en": "The ocean looked calm until the wind picked up.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "اقیانوس آرام به نظر می‌رسید تا وقتی باد شدت گرفت.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.525Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.525Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 865,
        "sentence_en": "The wetland trail was closed after the flooding.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "مسیر تالاب بعد از سیل بسته شد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.526Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.526Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 866,
        "sentence_en": "They kayaked through the swamp at sunrise.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "آن‌ها هنگام طلوع با کایاک از مرداب گذشتند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.526Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.526Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 867,
        "sentence_en": "Mosquitoes were brutal near the marsh at dusk.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "پشه‌ها نزدیک باتلاق در گرگ‌ومیش وحشتناک بودند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.530Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.530Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 868,
        "sentence_en": "We followed the stream up into the woods.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "ما نهر را تا داخل جنگل دنبال کردیم.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.531Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.531Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 869,
        "sentence_en": "A storm formed over the gulf overnight.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "شب تا صبح یک طوفان روی خلیج شکل گرفت.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.531Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.531Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 870,
        "sentence_en": "The river forms a delta near the coast.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "رودخانه نزدیک ساحل یک دلتا تشکیل می‌دهد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.532Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.532Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 871,
        "sentence_en": "They hiked to the glacier with a guide.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "آن‌ها با یک راهنما تا یخچال طبیعی پیاده‌روی کردند.",
