        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.534Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 874,
        "sentence_en": "The compass needle points toward the pole.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "عقربهٔ قطب‌نما به سمت قطب اشاره می‌کند.",
