        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.544Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 880,
        "sentence_en": "They drove down the peninsula to see the sunset.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "آن‌ها در شبه جزیره رانندگی کردند تا غروب را ببینند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.547Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.547Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 881,
        "sentence_en": "The volcano was smoking when we arrived.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "وقتی رسیدیم آتشفشان دود می‌کرد.",
