        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.522Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.522Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2426,
        "sentence_en": "I soaked the beans overnight before cooking them.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "من لوبیاها را قبل از پختن، یک شب خیساندم.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.523Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.523Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2427,
        "sentence_en": "She sifted the flour to remove any lumps.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او آرد را الک کرد تا هر گلوله‌ای را جدا کند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.523Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.523Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2428,
        "sentence_en": "Can you dish up the pasta while I set the table?",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "می‌تونی در حالی که من میز را می‌چینم، پاستا را غذا بکشی؟",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.523Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.523Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2429,
        "sentence_en": "I chopped the onions and added them to the soup.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "من پیازها را ریز کردم و به سوپ اضافه کردم.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.524Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.524Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2430,
        "sentence_en": "I grind the coffee beans every morning.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "من هر صبح دانه‌های قهوه را آسیاب می‌کنم.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.524Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.524Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2431,
        "sentence_en": "Dice the onions into small, even pieces.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "پیازها را نگینی کن.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.527Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.527Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2432,
        "sentence_en": "These chips taste stale, so I’m throwing them out.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "این چیپس‌ها بیات مزه می‌دهند، پس دارم آن‌ها را دور می‌اندازم.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.528Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.528Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2433,
        "sentence_en": "I found moldy bread in the back of the pantry.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "من در عقب انبارِ مواد غذایی نان کپک‌زده پیدا کردم.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.528Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.528Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2434,
        "sentence_en": "I’ll dish out dinner while you set the table.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "من غذا را می‌کشم، تو هم میز را بچین.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.529Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.529Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2435,
        "sentence_en": "I asked for a mild salsa, not the really spicy one.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "من یک سسِ سالسا ملایم خواستم، نه آن خیلی تند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.530Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.530Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2436,
        "sentence_en": "The towels are still moist from the wash.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "حوله‌ها هنوز از شست‌وشو مرطوب هستند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.530Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.530Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2437,
        "sentence_en": "The doctor gave him fluids through an IV.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "دکتر از طریق سرم به او مایع داد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.533Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.533Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2438,
        "sentence_en": "After the crash, he had severe back pain.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "بعد از تصادف، او درد کمر شدید داشت.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.540Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.540Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2439,
        "sentence_en": "It was difficult to find the trail through the dense forest.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "پیدا کردن مسیر در آن جنگل انبوه دشوار بود.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.541Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.541Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2440,
        "sentence_en": "We need to find a viable solution to the parking problem.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "ما باید یک راه حل شدنی برای مشکل پارکینگ پیدا کنیم.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.542Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.542Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2441,
        "sentence_en": "She snapped her fingers to the beat of the music.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او با ریتم موسیقی بشکن زد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.545Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.545Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2442,
        "sentence_en": "The hotel window offers a beautiful view of the desert landscape.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "پنجره هتل نمای زیبایی از چشم‌انداز بیابان را ارائه می‌دهد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.546Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.546Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2443,
        "sentence_en": "The company is fully cognizant of the potential risks involved.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "شرکت کاملاً از خطرات احتمالی موجود باخبر است.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.546Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.546Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2444,
        "sentence_en": "The new training program will encompass all aspects of digital marketing.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "برنامه آموزشی جدید تمام جنبه‌های بازاریابی دیجیتال را در بر خواهد گرفت.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.547Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.547Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2445,
        "sentence_en": "The researcher decided to incorporate the latest data into the final report.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "محقق تصمیم گرفت آخرین داده‌ها را به گزارش نهایی ضمیمه کند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.547Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.547Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2446,
        "sentence_en": "The new refugees are trying hard to integrate into the local community.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "پناهندگان جدید سخت تلاش می‌کنند تا در جامعه محلی ادغام شوند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.548Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.548Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2447,
        "sentence_en": "The designers built a full-scale mock-up of the car's interior.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "طراحان یک ماکت در اندازه واقعی از طراحی داخلی خودرو ساختند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.548Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.548Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2448,
        "sentence_en": "He wasn't literally on fire; it was just a figurative expression.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او واقعاً در آتش نبود؛ این فقط یک بیان استعاری بود.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.548Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.548Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2449,
        "sentence_en": "The software helps businesses optimize their daily workflow and increase productivity.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "این نرم‌افزار به کسب‌وکارها کمک می‌کند تا جریان کار روزانه خود را بهینه کنند و بهره‌وری را افزایش دهند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.549Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.549Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2450,
        "sentence_en": "She decided to confront her fears and try skydiving.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او تصمیم گرفت با ترس‌هایش مواجه شود و چتربازی را امتحان کند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.549Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.549Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2451,
        "sentence_en": "The band plans to release their new album next Friday.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "گروه قصد دارد آلبوم جدید خود را جمعه آینده منتشر کند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.549Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.549Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2452,
        "sentence_en": "The stadium was only partially full for the opening game.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "استادیوم برای بازی افتتاحیه فقط اندکی پر بود.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.550Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.550Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2453,
        "sentence_en": "The two sisters were wearing identical dresses to the party.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "آن دو خواهر لباس‌های همانندی در مهمانی پوشیده بودند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.551Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.551Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2454,
        "sentence_en": "The new smartphone has the capability to take high-quality photos.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "گوشی هوشمند جدید توانایی گرفتن عکس‌های باکیفیت را دارد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.552Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.552Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2455,
        "sentence_en": "Most people consume way too much sugar in their daily diets.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "اکثر مردم در رژیم‌های غذایی روزانه‌شان بیش از حد شکر مصرف می‌کنند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.553Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.553Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2456,
        "sentence_en": "You need to prioritize your tasks to finish everything on time.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "شما باید کارهای خود را اولویت‌بندی کنید تا همه چیز را به موقع تمام کنید.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.553Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.553Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2457,
        "sentence_en": "Changing this file may alter every product page.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "تغییر این فایل ممکن است تمام صفحه های محصول را تغییر دهد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.553Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-06-10T15:41:31.210Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2458,
        "sentence_en": "His response to the question was a bit ambiguous.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "پاسخ او به سوال کمی مبهم بود.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.554Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.554Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2459,
        "sentence_en": "They envision a bright future for their new company.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "آن‌ها آینده درخشانی را برای شرکت جدیدشان مجسم می‌کنند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.554Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.554Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2460,
        "sentence_en": "The mountain stream was famous for its incredible clarity.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "رودخانه کوهستانی به خاطر شفافیت باورنکردنی‌اش مشهور بود.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.555Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.555Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2461,
        "sentence_en": "With such a tight schedule, there will inevitably be a few delays.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "با چنین برنامه فشرده‌ای، به‌ناچار چند تاخیر وجود خواهد داشت.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.555Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.555Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2462,
        "sentence_en": "They are trying to raise awareness about the disease.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "آن‌ها در تلاش هستند تا آگاهی را در مورد این بیماری افزایش دهند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.555Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.555Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2463,
        "sentence_en": "His voice resonated through the empty hallway.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "صدای او در راهروی خالی طنین انداخت.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.556Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.556Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2464,
        "sentence_en": "His latest book captures the struggles of immigrant life.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "آخرین کتاب او دشواری‌های زندگی مهاجران را توصیف می‌کند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.556Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.556Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2465,
        "sentence_en": "The essence of his argument was that we need more funding.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "ماهیت استدلال او این بود که ما به بودجه بیشتری نیاز داریم.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.557Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.557Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2466,
        "sentence_en": "We enjoyed a long lunch on the sun-drenched patio.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "ما از یک ناهار طولانی در ایوان آفتاب‌گیر لذت بردیم.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.557Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.557Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2467,
        "sentence_en": "Filling out all these government forms is a tedious process.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "پر کردن تمام این فرم‌های دولتی یک فرآیند خسته‌کننده است.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.558Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.558Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2468,
        "sentence_en": "The local farm supplies milk to several schools in the area.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "مزرعه محلی شیر را برای چندین مدرسه در منطقه تأمین می‌کند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.558Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.558Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2469,
        "sentence_en": "He announced his intention to run for mayor next year.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او قصد خود را برای نامزدی در انتخابات شهرداری سال آینده اعلام کرد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.558Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.558Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2470,
        "sentence_en": "The politician was accused of abusing his authority for personal gain.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "آن سیاستمدار به سوءاستفاده کردن از مقام خود برای نفع شخصی متهم شد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.558Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.558Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2471,
        "sentence_en": "She decorated her office cubicle with photos and small plants.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او اتاقک دفترش را با عکس‌ها و گیاهان کوچک تزئین کرد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.559Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.559Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2472,
        "sentence_en": "The company has strict policies against racial discrimination in the workplace.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "این شرکت سیاست‌های سخت‌گیرانه‌ای علیه تبعیض نژادی در محیط کار دارد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.559Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.559Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2473,
        "sentence_en": "She dismissed his idea as being completely impractical.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او ایده او را به عنوان امری کاملاً غیرعملی رد کرد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.559Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.559Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2474,
        "sentence_en": "The judge made a fair decision for both parties.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "قاضی یک تصمیم منصفانه برای هر دو طرف گرفت.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.560Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.560Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2475,
        "sentence_en": "He is keen to start his new job next Monday.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او مشتاق است که دوشنبه آینده کار جدیدش را شروع کند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.560Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.560Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2476,
        "sentence_en": "The customer service at that store is absolutely lousy.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "خدمات مشتریان در آن فروشگاه واقعاً افتضاح است.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.560Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.560Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2477,
        "sentence_en": "She possesses a rare talent for playing the violin.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او استعداد کمیابی برای ویولن زدن دارد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.561Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.561Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2478,
        "sentence_en": "You don't have to be so harsh when giving feedback.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "لازم نیست هنگام بازخورد دادن اینقدر خشن باشید.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.561Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.561Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2479,
        "sentence_en": "The doctor warned that the flu is highly contagious this year.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "دکتر هشدار داد که آنفولانزا امسال بسیار مسری است.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.561Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.561Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2480,
        "sentence_en": "He held the small bird gently in his palm.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او پرنده کوچک را به آرامی در کف دستش نگه داشت.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.562Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.562Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2481,
        "sentence_en": "A team of volunteers will assist you with the registration process.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "یک تیم از داوطلبان در فرایند ثبت‌نام به شما کمک خواهند کرد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.562Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.562Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2482,
        "sentence_en": "He didn't have the proper tools to fix the leaky sink.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او ابزار مناسب برای تعمیر سینکی که چکه می‌کرد را نداشت.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.562Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.562Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2483,
        "sentence_en": "She picked up a small blue bead to finish her necklace.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او یک مهره آبی کوچک برداشت تا گردنبندش را تمام کند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.562Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.562Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2484,
        "sentence_en": "We need to refine our marketing strategy before the product launch.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "ما باید استراتژی بازاریابی‌مان را قبل از عرضه محصول اصلاح کنیم.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.563Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.563Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2485,
        "sentence_en": "We had a very pleasant walk through the park this afternoon.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "ما امروز بعدازظهر پیاده‌روی بسیار خوشایندی در پارک داشتیم.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.563Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.563Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2486,
        "sentence_en": "When I nod my head, that's your cue to start talking.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "وقتی سرم را تکان می‌دهم، آن علامت شما برای شروع صحبت است.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.563Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.563Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2487,
        "sentence_en": "He felt a natural affinity with his new colleagues.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او یک رابطه نزدیک طبیعی با همکاران جدیدش احساس کرد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.564Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.564Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2488,
        "sentence_en": "The manager was satisfied with the team's performance this month.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "مدیر از عملکرد تیم در این ماه راضی بود.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.564Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.564Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2489,
        "sentence_en": "The committee will evaluate all the applications before making a final decision.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "کمیته قبل از تصمیم‌گیری نهایی، تمام درخواست‌ها را ارزیابی خواهد کرد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.564Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.564Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2490,
        "sentence_en": "You need to chill out and stop worrying about the exam.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "تو باید آرام باشی و دیگر نگران امتحان نباشی.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.565Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.565Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2491,
        "sentence_en": "Thousands of fans gathered at the arena for the championship game.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "هزاران هوادار برای مسابقه قهرمانی در ورزشگاه جمع شدند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.568Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.568Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2492,
        "sentence_en": "The doctor ordered an ultrasound to check the baby's health.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "دکتر برای بررسی سلامت نوزاد یک سونوگرافی تجویز کرد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.570Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.570Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2493,
        "sentence_en": "The doctor ordered medical imaging to get a better look at my knee.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "دکتر برای بررسی بهتر زانویم دستور تصویرسازی پزشکی داد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.570Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.570Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2494,
        "sentence_en": "The company was sued after they breached the terms of the contract.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "شرکت پس از اینکه شرایط قرارداد را نقض کرد، مورد پیگرد قانونی قرار گرفت.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.571Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.571Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2495,
        "sentence_en": "The penalty for late payment is a fifty-dollar fee.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "جریمه پرداخت دیرکرد یک مبلغ پنجاه دلاری است.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.573Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.573Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2496,
        "sentence_en": "You need to pay the security deposit up front.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "شما باید مبلغ ودیعه را از پیش بپردازید.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.577Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.577Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2497,
        "sentence_en": "The courier delivered the package to my office this morning.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "پیک امروز صبح بسته را به دفتر من تحویل داد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.578Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.578Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2498,
        "sentence_en": "Can you help me lift this heavy box into the car?",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "می‌توانی در بلند کردن این جعبه سنگین در ماشین به من کمک کنی؟",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.579Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.579Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2499,
        "sentence_en": "She turned to her mentor for guidance on her career path.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او برای راهنمایی در مورد مسیر شغلی‌اش به مربی خود مراجعه کرد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.581Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.581Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2500,
        "sentence_en": "The government decided to deploy more police officers to the downtown area.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "دولت تصمیم گرفت ماموران پلیس بیشتری را در منطقه مرکز شهر مستقر کند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.584Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.584Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2501,
        "sentence_en": "The dessert consists of layers of chocolate and cream.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "دسر شامل لایه‌هایی از شکلات و خامه می‌شود.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.587Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.587Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2502,
        "sentence_en": "The insurance company needs to assess the damage to your car.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "شرکت بیمه باید خسارت وارد شده به ماشین شما را ارزیابی کند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.588Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.588Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2503,
        "sentence_en": "He was able to fulfill the task on time.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او توانست آن کار را به موقع انجام دهد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.588Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.588Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2504,
        "sentence_en": "The company was accused of discriminating against older workers.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "این شرکت به تبعیض قائل شدن علیه کارکنان مسن متهم شد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.589Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.589Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2505,
        "sentence_en": "We spent a very agreeable evening walking along the beach.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "ما عصر بسیار دلپذیری را با قدم زدن در کنار ساحل سپری کردیم.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.589Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.589Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2506,
        "sentence_en": "Sending more troops will only escalate the conflict in the region.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "فرستادن نیروهای بیشتر فقط درگیری در منطقه را تشدید خواهد کرد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.590Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.590Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2507,
        "sentence_en": "The manager has the authority to make final decisions.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "مدیر قدرت اتخاذ تصمیمات نهایی را دارد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.590Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.590Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2508,
        "sentence_en": "The company decided to initiate a new training program for employees.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "شرکت تصمیم گرفت یک برنامه آموزشی جدید برای کارکنان شروع کند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.590Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.590Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2509,
        "sentence_en": "She has been working in retail for over five years.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او بیش از پنج سال است که در بخش خرده‌فروشی کار می‌کند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.590Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.590Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2510,
        "sentence_en": "She is a dedicated teacher who cares deeply about her students.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او معلم متعهدی است که عمیقاً به دانش‌آموزانش اهمیت می‌دهد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.591Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.591Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2511,
        "sentence_en": "Her performance in the school play was truly exceptional.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "اجرای او در نمایش مدرسه واقعاً استثنایی بود.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.591Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.591Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2512,
        "sentence_en": "Many students engage in extracurricular activities after school.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "بسیاری از دانش‌آموزان بعد از مدرسه مشغول فعالیت‌های فوق‌برنامه می‌شوند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.595Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.595Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2513,
        "sentence_en": "Her English proficiency helped her get the job.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "مهارت انگلیسی او کمک کرد که شغل را بگیرد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.596Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-06-26T06:56:03.286Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2514,
        "sentence_en": "The elevator is closed today for a routine safety inspection.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "آسانسور امروز برای یک بازرسی ایمنی معمولی بسته است.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.597Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.597Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2515,
        "sentence_en": "The authorities decided to confine the prisoner to a high-security cell.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "مقامات تصمیم گرفتند زندانی را در یک سلول فوق امنیتی حبس کنند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.598Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.598Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2516,
        "sentence_en": "The company suffered a heavy financial loss this year.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "شرکت در سال جاری متحمل ضرر مالی سنگینی شد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.599Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.599Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2517,
        "sentence_en": "The store displays its newest merchandise near the front entrance.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "فروشگاه جدیدترین اجناس خود را نزدیک ورودی اصلی به نمایش می‌گذارد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.599Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.599Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2518,
        "sentence_en": "The heavy fog provided perfect concealment for the escaping soldiers.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "مه سنگین اختفای کاملی برای سربازان فراری فراهم کرد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.600Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.600Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2519,
        "sentence_en": "All medical records are strictly confidential and cannot be shared without consent.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "تمام مدارک پزشکی کاملاً محرمانه هستند و بدون رضایت نمی‌توان آن‌ها را به اشتراک گذاشت.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.600Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.600Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2520,
        "sentence_en": "Having a supportive family is a true blessing in life.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "داشتن یک خانواده حمایتگر یک موهبت واقعی در زندگی است.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.600Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.600Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2521,
        "sentence_en": "You will receive the final payment upon completion of the project.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "شما پرداخت نهایی را پس از اتمام پروژه دریافت خواهید کرد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.601Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.601Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2522,
        "sentence_en": "The small community thrived thanks to the bounty of a wealthy benefactor.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "جامعه کوچک به لطف سخاوت یک خیر ثروتمند رونق گرفت.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.601Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.601Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2523,
        "sentence_en": "The first settlers faced many challenges in the new territory.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "نخستین مهاجران در قلمرو جدید با چالش‌های بسیاری روبرو شدند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.601Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.601Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2524,
        "sentence_en": "The company must comply with all government safety regulations.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "شرکت باید از تمام مقررات ایمنی دولتی پیروی کند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.602Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.602Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2525,
        "sentence_en": "The latest financial projection suggests that the company will grow next year.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "آخرین برآورد مالی نشان می‌دهد که شرکت در سال آینده رشد خواهد کرد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.602Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.602Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2526,
        "sentence_en": "The next 24 hours are critical for the patient's recovery.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "۲۴ ساعت آینده برای بهبودی بیمار بسیار مهم هستند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.603Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.603Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2527,
        "sentence_en": "The cold weather will definitely affect our travel plans this weekend.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "هوای سرد قطعا برنامه‌های سفر ما در این آخر هفته را تحت‌تأثیر قرار خواهد داد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.603Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.603Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2528,
        "sentence_en": "Only the manager can authorize your request for time off.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "فقط مدیر می‌تواند برای درخواست مرخصی شما مجوز بدهد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.603Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.603Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2529,
        "sentence_en": "We are planning a quick weekend getaway to the mountains.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "ما در حال برنامه‌ریزی برای یک تعطیلات کوتاه آخر هفته در کوهستان هستیم.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.603Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.603Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2530,
        "sentence_en": "Reaching one million subscribers was a major milestone for her channel.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "رسیدن به یک میلیون مشترک یک نقطه عطف بزرگ برای کانال او بود.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.604Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.604Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2531,
        "sentence_en": "Only students with a high GPA are eligible for this scholarship.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "تنها دانشجویان با معدل بالا واجد شرایط این بورسیه هستند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.604Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.604Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2532,
        "sentence_en": "Our city is proud to host the international film festival this year.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "شهر ما مفتخر است که امسال میزبان جشنواره بین‌المللی فیلم باشد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.604Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.604Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2533,
        "sentence_en": "Please fill out the application form and return it to the receptionist.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "لطفاً فرم درخواست را تکمیل کنید و آن را به مسئول پذیرش بازگردانید.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.605Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.605Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2534,
        "sentence_en": "You can cast your vote by proxy if you cannot attend the meeting.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "شما می‌توانید از طریق یک نماینده رای بدهید اگر نمی‌توانید در جلسه شرکت کنید.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.605Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.605Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2535,
        "sentence_en": "He felt a moral obligation to tell the truth.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او برای گفتن حقیقت احساس وظیفه اخلاقی می‌کرد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.605Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.605Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2536,
        "sentence_en": "The project will take approximately two weeks to complete.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "تکمیل این پروژه تقریباً دو هفته طول خواهد کشید.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.606Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.606Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2537,
        "sentence_en": "This has been a really tough year for the company.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "این واقعا سال سختی برای شرکت بوده است.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.606Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.606Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2538,
        "sentence_en": "The store needs to restock the shelves before the weekend rush.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "فروشگاه باید قبل از شلوغی آخر هفته به موجودی قفسه‌ها بیفزاید.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.607Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.607Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2539,
        "sentence_en": "The two phones are basically the same except for the color.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "این دو گوشی اساساً یکی هستند، به جز رنگشان.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.607Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.607Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2540,
        "sentence_en": "He has been a regular contributor to the local food bank for years.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او سال‌هاست که اهداکننده دائمی بانک غذای محلی بوده است.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.607Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.607Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2541,
        "sentence_en": "Assuming the weather stays clear, we can have the party outdoors.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "فرض بر اینکه هوا صاف باقی بماند، می‌توانیم مهمانی را در فضای باز برگزار کنیم.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.608Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.608Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2542,
        "sentence_en": "Only an elite group of soldiers is selected for this special mission.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "تنها یک گروه نخبه از سربازان برای این ماموریت ویژه انتخاب می‌شوند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.608Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.608Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2543,
        "sentence_en": "Sheep were grazing peacefully on the green hillside.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "گوسفندان با آرامش در دامنه تپه سرسبز در حال چرا بودند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.609Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.609Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2544,
        "sentence_en": "You can't blame others for your own mistakes.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "تو نمی‌توانی بقیه را برای اشتباهات خودت مقصر بشناسی.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.609Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.609Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2545,
        "sentence_en": "Hundreds of people attended the funeral to pay their last respects.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "صدها نفر برای ادای احترام در مراسم خاک‌سپاری شرکت کردند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.609Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.609Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2546,
        "sentence_en": "The school counselor helped the student deal with his anxiety.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "مشاور مدرسه به دانش‌آموز کمک کرد تا با اضطراب خود کنار بیاید.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.610Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.610Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2547,
        "sentence_en": "The job requires a high level of competency in computer programming.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "این شغل به سطح بالایی از توانمندی در برنامه‌نویسی کامپیوتر نیاز دارد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.610Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.610Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2548,
        "sentence_en": "The corruption trial is scheduled to begin in federal court next Monday.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "محاکمه فساد قرار است دوشنبه آینده در دادگاه فدرال آغاز شود.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.610Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.610Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2549,
        "sentence_en": "He tried to feed me some bullshit about his car breaking down.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او سعی کرد یک سری مزخرف در مورد خراب شدن ماشینش به خوردم بدهد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.611Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.611Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2550,
        "sentence_en": "The businessman hired a couple of thugs to intimidate his competitors.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "آن بازرگان برای ترساندن رقبایش، چند جانی را استخدام کرد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.611Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.611Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2551,
        "sentence_en": "The fragmentation of society makes it difficult to achieve a common goal.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "تکه‌تکه شدن جامعه دستیابی به یک هدف مشترک را دشوار می‌کند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.611Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.611Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2552,
        "sentence_en": "The manager said he would sort out the billing error immediately.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "مدیر گفت که او فوراً به خطای صورت‌حساب رسیدگی خواهد کرد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.612Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.612Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2553,
        "sentence_en": "I need you to be candid with me about the situation.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "من از تو می‌خواهم که در مورد این موقعیت با من رُک باشی.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.612Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.612Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2554,
        "sentence_en": "Several reporters accosted the mayor as he left the building.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "چندین خبرنگار هنگامی که شهردار ساختمان را ترک می‌کرد، او را مورد خطاب قرار دادند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.612Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.612Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2555,
        "sentence_en": "Don't let the older kids bully you at school.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "اجازه نده بچه‌های بزرگتر در مدرسه به تو زورگویی کنند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.613Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.613Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2556,
        "sentence_en": "He suddenly blacked out while standing in line at the bank.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او ناگهان در حالی که در صف بانک ایستاده بود، بیهوش شد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.613Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.613Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2557,
        "sentence_en": "The thick smoke from the fire started to choke everyone in the building.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "دود غلیظ آتش شروع به خفه کردن همه افراد داخل ساختمان کرد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.613Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.613Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2558,
        "sentence_en": "She accepted the job offer without any hesitation.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او بدون هیچ درنگی پیشنهاد کاری را پذیرفت.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.614Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.614Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2559,
        "sentence_en": "We could barely hear the music over the loud noise.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "ما به سختی می‌توانستیم صدای موسیقی را از بین آن سر و صدای زیاد بشنویم.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.614Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.614Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2560,
        "sentence_en": "The city is divided into six different wards for the upcoming election.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "شهر برای انتخابات پیش رو به شش منطقه مختلف تقسیم شده است.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.614Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.614Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2561,
        "sentence_en": "Many religions describe hell as a place of eternal punishment.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "بسیاری از ادیان جهنم را مکانی برای مجازات ابدی توصیف می‌کنند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.615Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.615Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2562,
        "sentence_en": "You can find a copy of the Bible in almost every hotel room.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "شما می‌توانید تقریباً در هر اتاق هتلی یک نسخه از انجیل پیدا کنید.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.615Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-06-26T05:14:05.542Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2563,
        "sentence_en": "I heard an odd noise coming from the basement last night.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "من دیشب صدای غیرعادی‌ای از زیرزمین شنیدم.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.615Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.615Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2564,
        "sentence_en": "The guards are responsible for the safety of every inmate.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "نگهبانان مسئول امنیت هر زندانی هستند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.616Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.616Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2565,
        "sentence_en": "I can assure you that everything is under control.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "من می‌توانم به شما اطمینان دهم که همه چیز تحت کنترل است.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.616Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.616Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2566,
        "sentence_en": "The witnesses gave conflicting reports about the accident.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "شاهدان گزارش‌های متناقضی درباره تصادف ارائه کردند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.616Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.616Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2567,
        "sentence_en": "The X-ray showed a small fracture in his wrist.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "عکس رادیولوژی یک شکستگی کوچک را در مچ دست او نشان داد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.617Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.617Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2568,
        "sentence_en": "The doctors are monitoring him after he experienced a psychotic break.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "پزشکان پس از اینکه او یک حمله روانی را تجربه کرد، او را تحت نظر دارند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.617Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.617Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2569,
        "sentence_en": "You will regret your decision to quit your job without a plan.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "تو از تصمیمت برای ترک کارت بدون داشتن نقشه پشیمان خواهی شد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.617Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.617Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2570,
        "sentence_en": "We have been close pals since we were kids.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "ما از وقتی بچه بودیم رفیق‌های صمیمی بوده‌ایم.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.618Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.618Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2571,
        "sentence_en": "You should take your medication with a glass of water.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "شما باید داروی خود را با یک لیوان آب بخورید.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.618Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.618Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2572,
        "sentence_en": "It’s absolute insanity to drive in this heavy snow.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "رانندگی در این برف سنگین دیوانگی مطلق است.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.618Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.618Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2573,
        "sentence_en": "The jury eventually found him innocent of all the charges.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "هیئت منصفه در نهایت او را از تمام اتهامات بی‌گناه دانست.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.619Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.619Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2574,
        "sentence_en": "She is willing to work overtime to finish the project.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او مایل است برای تمام کردن پروژه اضافه‌کاری کند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.619Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.619Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2575,
        "sentence_en": "My bro is coming over to help me move this weekend.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "برادر من آخر این هفته می‌آید تا برای جابه‌جایی به من کمک کند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.619Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.619Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2576,
        "sentence_en": "She was unafraid to speak her mind during the meeting.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او برای بیان نظرش در طول جلسه نترس بود.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.620Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.620Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2577,
        "sentence_en": "I somehow feel like we have met each other before.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "یه‌جورایی حس می‌کنم ما قبلاً همدیگر را دیده‌ایم.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.620Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.620Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2578,
        "sentence_en": "She tried to hide her sorrow behind a forced smile.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او سعی کرد غم خود را پشت یک لبخند اجباری پنهان کند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.620Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.620Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2579,
        "sentence_en": "He promised that he would never desert his family in a crisis.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او قول داد که هرگز خانواده‌اش را در یک بحران رها نکند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.621Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.621Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2580,
        "sentence_en": "The company issued a formal statement regarding the recent merger.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "شرکت یک بیانیه رسمی در مورد ادغام اخیر صادر کرد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.621Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.621Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2581,
        "sentence_en": "The local press gave the event a lot of coverage.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "مطبوعات محلی پوشش زیادی به این رویداد دادند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.621Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.621Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2582,
        "sentence_en": "Can you hang on for a second? I'm almost ready.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "می‌توانی یک ثانیه صبر کنی؟ من تقریبا حاضر هستم.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.622Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.622Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2583,
        "sentence_en": "The farmers built a wooden barrier to keep the animals inside.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "کشاورزان برای نگه داشتن حیوانات در داخل، یک حصار چوبی ساختند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.622Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.622Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2584,
        "sentence_en": "He stayed home from work today because he was sick.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او امروز چون بیمار بود سر کار نرفت.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.622Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.622Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2585,
        "sentence_en": "Many cultures believe that the human soul is immortal.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "بسیاری از فرهنگ‌ها بر این باورند که روح انسان جاودان است.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.623Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.623Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2586,
        "sentence_en": "He always plays the villain in these superhero movies.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او همیشه در این فیلم‌های ابرقهرمانی نقش آدم شرور را بازی می‌کند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.623Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.623Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2587,
        "sentence_en": "The local market was teeming with people early in the morning.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "بازار محلی در اوایل صبح سرشار از جمعیت بود.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.624Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.624Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2588,
        "sentence_en": "He is a decent chap who always helps his neighbors.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او مرد شریفی است که همیشه به همسایه‌هایش کمک می‌کند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.624Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.624Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2589,
        "sentence_en": "The instructions were easy to follow.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "دنبال کردن دستورالعمل‌ها ساده بود.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.624Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.624Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2590,
        "sentence_en": "The whole gang is coming over to watch the game tonight.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "تمام گروه امشب برای تماشای بازی به اینجا می‌آیند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.625Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.625Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2591,
        "sentence_en": "He went on a hiking trip with an old school chum.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او با یک دوست قدیمی دوران مدرسه به سفر پیاده‌روی رفت.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.626Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.626Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2592,
        "sentence_en": "The new museum will attract a lot of tourists to the city.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "موزه جدید گردشگران زیادی را به شهر جذب خواهد کرد",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.626Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.626Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2593,
        "sentence_en": "We found some dusty old boxes in the attic.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "ما چند جعبه قدیمی غبارآلود در زیرشیروانی پیدا کردیم.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.626Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.626Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2594,
        "sentence_en": "I had to traipse all over the mall to find a specific gift.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "مجبور بودم برای پیدا کردن یک هدیه خاص کل مرکز خرید را با زحمت راه بروم.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.627Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.627Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2595,
        "sentence_en": "The new gal in the office is very friendly to everyone.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "آن دختر جدید در دفتر با همه بسیار دوستانه است.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.627Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.627Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2596,
        "sentence_en": "He has a very cavalier attitude toward the safety of his employees.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او نسبت به امنیت کارمندان خود رفتار بسیار بی‌توجهی دارد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.627Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.627Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2597,
        "sentence_en": "The victims suffered horrific injuries in the fire.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "قربانیان در آتش‌سوزی دچار جراحات وحشتناکی شدند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.628Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.628Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2598,
        "sentence_en": "The cake turned out much better than I had expected.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "کیک خیلی بهتر از آن چیزی که انتظار داشتم از آب درآمد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.628Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.628Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2599,
        "sentence_en": "He tried to goad his brother into starting a fight.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او سعی کرد برادرش را به شروع یک دعوا تحریک کند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.628Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.628Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2600,
        "sentence_en": "The manager was impressed with his performance during the presentation.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "مدیر از عملکرد او در طول ارائه تحت تأثیر قرار گرفت.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.629Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.629Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2601,
        "sentence_en": "His natural charm made everyone at the party feel welcome.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "جذابیت طبیعی او باعث شد همه در مهمانی احساس خوش‌آمدگویی کنند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.629Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.629Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2602,
        "sentence_en": "The salesman beguiled the elderly couple into signing the contract.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "فروشنده زوج مسن را فریب داد تا قرارداد را امضا کنند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.629Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.629Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2603,
        "sentence_en": "\"Don't leave me here alone,\" she whimpered as the door closed.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او در حالی که در بسته می‌شد با گریه گفت: «من را اینجا تنها نگذار».",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.629Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.629Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2604,
        "sentence_en": "The singer's beautiful voice bewitched the audience during the performance.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "صدای زیبای خواننده در طول اجرا تماشاگران را مسحور کرد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.630Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.630Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2605,
        "sentence_en": "The tourists looked completely bewildered by the city's complex subway system.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "گردشگران از سیستم پیچیده متروی شهر کاملاً گیج شده بودند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.630Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.630Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2606,
        "sentence_en": "I felt like such an idiot when I realized my mistake.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "وقتی متوجه اشتباهم شدم، حس کردم یک آدم احمق هستم.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.631Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.631Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2607,
        "sentence_en": "She sighed with relief when she heard the news.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او وقتی خبر را شنید با آسودگی آه کشید.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.632Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.632Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2608,
        "sentence_en": "He has always been an honorable man who keeps his word.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او همیشه مرد شریفی بوده است که به قولش پایبند است.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.632Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.632Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2609,
        "sentence_en": "The judge will preside over the hearing next week.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "قاضی هفته آینده جلسه دادرسی را اداره خواهد کرد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.633Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.633Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2610,
        "sentence_en": "The jury will select the winner of the singing competition.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "هیئت داوران برنده مسابقه آواز را انتخاب خواهد کرد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.636Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.636Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2611,
        "sentence_en": "Everyone stood up when His Majesty entered the room.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "وقتی اعلیحضرت وارد اتاق شدند، همه بلند شدند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.640Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.640Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2612,
        "sentence_en": "I don't know how you can tolerate that loud noise all day.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "نمی‌دانم چطور می‌توانی آن صدای بلند را تمام روز تحمل کنی.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.640Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.640Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2613,
        "sentence_en": "The police have enough evidence to arrest the suspect.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "پلیس مدرک کافی برای دستگیری مظنون را دارد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.641Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.641Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2614,
        "sentence_en": "Many people suffer from chronic back pain every day.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "بسیاری از مردم هر روز از کمردرد مزمن رنج می‌کشند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.641Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.641Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2615,
        "sentence_en": "The doctor is treating her for a rare blood disorder.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "دکتر در حال درمان او برای یک اختلال خونی نادر است.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.641Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.641Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2616,
        "sentence_en": "He tried to dissociate himself from the group's controversial decisions.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او سعی کرد خودش را از تصمیمات جنجالی گروه جدا کند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.642Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.642Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2617,
        "sentence_en": "I received an email concerning the new project timeline.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "من ایمیلی درباره جدول زمانی پروژه جدید دریافت کردم.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.642Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.642Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2618,
        "sentence_en": "The doctor explained that the disease is not contagious.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "دکتر توضیح داد که این بیماری واگیردار نیست.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.642Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.642Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2619,
        "sentence_en": "The company recalled the car because of a safety defect.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "شرکت خودرو را به دلیل یک نقص ایمنی فراخواند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.643Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.643Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2620,
        "sentence_en": "The exam was relatively easy for most students.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "امتحان برای بیشتر دانش‌آموزان نسبتاً آسان بود.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.643Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.643Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2621,
        "sentence_en": "I am sorry to disturb you, but do you have a moment?",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "ببخشید که مزاحم شما می‌شوم، اما آیا یک لحظه وقت دارید؟",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.644Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.644Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2622,
        "sentence_en": "The police are looking for a witness to the bank robbery.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "پلیس به دنبال یک شاهد برای سرقت از بانک است.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.644Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.644Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2623,
        "sentence_en": "The story is a perfect blend of reality and fantasy.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "داستان ترکیبی بی‌نقص از واقعیت و خیال است.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.644Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.644Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2624,
        "sentence_en": "The company's computer system is vulnerable to hackers.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "سیستم کامپیوتری شرکت در برابر هکرها آسیب‌پذیر است.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.645Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.645Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2625,
        "sentence_en": "The neighborhood kids used to torment my dog with sticks.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "بچه‌های محله با چوب سگ مرا آزار می‌دادند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.645Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.645Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2626,
        "sentence_en": "The Supreme Court decided to overrule the lower court's decision.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "دیوان عالی تصمیم گرفت حکم دادگاه پایین‌تر را ملغی کند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.645Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.645Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2627,
        "sentence_en": "After the short break, we were ready to proceed with the meeting.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "بعد از وقفه کوتاه، ما آماده بودیم تا با جلسه پیش برویم.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.646Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.646Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2628,
        "sentence_en": "Don't obsess over things you cannot control.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "دیوانه چیزهایی که نمی‌توانی کنترل کنی نباش.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.646Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.646Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2629,
        "sentence_en": "He was arrested after he tried to stab a man with a kitchen knife.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او پس از آنکه سعی کرد با یک چاقوی آشپزخانه به مردی چاقو بزند، دستگیر شد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.647Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.647Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2630,
        "sentence_en": "She was sneaking out the back door to avoid her boss.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او برای اینکه با رئیسش روبرو نشود پنهانی از در پشتی خارج می‌شد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.647Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.647Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2631,
        "sentence_en": "Her sudden change in behavior aroused suspicion among her colleagues.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "تغییر ناگهانی در رفتار او باعث ایجاد شک در بین همکارانش شد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.648Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.648Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2632,
        "sentence_en": "He agreed to testify against his former boss in the trial.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او موافقت کرد که در دادگاه علیه رئیس سابقش شهادت بدهد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.648Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.648Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2633,
        "sentence_en": "The witness received a subpoena to appear in court next Tuesday.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "شاهد برای حضور در دادگاه در سه‌شنبه آینده، یک احضاریه دریافت کرد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.648Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.648Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2634,
        "sentence_en": "He was arrested for harassing his neighbors late at night.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او به دلیل اذیت کردن همسایه‌هایش در اواخر شب بازداشت شد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.649Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.649Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2635,
        "sentence_en": "You must comply with the safety regulations at all times.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "شما باید همیشه از مقررات ایمنی پیروی کنید.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.649Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.649Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2636,
        "sentence_en": "He threatened to call the police if they didn't leave.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او تهدید کرد که اگر آن‌ها آنجا را ترک نکنند، به پلیس زنگ می‌زند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.649Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.649Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2637,
        "sentence_en": "He has worked at this financial institution for ten years.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او به مدت ده سال در این موسسه مالی کار کرده است.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.650Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.650Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2638,
        "sentence_en": "The office jester always knows how to lighten the mood during meetings.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "آدم شوخ اداره همیشه می‌داند که چطور در طول جلسات جو را شاد کند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.650Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.650Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2639,
        "sentence_en": "No one knows what fate has in store for us.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "هیچ‌کس نمی‌داند سرنوشت چه چیزی برای ما در نظر گرفته است.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.650Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.650Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2640,
        "sentence_en": "The company had to fire several employees due to budget cuts.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "شرکت مجبور شد چندین کارمند را به دلیل کاهش بودجه اخراج کند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.651Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.651Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2641,
        "sentence_en": "We are monitoring the latest developments in the peace negotiations.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "ما در حال نظارت بر آخرین تحولات در مذاکرات صلح هستیم.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.651Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.651Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2642,
        "sentence_en": "The house was extensively renovated before we moved in.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "خانه قبل از اینکه اسباب‌کشی کنیم به طور گسترده بازسازی شد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.651Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.651Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2643,
        "sentence_en": "You should speak to an attorney before signing the contract.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "شما باید قبل از امضای قرارداد با یک وکیل صحبت کنید.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.652Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.652Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2644,
        "sentence_en": "The movie tells the tragic story of two long-lost friends.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "این فیلم داستان غم‌انگیز دو دوست قدیمی که سال‌ها از هم بی‌خبر بودند را روایت می‌کند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.652Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-05-05T07:51:31.226Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2645,
        "sentence_en": "The mayor promised to fix the roads before the next election.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "شهردار قول داد جاده‌ها را پیش از انتخابات بعدی تعمیر کند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.652Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.652Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2646,
        "sentence_en": "The helmet is designed to protect your skull from a serious injury.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "کلاه ایمنی برای محافظت از جمجمه شما در برابر جراحت جدی طراحی شده است.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.653Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.653Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2647,
        "sentence_en": "The court's decision set a precedent for all future civil rights cases.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "تصمیم دادگاه یک سابقه برای تمام پرونده‌های حقوق مدنی در آینده ایجاد کرد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.653Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.653Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2648,
        "sentence_en": "He promised solemnly that he would never lie to her again.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او خیلی جدی قول داد که دیگر هرگز به او دروغ نگوید.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.653Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.653Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2649,
        "sentence_en": "He accidentally bashed his knee against the corner of the table.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او به طور اتفاقی زانویش را به گوشه میز کوبید.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.654Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.654Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2650,
        "sentence_en": "The witness took an oath to tell the truth in court.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "شاهد برای گفتن حقیقت در دادگاه قسم خورد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.654Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.654Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2651,
        "sentence_en": "Never underestimate the importance of getting enough sleep every night.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "هرگز اهمیت خواب کافی در هر شب را دست کم نگیرید.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.654Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.654Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2652,
        "sentence_en": "She has a real flair for languages and speaks four fluently.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او استعداد واقعی در زبان‌ها دارد و به چهار زبان روان صحبت می‌کند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.655Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.655Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2653,
        "sentence_en": "The dog gave the leash a sudden tug when he saw the cat.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "سگ وقتی گربه را دید، قلاده را ناگهان با زور کشید.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.655Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.655Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2654,
        "sentence_en": "She made up a quick excuse to leave the party early.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او برای زود ترک کردن مهمانی یک بهانه سریع جور کرد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.655Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.655Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2655,
        "sentence_en": "I'd like to thank all the folks who helped out today.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "دوست دارم از تمام مردمی که امروز کمک کردند تشکر کنم.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.656Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.656Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2656,
        "sentence_en": "The jury had enough evidence to convict him of the robbery.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "هیئت منصفه مدارک کافی برای محکوم کردن او بابت سرقت داشت.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.656Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.656Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2657,
        "sentence_en": "The police busted him for shoplifting at the local mall.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "پلیس او را به خاطر بلند کردن اجناس از فروشگاه محلی دستگیر کرد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.656Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.656Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2658,
        "sentence_en": "I don't know who that fella is, but he looks familiar.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "نمی‌دونم اون یارو کیه، ولی قیافه‌اش آشناست.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.657Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.657Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2659,
        "sentence_en": "He started to rant about the poor service at the restaurant.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او شروع کرد به داد و بیداد کردن در مورد سرویس‌دهی ضعیف رستوران.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.657Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.657Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2660,
        "sentence_en": "He used a heavy blanket to smother the small kitchen fire.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او از یک پتوی سنگین برای خفه کردن آتش کوچک آشپزخانه استفاده کرد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.657Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.657Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2661,
        "sentence_en": "The jury reached a verdict after hours of deliberation.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "هیئت منصفه پس از ساعت‌ها مشورت به یک حکم رسید.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.658Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.658Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2662,
        "sentence_en": "The growing tension between the two departments affected their productivity.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "تنش رو به رشد بین این دو بخش بر بهره‌وری آن‌ها تأثیر گذاشت.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.658Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.658Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2663,
        "sentence_en": "The company faces mounting pressure to reduce its expenses.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "شرکت با فشاری در حال رشد برای کاهش هزینه‌هایش مواجه است.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.658Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.658Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2664,
        "sentence_en": "His sudden outburst of anger surprised everyone in the meeting.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "فوران ناگهانی خشم او همه را در جلسه غافلگیر کرد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.659Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.659Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2665,
        "sentence_en": "A devastating fire swept through the forest last night.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "دیشب یک آتش‌سوزی ویرانگر کل جنگل را فرا گرفت.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.659Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.659Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2666,
        "sentence_en": "The company suffered a massive loss during the economic crisis.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "شرکت در طول بحران اقتصادی دچار ضرر عظیمی شد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.660Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.660Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2667,
        "sentence_en": "They survived the car accident by the grace of God.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "آن‌ها با موهبت خدا از تصادف رانندگی جان سالم به در بردند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.660Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.660Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2668,
        "sentence_en": "The team's success is a testimony to their hard work.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "موفقیت تیم تصدیقی بر سخت‌کوشی آن‌ها است.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.660Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.660Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2669,
        "sentence_en": "Please mind your business and let me handle this situation alone.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "لطفاً به کار خودت برس و بگذار من خودم این وضعیت را مدیریت کنم.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.661Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.661Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2670,
        "sentence_en": "She peeled a sweet tangerine and shared several segments with me.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او یک نارنگی شیرین را پوست کند و چندین تکه را با من تقسیم کرد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.661Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.661Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2671,
        "sentence_en": "Could you pass me the stapler so I can finish this report?",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "می‌شه منگنه رو به من بدی تا بتونم این گزارش رو تموم کنم؟",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.661Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.661Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2672,
        "sentence_en": "Can you pass me the nail polish remover and some cotton balls?",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "می‌توانی لاک پاک‌کن و چند تکه پنبه را به من بدهی؟",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.662Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.662Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2673,
        "sentence_en": "He pulled a crisp five-dollar banknote out of his wallet.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او یک اسکناس پنج دلاری تانخورده از کیف پولش بیرون آورد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.662Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.662Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2674,
        "sentence_en": "I like to add fresh lettuce and tomatoes to my turkey sandwich.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "من دوست دارم به ساندویچ بوقلمونم کاهو و گوجه‌فرنگی تازه اضافه کنم.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.662Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.662Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2675,
        "sentence_en": "She chopped up some cabbage to make a fresh salad for dinner.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او مقداری کلم خرد کرد تا یک سالاد تازه برای شام درست کند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.663Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.663Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2676,
        "sentence_en": "She spends a lot of money on clothes every month.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او هر ماه پول زیادی برای لباس خرج می‌کند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.663Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.663Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2677,
        "sentence_en": "By and large, the new restaurant has received positive reviews.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "روی هم رفته، رستوران جدید نقدهای مثبتی دریافت کرده است.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.663Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.663Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2678,
        "sentence_en": "They arrived back home safe and sound after the long journey.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "آن‌ها پس از سفر طولانی، امن و امان به خانه بازگشتند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.664Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.664Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2679,
        "sentence_en": "We still see our old college friends every now and then.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "ما هنوز دوستان قدیمی دانشگاه‌مان را گاهی می‌بینیم.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.664Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.664Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2680,
        "sentence_en": "We finally fixed the software through a process of trial and error.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "ما در نهایت با فرآیند آزمون و خطا نرم‌افزار را درست کردیم.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.664Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.664Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2681,
        "sentence_en": "In any healthy relationship, there has to be some give and take.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "در هر رابطه سالمی، باید مقداری بده‌بستان وجود داشته باشد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.665Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.665Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2682,
        "sentence_en": "We need to weigh the pros and cons before making a decision.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "ما باید پیش از تصمیم‌گیری، جنبه‌های مثبت و منفی را بسنجیم.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.666Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.666Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2683,
        "sentence_en": "Please make sure your workspace is neat and tidy before you leave.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "لطفاً قبل از اینکه بروید، مطمئن شوید که فضای کارتان تمیز و مرتب است.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.666Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.666Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2684,
        "sentence_en": "He is without doubt the best player on the team.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او بی‌شک بهترین بازیکن تیم است.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.667Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.667Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2685,
        "sentence_en": "The suitcase weighs exactly fifty pounds.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "چمدان دقیقاً پنجاه پوند وزن دارد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.667Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.667Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2686,
        "sentence_en": "The weight of the box made it difficult to carry upstairs.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "وزن جعبه باعث شد حمل آن به طبقه بالا سخت شود.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.667Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.667Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2687,
        "sentence_en": "Please speak up so everyone in the back can hear you.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "لطفاً بلندتر حرف بزنید تا همه در عقب بتوانند صدایتان را بشنوند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.668Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.668Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2688,
        "sentence_en": "I accidentally wore my sweater inside out all day long.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "من تمام روز به اشتباه پلیورم را پشت و رو پوشیدم.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.668Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.668Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2689,
        "sentence_en": "He held the map upside down and got completely lost.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او نقشه را سروته گرفت و کاملاً گم شد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.668Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.668Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2690,
        "sentence_en": "He adjusted his shirt collar before walking into the interview.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او قبل از وارد شدن به مصاحبه، یقه پیراهنش را مرتب کرد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.669Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.669Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2691,
        "sentence_en": "My alarm clock goes off at six every morning.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "ساعت زنگ‌دار من هر روز صبح ساعت شش به صدا در می‌آید.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.669Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.669Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2692,
        "sentence_en": "I always make the bed as soon as I wake up.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "من همیشه به محض اینکه از خواب بیدار می‌شوم تختخواب را مرتب می‌کنم.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.669Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.669Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2693,
        "sentence_en": "Could you help me set the table for dinner?",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "می‌توانی در چیدن میز غذا برای شام به من کمک کنی؟",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.670Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.670Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2694,
        "sentence_en": "I need to iron this shirt to get the wrinkles out.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "باید این پیراهن را اتو کنم تا چروک‌هایش را از بین ببرم.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.670Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.670Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2695,
        "sentence_en": "The doctor needs to run some tests to see what's wrong.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "دکتر باید چند تا آزمایش بگیرد تا ببیند مشکل چیست.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.670Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.670Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2696,
        "sentence_en": "I have to run some errands before we head to the airport.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "من باید قبل از اینکه به سمت فرودگاه برویم، چند تا کار انجام دهم.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.671Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.671Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2697,
        "sentence_en": "He’s always a bit grumpy in the morning before his coffee.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او همیشه صبح‌ها قبل از قهوه‌اش کمی بدخلق است.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.671Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.671Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2698,
        "sentence_en": "You shouldn't neglect your health just because you are busy at work.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "نباید فقط به خاطر مشغله زیاد در کار، در رسیدگی به سلامتی خود کوتاهی کنید.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.671Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.671Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2699,
        "sentence_en": "The doctor had to break the news to the family gently.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "دکتر مجبور شد خبر بد را با ملایمت به خانواده بگوید.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.672Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.672Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2700,
        "sentence_en": "The new puppy is absolutely adorable.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "توله‌سگ جدید واقعاً دوست‌داشتنی است.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.672Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.672Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2701,
        "sentence_en": "The town looked very festive with all the holiday lights and decorations.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "شهر با تمام چراغ‌ها و تزئینات تعطیلات بسیار جشنی به نظر می‌رسید.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.672Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.672Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2702,
        "sentence_en": "The burger was served on a fresh, toasted bun.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "همبرگر روی یک نان گرد تازه و برشته سرو شد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.672Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-24T04:24:15.462Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2703,
        "sentence_en": "The chef slow-cooked the rib until it was perfectly tender.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "سرآشپز گوشت دنده را آنقدر آرام پخت تا کاملاً ترد شد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.673Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.673Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2704,
        "sentence_en": "He used to haunt that old coffee shop during his college years.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او در دوران کالجش در آن کافی‌شاپ قدیمی پاتوق می‌کرد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.673Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.673Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2705,
        "sentence_en": "The abandoned house at the end of the street looks really spooky at night.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "خانه متروکه انتهای خیابان در شب واقعاً ترسناک به نظر می‌رسد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.673Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.673Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2706,
        "sentence_en": "She doesn't like to sit idle while everyone else is working.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او دوست ندارد در حالی که بقیه کار می‌کنند، بیکار بنشیند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.674Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.674Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2707,
        "sentence_en": "Wearing a mask helps prevent the transmission of the virus.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "استفاده از ماسک به جلوگیری از انتقال ویروس کمک می‌کند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.674Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.674Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2708,
        "sentence_en": "You need to provide a valid driver's license to rent the car.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "برای اجاره کردن ماشین باید یک گواهینامه رانندگی معتبر ارائه دهید.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.674Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.674Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2709,
        "sentence_en": "The bank's appraisal of the house was lower than we expected.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "ارزیابی بانک از خانه پایین‌تر از حد انتظار ما بود.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.675Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.675Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2710,
        "sentence_en": "We stayed in a dinky little hotel room during our vacation.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "ما در طول تعطیلاتمان در یک اتاق هتل کوچک اقامت کردیم.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.675Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.675Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2711,
        "sentence_en": "The cavalry officer drew his saber during the formal parade.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "افسر سواره‌نظام در طول رژه رسمی شمشیر خود را کشید.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.675Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.675Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2712,
        "sentence_en": "She loves wearing vintage dresses she finds at local thrift stores.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او عاشق پوشیدن لباس‌های سبک قدیمی است که در مغازه‌های دست‌دوم‌فروشی محلی پیدا می‌کند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.676Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.676Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2713,
        "sentence_en": "The grandmother kept her sewing supplies in an old cookie tin.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "مادربزرگ لوازم خیاطی‌اش را در یک قوطی قدیمی کوکی نگه می‌داشت.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.676Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.676Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2714,
        "sentence_en": "He has traveled to almost every corner of the globe.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او به تقریباً تمام گوشه و کنار کره زمین سفر کرده است.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.677Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.677Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2715,
        "sentence_en": "He spent several years serving at a naval base in California.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او چندین سال را به خدمت در یک پایگاه وابسته به نیروی دریایی در کالیفرنیا گذراند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.677Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.677Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2716,
        "sentence_en": "She wore a beautiful gold brooch on her coat.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او یک سنجاق سینه طلایی زیبا روی کتش زده بود.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.678Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.678Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2717,
        "sentence_en": "The sticky residue from the label was hard to remove.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "باقی‌مانده‌ی چسبناک برچسب به سختی پاک می‌شد.",
