        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.678Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2718,
        "sentence_en": "They polished the silverware before the guests arrived for dinner.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "آن‌ها پیش از رسیدن مهمان‌ها برای شام، ظروف نقره را برق انداختند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.678Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.678Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2719,
        "sentence_en": "She placed a tall brass candlestick in the middle of the table.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او یک شمعدان برنجی بلند را در وسط میز قرار داد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.679Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.679Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2720,
        "sentence_en": "The team earned a trophy for winning the championship game.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "تیم برای برنده شدن در مسابقه قهرمانی یک جایزه به دست آورد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.679Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.679Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2721,
        "sentence_en": "He lived a life of luxury after winning the lottery.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او پس از برنده شدن در بخت‌آزمایی در تجمل زندگی کرد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.679Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.679Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2722,
        "sentence_en": "It is hard to buy a house without a steady income.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "خرید خانه بدون یک درآمد ثابت سخت است.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.680Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.680Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2723,
        "sentence_en": "If the problem recurs, we will have to start over.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "اگر مشکل تکرار شود، مجبور خواهیم شد از اول شروع کنیم.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.680Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.680Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2724,
        "sentence_en": "She always tries to stay upbeat and positive despite the challenges.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او همیشه سعی می‌کند علیرغم چالش‌ها، شاد و مثبت بماند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.680Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.680Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2725,
        "sentence_en": "I decided to take an intensive Spanish course this summer.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "من تصمیم گرفتم تابستان امسال در یک دوره فشرده زبان اسپانیایی شرکت کنم.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.681Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.681Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2726,
        "sentence_en": "He decided to skive off work to go to the beach.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او تصمیم گرفت برای رفتن به ساحل از سر کار جیم بزند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.681Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.681Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2727,
        "sentence_en": "The origin of the fire is still under investigation.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "منشأ آتش‌سوزی هنوز در حال بررسی است.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.681Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.681Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2728,
        "sentence_en": "He carried a heavy sack of potatoes into the kitchen.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او یک گونی سنگین سیب‌زمینی را به داخل آشپزخانه برد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.682Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.682Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2729,
        "sentence_en": "Cleaning the entire warehouse proved to be an arduous task.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "تمیز کردن کل انبار کار دشواری بود",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.682Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.682Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2730,
        "sentence_en": "She was assiduous in her research, checking every single source carefully.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او در تحقیقاتش سخت‌کوش بود و تک‌تک منابع را با دقت بررسی می‌کرد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.691Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.691Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2731,
        "sentence_en": "The company signed a lucrative contract with a major retailer.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "شرکت یک قرارداد پرمنفعت با یک خرده‌فروش بزرگ امضا کرد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.693Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.693Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2732,
        "sentence_en": "There is still a social stigma attached to seeking mental health help.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "هنوز یک خفت اجتماعی در رابطه با کمک گرفتن برای سلامت روان وجود دارد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.697Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.697Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2733,
        "sentence_en": "We need to exploit every resource we have to finish the project.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "ما باید برای تمام کردن پروژه از تمام منابعی که داریم استفاده کنیم.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.698Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.698Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2734,
        "sentence_en": "The sudden blizzard made it impossible to see the road ahead.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "کولاک ناگهانی دیدن جاده پیش رو را غیرممکن کرد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.701Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.701Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2735,
        "sentence_en": "The sudden storm brought large hail that damaged several cars.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "طوفان ناگهانی تگرگ درشتی آورد که به چندین ماشین آسیب رساند.",
