        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.714Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2750,
        "sentence_en": "I didn't mean to embarrass you in front of your friends.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "قصد نداشتم تو را مقابل دوستانت شرمنده کنم.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.714Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.714Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2751,
        "sentence_en": "He dropped a single sugar cube into his cup of black coffee.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او یک عدد قند حبه‌ای را در فنجان قهوه تلخ خود انداخت.",
