        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.717Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2759,
        "sentence_en": "The country's central bank is responsible for its monetary policy.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "بانک مرکزی کشور مسئول سیاست مالی آن است.",
