        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.718Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2763,
        "sentence_en": "If you have any questions, please don't hesitate to ask me.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "اگر سوالی داری، لطفاً در پرسیدن آن تردید نکن.",
