        "sentence_en": "The surgeon will perform the operation tomorrow morning.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "جراح فردا صبح عمل را انجام خواهد داد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.722Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.722Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2773,
        "sentence_en": "Attendance at the meeting is mandatory for all employees.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "شرکت در جلسه برای تمام کارکنان اجباری است.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.723Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.723Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2774,
        "sentence_en": "Our decision was based on pure guesswork rather than facts.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "تصمیم ما به جای حقایق، بر اساس حدس محض بود.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.723Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.723Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2775,
        "sentence_en": "He was arrested for leaking classified information to the press.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او به دلیل درز اطلاعات طبقه‌بندی‌شده به مطبوعات دستگیر شد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.723Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.723Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2776,
        "sentence_en": "Can you drop me off at the train station on your way home?",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "می‌توانی در راه خانه من را به ایستگاه قطار برسانی؟",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.724Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.724Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2777,
        "sentence_en": "The theory is interesting, but it isn't applicable to real-life situations.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "این تئوری جالب است، اما در موقعیت‌های واقعی زندگی کاربردی نیست.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.724Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.724Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2778,
        "sentence_en": "I need a longer cord for my phone charger.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "من به یک سیم بلندتر برای شارژر گوشی‌ام نیاز دارم.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.725Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.725Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2779,
        "sentence_en": "It's hard to concentrate on my work with all this noise.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "با این‌همه سر و صدا، تمرکز کردن روی کارم سخت است.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.725Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.725Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2780,
        "sentence_en": "Please adjust the nozzle so the water comes out in a mist.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "لطفاً سر شلنگ را تنظیم کن تا آب به صورت مه بیرون بیاید.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.729Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.729Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2781,
        "sentence_en": "The skilled craftsman spent months carving the wooden table by hand.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "این صنعت‌کار ماهر ماه‌ها زمان صرف کرد تا میز چوبی را با دست حکاکی کند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.731Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.731Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2782,
        "sentence_en": "The stars were brilliant in the clear night sky.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "ستاره‌ها در آسمان صاف شب درخشان بودند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.736Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.736Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2783,
        "sentence_en": "How would you rate your stay at our hotel?",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "اقامت خود در هتل ما را چگونه ارزیابی می‌کنید؟",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.738Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.738Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2784,
        "sentence_en": "The frequent oscillation of stock prices makes investors nervous.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "نوسان مکرر قیمت سهام، سرمایه‌گذاران را عصبی می‌کند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.739Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-06-26T05:21:21.903Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2785,
        "sentence_en": "She received a significant salary increment after her performance review.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او پس از ارزیابی عملکردش افزایش حقوق قابل‌توجهی دریافت کرد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.741Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.741Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2786,
        "sentence_en": "Opening the windows will improve the air circulation in this room.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "باز کردن پنجره‌ها جریان هوا را در این اتاق بهبود می‌بخشد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.749Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.749Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2787,
        "sentence_en": "He had to tighten the valve to stop the gas leak.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او مجبور شد برای متوقف کردن نشت گاز، شیر را سفت کند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.750Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.750Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2789,
        "sentence_en": "The baby laughed when I rubbed his belly.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "بچه وقتی شکمش را مالش دادم خندید.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.750Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.750Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2790,
        "sentence_en": "The toddler rubbed his tummy after eating a big bowl of pasta.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "کودک نوپا بعد از خوردن یک کاسه بزرگ پاستا، شکمش را مالش داد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.751Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.751Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2791,
        "sentence_en": "The hospital is known for its pioneering work in heart surgery.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "این بیمارستان به خاطر فعالیت‌های پیشگام خود در جراحی قلب معروف است.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.751Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.751Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2792,
        "sentence_en": "There wasn't a single particle of dust on the table.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "حتی یک ذره گرد و غبار روی میز نبود.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.751Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.751Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2793,
        "sentence_en": "The vacuum cleaner has lost its suction after years of use.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "جاروبرقی بعد از سال‌ها استفاده مکش خود را از دست داده است.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.752Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.752Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2794,
        "sentence_en": "He finally revealed his secret to his best friend.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او بالاخره رازش را به بهترین دوستش آشکار کرد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.756Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.756Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2795,
        "sentence_en": "Most bacteria are invisible to the naked eye.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "بیشتر باکتری‌ها برای چشم غیرمسلح نامرئی هستند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.758Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.758Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2796,
        "sentence_en": "The thin charging cables always tangle in my backpack.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "کابل‌های شارژ باریک همیشه در کوله‌پشتی من گره می‌خورند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.759Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.759Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2797,
        "sentence_en": "The cat ruined the expensive upholstery on the new sofa.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "گربه روکش گران‌قیمت کاناپه جدید را خراب کرد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.760Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.760Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2798,
        "sentence_en": "The police managed to trap the suspect in a dead-end street.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "پلیس موفق شد فرد مظنون را در یک بن‌بست گیر بیندازد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.761Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.761Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2799,
        "sentence_en": "The fluffy white clouds drifted across the clear blue sky.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "ابرهای سفید پرمانند در آسمان آبی و صاف حرکت می‌کردند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.761Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.761Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2800,
        "sentence_en": "Small plants were growing out of every crevice in the stone wall.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "گیاهان کوچک از هر درز دیوار سنگی بیرون زده بودند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.762Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.762Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2801,
        "sentence_en": "One of his little quirks is talking to his plants every morning.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "یکی از خصلت‌های عجیب کوچکش این است که هر روز صبح با گیاهانش حرف می‌زند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.762Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.762Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2802,
        "sentence_en": "The police are reviewing the security camera footage from the bank.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "پلیس در حال بازبینی فیلم خام دوربین‌های امنیتی بانک است.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.763Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.763Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2803,
        "sentence_en": "The neighborhood pub is always packed on Friday nights.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "میخانه‌ی محله همیشه در شب‌های جمعه شلوغ است.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.763Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.763Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2804,
        "sentence_en": "The kids left muddy footprints all over the clean kitchen floor.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "بچه‌ها ردپاهای گل‌آلود را در سراسر کف تمیز آشپزخانه به جا گذاشتند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.764Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.764Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2805,
        "sentence_en": "I just need a decent pair of shoes for work.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "من فقط به یک جفت کفش مناسب برای کار نیاز دارم.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.765Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.765Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2806,
        "sentence_en": "You need to tilt the monitor slightly to avoid the glare.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "باید مانیتور را کمی کج کنید تا از بازتاب نور جلوگیری شود.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.765Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.765Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2807,
        "sentence_en": "Many young professionals prefer the convenience of urban living.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "بسیاری از متخصصان جوان راحتی زندگی شهری را ترجیح می‌دهند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.765Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.765Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2808,
        "sentence_en": "The organization is dedicated to fighting all forms of racism.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "این سازمان به مبارزه با تمام اشکال نژادپرستی اختصاص یافته است.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.766Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.766Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2809,
        "sentence_en": "Does your computer meet the minimum system requirements for this game?",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "آیا کامپیوتر شما حداقل الزامات سیستم را برای این بازی دارد؟",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.766Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.766Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2810,
        "sentence_en": "She has a natural aptitude for learning new languages.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او استعداد ذاتی برای یادگیری زبان‌های جدید دارد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.767Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.767Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2811,
        "sentence_en": "Please do not attempt to open the door while the bus is moving.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "لطفاً وقتی اتوبوس در حال حرکت است برای باز کردن در تلاش نکنید.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.767Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.767Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2812,
        "sentence_en": "He was still drowsy when the alarm went off this morning.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او وقتی امروز صبح زنگ ساعت به صدا درآمد هنوز خواب‌آلود بود.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.768Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.768Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2813,
        "sentence_en": "The hikers were suffering from severe fatigue after their long journey.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "کوهنوردان پس از سفر طولانی خود دچار خستگی شدید شده بودند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.768Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.768Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2814,
        "sentence_en": "His vision is impaired, so he shouldn't be driving at night.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "بینایی او آسیب‌دیده است، بنابراین نباید در شب رانندگی کند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.769Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.769Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2815,
        "sentence_en": "The truck skidded off the road because of the ice.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "کامیون به خاطر یخ از جاده سر خورد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.770Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.770Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2816,
        "sentence_en": "The steering feels a bit loose when I turn the car.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "فرمان موقع دور زدن ماشین کمی شل به نظر می‌رسد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.770Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.770Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2817,
        "sentence_en": "The doctor gave him some medicine to ease the pain.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "دکتر برای آرام کردن درد به او مقداری دارو داد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.771Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.771Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2818,
        "sentence_en": "She worked alongside her father in the family business for years.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او سال‌ها در کنار پدرش در کسب‌وکار خانوادگی کار کرد",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.771Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.771Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2819,
        "sentence_en": "He accelerated quickly to overtake the slow-moving truck on the highway.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او سریعاً شتاب گرفت تا در بزرگراه از کامیون کند سبقت بگیرد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.771Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.771Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2820,
        "sentence_en": "The apartment is small, but it has adequate storage space.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "آپارتمان کوچک است، اما فضای ذخیره‌سازی کافی دارد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.772Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.772Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2821,
        "sentence_en": "Please don't distract me while I'm trying to finish this report.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "لطفاً وقتی سعی می‌کنم این گزارش را تمام کنم حواس مرا پرت نکن.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.772Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.772Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2822,
        "sentence_en": "The weather in this region is very unpredictable.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "آب و هوای این منطقه بسیار غیرقابل پیش‌بینی است.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.773Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.773Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2823,
        "sentence_en": "The car accident proved to be fatal for the young driver.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "تصادف رانندگی برای راننده جوان کشنده بود.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.773Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.773Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2824,
        "sentence_en": "The city built a new crossover for students near the school.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "شهر یک گذر جدید برای دانش‌آموزان در نزدیکی مدرسه ساخت.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.773Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.773Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2825,
        "sentence_en": "You should always use the crosswalk when crossing this busy street.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "شما همیشه باید هنگام عبور از این خیابان شلوغ از گذرگاه عابر پیاده استفاده کنید.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.774Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.774Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2826,
        "sentence_en": "We might encounter some heavy traffic on the way to the airport.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "ممکن است در راه فرودگاه با ترافیک سنگینی مواجه شویم.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.775Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.775Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2827,
        "sentence_en": "The trains run at ten-minute intervals during the morning rush.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "قطارها در ساعات شلوغی صبح در فاصله‌های ده دقیقه‌ای حرکت می‌کنند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.775Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.775Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2828,
        "sentence_en": "The teacher used extra examples to reinforce the main points of the lesson.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "معلم از مثال‌های اضافی برای تقویت کردن نکات اصلی درس استفاده کرد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.775Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.775Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2829,
        "sentence_en": "The earthquake caused a high rate of fatality in the remote village.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "زلزله باعث نرخ بالای مرگ و میر در آن روستای دورافتاده شد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.776Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.776Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2830,
        "sentence_en": "Doctors gave him some medicine to help mitigate the intense pain.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "پزشکان به او مقداری دارو دادند تا به تسکین دادن درد شدید کمک کنند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.776Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.776Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2831,
        "sentence_en": "She glanced at the map to find the correct exit.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او برای پیدا کردن خروجی درست، یک نگاه اجمالی به نقشه انداخت.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.776Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.776Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2832,
        "sentence_en": "The afternoon sun glared off the car's windshield.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "خورشید بعدازظهر بر شیشه جلوی ماشین می‌تابید.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.777Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.777Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2833,
        "sentence_en": "The flight was canceled due to adverse weather conditions.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "پرواز به دلیل شرایط نامساعد جوی لغو شد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.777Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.777Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2834,
        "sentence_en": "The kids were jumping in a large puddle after the rain stopped.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "بچه‌ها بعد از قطع شدن باران، در یک گودال آب بزرگ می‌پریدند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.777Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.777Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2835,
        "sentence_en": "A small rock hit the windshield while I was driving on the highway.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "وقتی داشتم در بزرگراه رانندگی می‌کردم، سنگ کوچکی به شیشه جلو خورد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.778Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.778Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2836,
        "sentence_en": "I took my car to the mechanic for a routine tune-up.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "من ماشینم را برای یک تنظیم روتین پیش مکانیک بردم.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.778Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.778Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2837,
        "sentence_en": "Don't forget to fill up the tank before we start the road trip.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "فراموش نکن قبل از اینکه سفر جاده‌ای را شروع کنیم، باک را پر کنی.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.779Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.779Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2838,
        "sentence_en": "The car was running low on fuel after the long drive.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "ماشین بعد از رانندگی طولانی با کمبود سوخت مواجه بود.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.779Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.779Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2839,
        "sentence_en": "Food banks mostly collect non-perishable items like canned goods and pasta.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "بانک‌های غذا بیشتر اقلام فاسد نشدنی مانند کنسروها و پاستا را جمع‌آوری می‌کنند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.779Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.779Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2840,
        "sentence_en": "Getting enough sleep is vital for your overall health.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "داشتن خواب کافی برای سلامت کلی شما ضروری است.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.780Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.780Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2841,
        "sentence_en": "The ultimate decision rests with the board of directors.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "تصمیم نهایی بر عهده هیئت مدیره است.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.780Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.780Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2842,
        "sentence_en": "She became very defensive when I asked about her grades.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او وقتی در مورد نمراتش پرسیدم خیلی حالت دفاعی گرفت.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.780Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.780Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2843,
        "sentence_en": "The police arrived at the scene of the accident within minutes.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "پلیس ظرف چند دقیقه در محل وقوع تصادف حاضر شد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.781Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.781Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2844,
        "sentence_en": "We both gave up something and reached a compromise.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "هر دو از چیزی گذشتیم و به مصالحه رسیدیم.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.781Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-05-05T07:54:58.039Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2845,
        "sentence_en": "The full extent of the damage is still unknown.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "اندازه کامل خسارت هنوز مشخص نیست.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.781Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.781Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2846,
        "sentence_en": "He was deemed unfit for the job after the interview.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او پس از مصاحبه برای این شغل نالایق پنداشته شد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.782Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.782Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2847,
        "sentence_en": "He was too distracted by his phone to notice the red light.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او آن‌قدر با گوشی‌اش حواس‌پرت شده بود که متوجه چراغ قرمز نشد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.782Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.782Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2848,
        "sentence_en": "The police set up a diversion due to the construction on the main road.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "پلیس به دلیل عملیات ساختمانی در جاده اصلی، یک راه جایگزین ایجاد کرد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.782Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.782Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2849,
        "sentence_en": "Reading helps stimulate a child's cognitive development from a young age.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "مطالعه به تحریک رشد شناختی کودک از سنین پایین کمک می‌کند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.783Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.783Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2850,
        "sentence_en": "The heavy curtains help to muffle the noise from the street.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "پرده‌های ضخیم به خفه کردن صدای خیابان کمک می‌کنند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.783Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.783Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2851,
        "sentence_en": "I prefer playing games on a handheld console while traveling.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "من ترجیح می‌دهم هنگام سفر با یک کنسول دستی بازی کنم.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.784Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.784Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2852,
        "sentence_en": "Smoking is strictly prohibited in all areas of the building.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "سیگار کشیدن در تمام بخش‌های ساختمان اکیداً ممنوع است.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.784Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.784Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2853,
        "sentence_en": "The bus had to deviate from its usual route because of construction.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "اتوبوس به دلیل عملیات ساختمانی مجبور شد از مسیر همیشگی خود منحرف شود.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.784Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.784Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2854,
        "sentence_en": "The student received a three-day suspension for fighting in the hallway.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "دانش‌آموز به دلیل دعوا در راهرو با سه روز تعلیق مواجه شد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.785Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.785Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2855,
        "sentence_en": "The abandoned car obstructed the flow of traffic for hours.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "ماشین رها شده برای ساعت‌ها مانع شدن از جریان ترافیک شد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.785Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.785Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2856,
        "sentence_en": "Regular exercise can help you eliminate stress and improve your sleep.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "ورزش منظم می‌تواند به شما کمک کند تا استرس را از بین ببرید و خواب خود را بهبود بخشید.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.786Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.786Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2857,
        "sentence_en": "The elevator started to malfunction after the power surge.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "آسانسور بعد از نوسان برق دچار عملکرد نادرست شد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.786Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.786Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2858,
        "sentence_en": "Many students rely on their parents for financial support.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "بسیاری از دانشجویان برای حمایت مالی به والدین خود وابسته هستند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.786Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.786Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2859,
        "sentence_en": "The latest statistics show a significant drop in unemployment rates.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "آخرین آمار کاهش قابل توجهی را در نرخ بیکاری نشان می‌دهد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.787Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.787Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2860,
        "sentence_en": "We are still waiting to see the final outcome of the study.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "ما هنوز منتظر دیدن نتیجه نهایی این مطالعه هستیم.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.787Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.787Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2861,
        "sentence_en": "The officer wore a silver chevron on his uniform sleeve.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "افسر یک علامت شکل نقره‌ای روی آستین لباسش داشت.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.787Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.787Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2862,
        "sentence_en": "Don't worry, we have plenty of time to finish the project.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "نگران نباش، ما زمان زیادی برای تمام کردن پروژه داریم.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.788Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.788Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2863,
        "sentence_en": "The security guards maintained constant vigilance during the high-profile event.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "نگهبانان امنیتی در طول این مراسم مهم هشیاری مداوم خود را حفظ کردند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.788Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.788Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2864,
        "sentence_en": "The previous occupant of the apartment left it in great condition.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "ساکن قبلی آپارتمان آن را در وضعیت بسیار خوبی رها کرد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.788Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.788Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2865,
        "sentence_en": "Make sure you have sufficient funds in your account for the rent.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "مطمئن شوید که پول کافی در حساب خود برای اجاره دارید.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.789Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.789Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2866,
        "sentence_en": "The driver swerved quickly to avoid the oncoming car.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "راننده به سرعت منحرف شد تا با ماشین پیش رو برخورد نکند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.789Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.789Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2867,
        "sentence_en": "Dangerous overtaking on this narrow road often leads to accidents.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "سبقت خطرناک در این جاده باریک اغلب منجر به تصادف می‌شود.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.790Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.790Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2868,
        "sentence_en": "His motives for helping us are somewhat questionable.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "انگیزه‌های او برای کمک به ما تا حدودی مشکوک است.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.790Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.790Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2869,
        "sentence_en": "He had to face the consequences of his actions.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او مجبور شد با پیامدهای کارهایش روبرو شود.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.790Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.790Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2870,
        "sentence_en": "Sharing that file would violate company policy.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "به اشتراک گذاشتن آن فایل، سیاست شرکت را نقض می کند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.791Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-07-13T17:27:33.916Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2871,
        "sentence_en": "She collects rare coins from all over the world.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او سکه‌های نادر را از سراسر جهان جمع‌آوری می‌کند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.792Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.792Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2872,
        "sentence_en": "The train is scheduled to depart the station at exactly five o'clock.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "قطار طبق برنامه رأس ساعت پنج ایستگاه را ترک خواهد کرد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.793Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.793Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2873,
        "sentence_en": "The government is introducing new legislation to protect the environment.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "دولت در حال معرفی قوانین جدیدی برای محافظت از محیط‌زیست است.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.795Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.795Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2874,
        "sentence_en": "The activists are fighting for social and economic equality.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "فعالان برای برابری اجتماعی و اقتصادی مبارزه می‌کنند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.796Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.796Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2875,
        "sentence_en": "Broadly speaking, the new law has been well received by the public.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "عموماً، قانون جدید مورد استقبال مردم قرار گرفته است.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.796Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.796Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2876,
        "sentence_en": "He has a slight visual impairment that requires him to wear glasses.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او یک آسیب بینایی جزئی دارد که باعث می‌شود ملزم به استفاده از عینک باشد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.796Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.796Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2877,
        "sentence_en": "She enjoys the intellectual challenge of solving complex puzzles.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او از چالش ذهنی حل کردن معماهای پیچیده لذت می‌برد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.797Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.797Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2878,
        "sentence_en": "The instructions for the project were very explicit and easy to follow.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "دستورالعمل‌های این پروژه بسیار صریح و برای دنبال کردن آسان بودند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.797Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.797Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2879,
        "sentence_en": "Most of her health problems stem from a poor diet.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "بسیاری از مشکلات سلامتی او از رژیم غذایی ضعیف نشأت می‌گیرند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.798Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-06-26T06:35:15.398Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2880,
        "sentence_en": "The police believe the fire was intentional rather than an accident.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "پلیس بر این باور است که آتش‌سوزی به جای یک حادثه، عمدی بوده است.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.798Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.798Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2881,
        "sentence_en": "The mayor denied the rumors about his resignation yesterday.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "شهردار دیروز شایعات مربوط به استعفای خود را تکذیب کرد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.798Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.798Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2882,
        "sentence_en": "The plan faced strong opposition from the local community.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "این طرح با مخالفت شدیدی از سوی جامعه محلی روبرو شد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.799Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.799Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2883,
        "sentence_en": "He seems incapable of making a simple decision.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او در گرفتن یک تصمیم ساده ناتوان به نظر می‌رسد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.799Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.799Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2884,
        "sentence_en": "The team had a very productive meeting and finished the project early.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "تیم جلسه بسیار پربازدهی داشت و پروژه را زود تمام کرد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.799Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.799Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2885,
        "sentence_en": "She sent me an invitation to her birthday party.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او برای من یک دعوت برای مهمانی تولدش فرستاد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.800Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.800Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2886,
        "sentence_en": "The state law mandates that all children receive their vaccinations before school.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "قانون ایالتی حکم می‌دهد که تمام کودکان پیش از مدرسه واکسن‌هایشان را دریافت کنند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.800Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.800Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2887,
        "sentence_en": "They are looking for tangible evidence to support their claims in court.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "آن‌ها برای حمایت از ادعاهای خود در دادگاه به دنبال شواهد قابل لمس هستند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.800Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.800Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2888,
        "sentence_en": "Heavy snow continued to impede the progress of the rescue teams.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "بارش سنگین برف همچنان از پیشرفت تیم‌های امداد جلوگیری می‌کرد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.801Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.801Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2889,
        "sentence_en": "The city is famous for its unique architectural style and historic buildings.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "این شهر به خاطر سبک معماری منحصر‌به‌فرد و ساختمان‌های تاریخی‌اش مشهور است.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.801Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.801Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2890,
        "sentence_en": "He refused to lie because it went against his principles.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او از دروغ گفتن خودداری کرد زیرا با اصول اخلاقی‌اش مغایرت داشت.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.801Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.801Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2891,
        "sentence_en": "The seamless integration of new software improved our overall productivity.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "تلفیق بی‌نقص نرم‌افزار جدید بهره‌وری کلی ما را بهبود بخشید.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.802Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.802Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2892,
        "sentence_en": "Many elderly people use assistive devices to live independently.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "بسیاری از افراد مسن برای زندگی مستقل از دستگاه‌های کمکی استفاده می‌کنند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.802Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.802Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2893,
        "sentence_en": "You must obtain a special permit before starting any renovation work.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "شما باید پیش از شروع هرگونه کار بازسازی، یک مجوز ویژه به‌دست آورید.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.802Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.802Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2894,
        "sentence_en": "Please read the accompanying instructions before starting the assembly.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "لطفاً قبل از شروع مونتاژ، دستورالعمل‌های همراهی را مطالعه کنید.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.803Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.803Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2895,
        "sentence_en": "Regular exercise is highly beneficial for your mental health.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "ورزش منظم برای سلامت روان شما بسیار سودمند است.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.803Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.803Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2896,
        "sentence_en": "You are legally bound by the terms of this contract.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "شما از نظر قانونی ملزم به رعایت شرایط این قرارداد هستید.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.803Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.803Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2897,
        "sentence_en": "The provision of clean water is vital for the local residents.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "تدارک آب تمیز برای ساکنان محلی حیاتی است.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.804Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.804Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2898,
        "sentence_en": "The new laptop was designed for maximum mobility during travel.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "لپ‌تاپ جدید برای حداکثر قابلیت حمل در طول سفر طراحی شده بود.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.804Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.804Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2899,
        "sentence_en": "My grandfather needs a cane to walk around the house.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "پدربزرگ من برای راه رفتن در خانه به یک عصا نیاز دارد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.805Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.805Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2900,
        "sentence_en": "He relied on a crutch for weeks after breaking his leg.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او تا هفته‌ها پس از شکستن پایش به چوب زیر بغل متکی بود.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.805Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.805Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2901,
        "sentence_en": "The steel framework of the new building is almost finished.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "بدنه فولادی ساختمان جدید تقریباً تمام شده است.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.805Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.805Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2902,
        "sentence_en": "His disappointment was apparent to everyone in the room.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "ناامیدی او برای همه در اتاق آشکار بود.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.806Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.806Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2903,
        "sentence_en": "Proper dining etiquette is essential for a formal business dinner.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "رعایت آداب صحیح غذا خوردن برای یک شام کاری رسمی ضروری است.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.806Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.806Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2904,
        "sentence_en": "The athlete underwent surgery to repair a serious spinal injury.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "این ورزشکار برای ترمیم یک آسیب‌دیدگی جدی نخاعی تحت عمل جراحی قرار گرفت.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.806Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.806Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2905,
        "sentence_en": "The child grasped his mother's hand in the crowded mall.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "کودک دست مادرش را در مرکز خرید شلوغ محکم گرفت.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.807Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.807Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2906,
        "sentence_en": "They stowed the extra supplies in the basement storage area.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "آن‌ها تجهیزات اضافی را در بخش ذخیره‌سازی زیرزمین انبار کردند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.807Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.807Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2907,
        "sentence_en": "Let me rephrase that so there is no confusion.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "اجازه دهید آن را دوباره بگویم تا هیچ ابهامی وجود نداشته باشد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.807Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.807Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2908,
        "sentence_en": "The new ramp has improved the accessibility of the building for everyone.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "رمپ جدید دسترسی به ساختمان را برای همه بهبود بخشیده است.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.808Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.808Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2909,
        "sentence_en": "The police ordered everyone to evacuate the building because of the fire.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "پلیس به همه دستور داد تا به دلیل آتش‌سوزی ساختمان را تخلیه کنند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.808Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.808Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2910,
        "sentence_en": "Parking in front of a fire hydrant is a violation of city rules.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "پارک کردن جلوی شیر آتش‌نشانی نقض قوانین شهر است.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.808Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.808Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2911,
        "sentence_en": "The company settled the litigation out of court to save money.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "شرکت برای صرفه‌جویی در هزینه‌ها، دادخواهی را بیرون از دادگاه حل و فصل کرد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.809Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.809Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2912,
        "sentence_en": "The company had to pay a fine for a serious safety infringement.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "شرکت مجبور شد برای یک تخلف ایمنی جدی جریمه بپردازد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.809Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.809Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2913,
        "sentence_en": "The court ordered the restitution of the stolen property.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "دادگاه دستور بازگردانی اموال مسروقه را صادر کرد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.809Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.809Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2914,
        "sentence_en": "He received a large sum of compensation after the car accident.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او پس از تصادف رانندگی مبلغ زیادی غرامت دریافت کرد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.809Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.809Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2915,
        "sentence_en": "The insurance company contacted the claimant to verify the details.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "شرکت بیمه برای تایید جزئیات با مدعی تماس گرفت.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.810Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.810Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2916,
        "sentence_en": "She wore a simple gold ring on her slender finger.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او یک انگشتر طلای ساده در انگشت باریکش داشت.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.810Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.810Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2917,
        "sentence_en": "Remember to escape special characters in your code to prevent errors.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "به یاد داشته باشید که برای جلوگیری از خطا، نویسه‌های خاص را در کد خود بی‌خطر کنید.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.810Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.810Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2918,
        "sentence_en": "The course helps students develop a better appreciation of modern art.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "این دوره به دانش‌آموزان کمک می‌کند تا درک بهتری از هنر مدرن پیدا کنند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.811Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.811Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2919,
        "sentence_en": "Please include the abbreviation for your country on the mailing label.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "لطفاً مخفف کشور خود را روی برچسب پستی قرار دهید.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.811Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.811Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2920,
        "sentence_en": "He finally found the courage to ask his boss for a raise.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او بالاخره شجاعت لازم برای درخواست افزایش حقوق از رئیسش را پیدا کرد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.812Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.812Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2921,
        "sentence_en": "The law obliges employers to provide a safe working environment.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "قانون کارفرمایان را وادار می‌کند تا محیط کاری امنی فراهم کنند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.812Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.812Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2922,
        "sentence_en": "The family enjoyed a pleasant afternoon outing to the park.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "خانواده از یک سرگردان شدن دلپذیر بعدازظهر در پارک لذت بردند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.812Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.812Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2923,
        "sentence_en": "The police are investigating the theft of her car.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "پلیس در حال تحقیق درباره دزدی ماشین او است.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.813Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.813Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2924,
        "sentence_en": "She has an outgoing personality and loves meeting new people.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او شخصیت اجتماعی‌ای دارد و عاشق ملاقات با افراد جدید است.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.813Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.813Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2925,
        "sentence_en": "The museum works hard to preserve ancient artifacts.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "موزه برای حفظ کردن آثار باستانی سخت تلاش می‌کند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.813Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.813Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2926,
        "sentence_en": "He wiped the sweat from his forehead after a long run.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او بعد از یک دویدن طولانی، عرق را از پیشانی‌اش پاک کرد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.814Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.814Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2927,
        "sentence_en": "I felt a deep sense of pity for the homeless man.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "من نسبت به آن مرد بی‌خانمان احساس دلسوزی عمیقی داشتم.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.814Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.814Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2928,
        "sentence_en": "The software team is working hard to complete the current sprint.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "تیم نرم‌افزاری برای تکمیل دورهٔ کوتاه و فشردهٔ کار فعلی سخت تلاش می‌کند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.814Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.814Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2929,
        "sentence_en": "She carefully cut the flower from its long green stalk.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او با دقت گل را از ساقه بلند و سبز آن برید.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.815Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.815Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2930,
        "sentence_en": "She fainted because of the heat in the room.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او به دلیل گرمای داخل اتاق غش کرد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.815Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.815Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2931,
        "sentence_en": "The captain issued an imperative order to evacuate the ship.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "کاپیتان یک دستور قاطع برای تخلیه کشتی صادر کرد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.815Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-06-27T16:35:58.985Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2932,
        "sentence_en": "The boss emphasized the need for better communication within the team.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "رئیس بر نیاز به ارتباط بهتر در تیم تأکید کرد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.816Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.816Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2933,
        "sentence_en": "We can store the GPS coordinates as a tuple of numbers.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "ما می‌توانیم مختصات جی‌پی‌اس را به عنوان یک چندتایی از اعداد ذخیره کنیم.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.816Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.816Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2934,
        "sentence_en": "The company decided to promote her to a management position last month.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "شرکت تصمیم گرفت ماه گذشته او را به یک پست مدیریتی ترقی دهد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.817Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.817Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2935,
        "sentence_en": "The database ensures data persistence even after a sudden system crash.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "پایگاه داده پایداری داده را حتی پس از خرابی ناگهانی سیستم تضمین می‌کند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.817Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.817Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2936,
        "sentence_en": "The company gave everyone a year-end bonus for their hard work.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "شرکت به همه بابت تلاش سختشان پاداش پایان سال داد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.817Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.817Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2937,
        "sentence_en": "The lock allows for thousands of different permutations.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "این قفل هزاران جایگشت مختلف را امکان‌پذیر می‌کند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.818Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.818Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2938,
        "sentence_en": "All members must abide by the rules of the club.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "همه اعضا باید از قوانین باشگاه پیروی کنند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.818Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.818Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2939,
        "sentence_en": "As a polyglot, she can switch between five different languages effortlessly.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "به عنوان یک چندزبانه، او می‌تواند بدون زحمت بین پنج زبان مختلف جابجا شود.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.818Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.818Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2940,
        "sentence_en": "He wore a ribbed sweater to keep warm in the winter.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او برای گرم ماندن در زمستان یک پلیور بافت‌دار پوشید.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.819Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.819Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2941,
        "sentence_en": "Be careful not to spill your drink on the laptop.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "مراقب باش نوشیدنی‌ات را روی لپ‌تاپ نریزی.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.819Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.819Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2942,
        "sentence_en": "We were astonished by the magician's incredible final trick.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "ما از آخرین شعبده‌بازی باورنکردنی شعبده‌باز حیرت‌زده شدیم.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.820Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.820Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2943,
        "sentence_en": "He almost drowned when his small boat tipped over in the lake.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او وقتی قایق کوچکش در دریاچه واژگون شد، نزدیک بود غرق شود.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.820Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.820Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2944,
        "sentence_en": "You need to hand in your resignation by Friday.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "شما باید استعفای خود را تا جمعه تحویل دهید.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.820Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.820Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2945,
        "sentence_en": "We decided to put off the meeting until next Monday.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "ما تصمیم گرفتیم جلسه را تا دوشنبه آینده به تعویق بیندازیم.",
