        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.835Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2987,
        "sentence_en": "There has been a steep increase in gas prices lately.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "اخیراً قیمت بنزین افزایش شدیدی داشته است.",
