        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.835Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2989,
        "sentence_en": "He did not want to be a burden to his children.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او نمی‌خواست باری برای فرزندانش باشد.",
