        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.918Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3141,
        "sentence_en": "She was promoted to an executive position after years of hard work.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او پس از سال‌ها تلاش سخت به یک پست اجرایی ارتقا یافت.",
