        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.952Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3231,
        "sentence_en": "He started acting like a total freak when he lost the game.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او وقتی بازی را باخت، مثل یک دیوانه تمام‌عیار رفتار کرد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.952Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.952Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3232,
        "sentence_en": "I can't get this goddamn car to start in the cold.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "من نمی‌توانم این ماشین لعنتی را در سرما روشن کنم.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.952Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.952Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3233,
        "sentence_en": "He was driving like a lunatic on the highway.",
