        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.954Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3236,
        "sentence_en": "There you go, here is the extra blanket you asked for.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "بفرما، این هم پتوی اضافه‌ای که خواسته بودی.",
