        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.954Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3238,
        "sentence_en": "I gotta go now before I'm late for work.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "من الان باید برم قبل از اینکه برای سر کار دیر بشه.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.955Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.955Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3239,
        "sentence_en": "We won't go outside unless the weather clears up soon.",
