        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.955Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3240,
        "sentence_en": "The teacher asked the children to line up by two for the field trip.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "معلم از بچه‌ها خواست برای اردوی علمی به دو صف بشن.",
