        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.956Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3241,
        "sentence_en": "The soldiers fired the cannon during the historic battle reenactment.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "سربازان در طول بازسازی نبرد تاریخی توپ را شلیک کردند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.956Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.956Z"
      },
      {
