        "id": 3287,
        "sentence_en": "Scientists are investigating a mysterious substance discovered in the cave.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "دانشمندان در حال تحقیق درباره ماده مرموزی هستند که در غار کشف شده است.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.969Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.969Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3288,
        "sentence_en": "Don't accuse me of lying just because you're angry.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "فقط چون عصبانی هستی مرا به دروغگویی متهم نکن.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.970Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.970Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3289,
        "sentence_en": "Please specify the exact date and time for our meeting.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "لطفاً تاریخ و زمان دقیق جلسه ما را مشخص کنید.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.970Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.970Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3290,
        "sentence_en": "The coastal area is a very desirable location for a summer home.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "منطقه ساحلی مکان بسیار مطلوبی برای خانه تابستانی است.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.971Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.971Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3291,
        "sentence_en": "We need to weigh the costs versus the benefits before deciding.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "ما باید پیش از تصمیم‌گیری هزینه‌ها را در برابر مزایا بسنجیم.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.971Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.971Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3292,
        "sentence_en": "We need to discuss this important issue during our next meeting.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "ما باید در طول جلسه بعدی‌مان درباره این مسئله مهم بحث کنیم.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.971Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.971Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3293,
        "sentence_en": "The baker provides consistent quality in all of his daily products.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "نانوا در تمام محصولات روزانه خود کیفیت ثابتی ارائه می‌دهد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.972Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.972Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3294,
        "sentence_en": "I am calling in regard to the email you sent yesterday.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "من در ارتباط با ایمیلی که دیروز فرستادید تماس می‌گیرم.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.972Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.972Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3295,
        "sentence_en": "The email closing was simply 'regards'.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "پایان‌بندی ایمیل صرفاً «با احترام» بود.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.972Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.972Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3296,
        "sentence_en": "Please lay the book on the table when you are finished.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "لطفاً وقتی کارت تمام شد کتاب را روی میز قرار بده.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.972Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.972Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3297,
        "sentence_en": "The journalist tried to remain neutral while reporting on the election.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "روزنامه‌نگار سعی کرد هنگام گزارش در مورد انتخابات خنثی بماند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.973Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.973Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3298,
        "sentence_en": "The loud construction noise outside really annoys me when I'm working.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "صدای بلند ساخت‌وساز در بیرون وقتی دارم کار می‌کنم واقعاً مرا اذیت می‌کند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.973Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.973Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3299,
        "sentence_en": "The documentary was very informative and covered all the key details.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "مستند بسیار آموزنده بود و تمام جزئیات کلیدی را پوشش داد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.973Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.973Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3300,
        "sentence_en": "She looked stunning in her new evening gown at the party.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او در لباس شب جدیدش در مهمانی جذاب به نظر می‌رسید.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.974Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.974Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3301,
        "sentence_en": "We should collaborate with the design team to finish the website.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "ما باید برای تمام کردن وب‌سایت با تیم طراحی همکاری کنیم.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.974Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.974Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3302,
        "sentence_en": "The city has a diverse population with people from all over the world.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "این شهر جمعیت متنوعی با افرادی از سراسر جهان دارد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.975Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.975Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3303,
        "sentence_en": "The lawyer presented a compelling argument to the jury.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "وکیل یک استدلال قانع‌کننده به هیئت منصفه ارائه داد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.975Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.975Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3304,
        "sentence_en": "The company offers a comprehensive training program for new employees.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "شرکت یک برنامه آموزشی جامع برای کارکنان جدید ارائه می‌دهد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.975Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.975Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3305,
        "sentence_en": "The company used its market position to leverage a better deal.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "شرکت از موقعیت خود در بازار به عنوان اهرم فشار برای رسیدن به توافقی بهتر استفاده کرد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.975Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.975Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3306,
        "sentence_en": "The initial reaction to the new policy was quite positive.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "واکنش اولیه به سیاست جدید کاملاً مثبت بود.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.976Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.976Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3307,
        "sentence_en": "The manager asked for a quick revision of the contract before signing.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "مدیر قبل از امضا، درخواست یک بازبینی سریع در قرارداد را کرد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.976Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.976Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3308,
        "sentence_en": "She came up with an innovative solution to the storage problem.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او یک راه‌حل خلاق برای مشکل انبارداری پیدا کرد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.976Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.976Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3309,
        "sentence_en": "The company's incredible turnaround this year saved it from bankruptcy.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "چرخش نتیجه‌ی باورنکردنی شرکت در سال جاری، آن را از ورشکستگی نجات داد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.977Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.977Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3310,
        "sentence_en": "They succeeded because they worked together as a cohesive unit.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "آن‌ها موفق شدند چون به عنوان یک واحد منسجم با هم کار کردند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.977Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.977Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3311,
        "sentence_en": "The realization of his lifelong dream took years of hard work.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "تحقق رویای دیرینه‌اش سال‌ها تلاش سخت زمان برد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.977Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.977Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3312,
        "sentence_en": "The new policy received broad support from the local community.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "سیاست جدید مورد حمایت گسترده جامعه محلی قرار گرفت.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.978Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.978Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3313,
        "sentence_en": "The company had to sell its assets to pay off the debt.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "شرکت مجبور شد برای پرداخت بدهی، دارایی‌های خود را بفروشد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.978Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.978Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3314,
        "sentence_en": "The sidewalk was extremely slippery after the freezing rain.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "پیاده‌رو بعد از باران منجمدکننده بسیار لغزنده بود.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.978Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.978Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3315,
        "sentence_en": "Companies extract oil from deep beneath the ocean floor.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "شرکت‌ها نفت را از اعماق بستر اقیانوس استخراج می‌کنند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.979Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.979Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3316,
        "sentence_en": "Initially, the project was supposed to take only two weeks.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "در ابتدا قرار بود این پروژه فقط دو هفته طول بکشد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.979Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.979Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3317,
        "sentence_en": "The students got in trouble for their senior prank.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "دانش‌آموزان به خاطر شوخی عملی سال آخرشان به دردسر افتادند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.979Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.979Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3318,
        "sentence_en": "I think we have got our lines crossed regarding the meeting location.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "فکر می‌کنم در مورد محل جلسه خط رو خط شده.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.980Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.980Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3319,
        "sentence_en": "I didn't recognize the area code, so I didn't answer the call.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "من پیش‌شماره را نشناختم، بنابراین به تماس پاسخ ندادم.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.980Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.980Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3320,
        "sentence_en": "We booked a round trip flight for our summer vacation in Hawaii.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "ما برای تعطیلات تابستانی خود در هاوایی یک پرواز رفت و برگشت رزرو کردیم.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.980Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.980Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3321,
        "sentence_en": "Firefighters worked for several hours to extinguish the massive blaze.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "آتش‌نشان‌ها چندین ساعت برای خاموش کردن شعله‌های عظیم تلاش کردند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.981Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.981Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3322,
        "sentence_en": "She struggled to keep the heavy ladder upright in the wind.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او به سختی تلاش کرد تا نردبان سنگین را در باد راست نگه دارد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.981Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.981Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3323,
        "sentence_en": "The airline charged her a fee for the excess weight of her luggage.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "هواپیمایی بابت بار اضافه چمدان‌هایش از او هزینه گرفت.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.982Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.982Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3324,
        "sentence_en": "The gate agent announced that boarding for the flight has started.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "مامور گیت اعلام کرد که سوار شدن به هواپیما شروع شده است.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.982Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.982Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3325,
        "sentence_en": "The flight attendant helped the passengers with their heavy luggage.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "مهماندار هواپیما به مسافران در جابه‌جایی چمدان‌های سنگین‌شان کمک کرد‌.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.982Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.982Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3326,
        "sentence_en": "Please have your passport and boarding pass ready at the gate.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "لطفاً پاسپورت و کارت پرواز خود را در گیت آماده داشته باشید.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.982Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.982Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3327,
        "sentence_en": "We had a coffee in the departure lounge before boarding the plane.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "ما قبل از سوار شدن به هواپیما، در سالن خروج یک قهوه خوردیم.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.983Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.983Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3328,
        "sentence_en": "The co-pilot took over the controls while the captain rested.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "کمک‌خلبان در حالی که کاپیتان استراحت می‌کرد، کنترل هواپیما را به دست گرفت.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.983Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.983Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3329,
        "sentence_en": "She gets along surprisingly well with her co-wife.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او به طرز عجیبی با هووی خود به خوبی کنار می‌آید.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.983Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.983Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3330,
        "sentence_en": "We waited at the baggage claim for over thirty minutes.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "ما بیش از سی دقیقه در تحویل بار منتظر ماندیم.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.984Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.984Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3331,
        "sentence_en": "She loaded her heavy suitcases onto the airport trolley.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او چمدان‌های سنگین خود را روی چرخ‌دستی فرودگاه گذاشت.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.984Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-06-27T11:00:34.163Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3332,
        "sentence_en": "Could you please fetch me a glass of water from the kitchen?",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "می‌توانی لطفاً یک لیوان آب از آشپزخانه برایم بیاوری؟",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.984Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.984Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3333,
        "sentence_en": "Wait for your luggage to appear on the conveyor belt.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "منتظر بمانید تا چمدان‌هایتان روی نوار نقاله ظاهر شوند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.985Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.985Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3334,
        "sentence_en": "The airline was forced to declare bankruptcy after the financial crisis.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "شرکت هواپیمایی پس از بحران مالی مجبور شد ورشکستگی خود را اعلام کند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.985Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.985Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3335,
        "sentence_en": "The customs officers checked all the suitcases for illegal items.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "افسران گمرک تمام چمدان‌ها را برای کالاهای غیرقانونی چک کردند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.985Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.985Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3336,
        "sentence_en": "I bought this expensive bottle of perfume at the duty-free shop.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "من این شیشه عطر گران‌قیمت را از فروشگاه معاف از عوارض خریدم.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.986Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.986Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3337,
        "sentence_en": "You have to pay customs duty on items worth over a thousand dollars.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "شما باید برای کالاهایی با ارزش بیش از هزار دلار عوارض گمرکی بپردازید.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.986Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.986Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3338,
        "sentence_en": "The store offers a wide variety of high-quality goods.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "این فروشگاه تنوع زیادی از کالاهای باکیفیت را ارائه می‌دهد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.986Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-06-27T12:59:35.745Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3339,
        "sentence_en": "Please let us know beforehand if you have any food allergies.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "لطفاً اگر به غذایی حساسیت دارید، از پیش به ما اطلاع دهید.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.987Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.987Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3340,
        "sentence_en": "I took a cab to the airport because I was running late.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "من چون دیرم شده بود، با تاکسی به فرودگاه رفتم.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.987Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.987Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3341,
        "sentence_en": "We found our compartment and placed our luggage under the seat.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "ما کوپه‌مان را پیدا کردیم و بارمان را زیر صندلی گذاشتیم.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.987Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.987Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3342,
        "sentence_en": "I caught the morning express to get to the meeting on time.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "من برای اینکه به موقع به جلسه برسم، با قطار سریع‌السیر صبح رفتم.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.988Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.988Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3343,
        "sentence_en": "The train for New York is waiting at platform six.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "قطار نیویورک در سکوی شماره شش منتظر است.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.988Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.988Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3344,
        "sentence_en": "You can buy your tickets at the small booth near the entrance.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "شما می‌توانید بلیط‌های خود را از کیوسک کوچک نزدیک ورودی بخرید.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.992Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.992Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3345,
        "sentence_en": "We should get on the train before it leaves the station.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "ما باید قبل از اینکه ایستگاه را ترک کند، سوار قطار شویم.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.994Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.994Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3346,
        "sentence_en": "We need to get off the bus at the next stop.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "ما باید در ایستگاه بعدی از اتوبوس پیاده شویم.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.997Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:49.997Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3347,
        "sentence_en": "The hikers started to descend the mountain before sunset.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "کوهنوردان قبل از غروب خورشید شروع به پایین آمدن از کوه کردند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.001Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.001Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3348,
        "sentence_en": "After traveling for years, they finally settled in California.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "آن‌ها پس از سال‌ها سفر، در نهایت در کالیفرنیا اقامت کردند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.009Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.009Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3349,
        "sentence_en": "He always tries to get out of doing the dishes after dinner.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او همیشه از ظرف شستن بعد از شام طفره می‌رود.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.011Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.011Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3350,
        "sentence_en": "You should cut off the dead branches to help the tree grow.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "شما باید شاخه‌های خشک را برای کمک به رشد درخت قطع کنید.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.012Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.012Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3351,
        "sentence_en": "Prices for the same hotel room vary depending on the season.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "قیمت‌های یک اتاق هتل بسته به فصل متفاوت هستند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.012Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.012Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3352,
        "sentence_en": "We had to cancel our plans due to unforeseen circumstances.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "ما مجبور شدیم برنامه‌هایمان را به دلیل شرایط غیرمنتظره لغو کنیم.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.013Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.013Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3353,
        "sentence_en": "The police found no evidence of his involvement in the crime.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "پلیس هیچ مدرکی از دخالت او در جرم پیدا نکرد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.013Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.013Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3354,
        "sentence_en": "He seemed genuinely interested in what I had to say.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او واقعاً به آنچه برای گفتن داشتم علاقه‌مند به نظر می‌رسید.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.014Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.014Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3355,
        "sentence_en": "The candidate narrowly won the election by only a few votes.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "کاندیدا فقط با چند رای، به‌سختی در انتخابات پیروز شد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.014Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.014Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3356,
        "sentence_en": "The aggressive driver started yelling at everyone in traffic.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "راننده پرخاشگر شروع به فریاد زدن بر سر همه در ترافیک کرد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.015Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.015Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3357,
        "sentence_en": "The movie's soundtrack became more popular than the film itself.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "موسیقی متن این فیلم از خود فیلم محبوب‌تر شد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.015Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.015Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3358,
        "sentence_en": "The researchers will conduct a series of interviews next week.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "محققان هفته آینده مجموعه‌ای از مصاحبه‌ها را انجام خواهند داد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.015Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.015Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3359,
        "sentence_en": "Please inform the office if you are going to be late.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "لطفاً اگر قرار است دیر بیایید، به دفتر اطلاع دهید.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.016Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.016Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3360,
        "sentence_en": "The project's success depended on the close cooperation of all team members.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "موفقیت پروژه به همکاری نزدیک تمام اعضای تیم بستگی داشت.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.016Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.016Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3361,
        "sentence_en": "I am sorry for the inconvenience caused by the late delivery.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "بابت دردسر ایجاد شده به دلیل تحویل دیرهنگام متاسفم.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.017Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.017Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3362,
        "sentence_en": "Scientists are studying a more contagious variant of the virus.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "دانشمندان در حال مطالعه گونه مسری‌تری از ویروس هستند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.017Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.017Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3363,
        "sentence_en": "I greatly appreciate your help with the project.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "من از کمک شما در پروژه بسیار قدردانی می‌کنم.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.017Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.017Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3364,
        "sentence_en": "He creates high-quality content for his YouTube channel every week.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او هر هفته محتوای باکیفیتی برای کانال یوتیوب خود تولید می‌کند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.018Z",
