        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.018Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3366,
        "sentence_en": "It took him years to master the art of woodworking.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "سال‌ها طول کشید تا او بر هنر نجاری مسلط شود.",
