        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.019Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3367,
        "sentence_en": "The jeweler will embed a small diamond in the center of the ring.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "جواهرساز یک الماس کوچک را در مرکز انگشتر جاسازی خواهد کرد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.019Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.019Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3368,
        "sentence_en": "We need the precise measurements before we start building the table.",
