        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.020Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3369,
        "sentence_en": "The new software architecture is highly extensible for future updates.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "معماری جدید نرم‌افزار برای به‌روزرسانی‌های آینده بسیار قابل گسترش است.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.020Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.020Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3370,
        "sentence_en": "She is looking for a permanent job after working as a freelancer.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او بعد از کار کردن به عنوان فریلنسر، به دنبال یک شغل دائمی است.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.021Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.021Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3371,
        "sentence_en": "My sister is a very picky eater and hates vegetables.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "خواهرم در غذا خوردن خیلی سخت‌گیر است و از سبزیجات متنفر است.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.021Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.021Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3372,
        "sentence_en": "The greedy CEO refused to give his employees a raise.",
