        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.028Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3384,
        "sentence_en": "The team used a collaborative approach to solve the complex problem.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "تیم از یک رویکرد مشارکتی برای حل مشکل پیچیده استفاده کرد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.029Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.029Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3385,
        "sentence_en": "The waiter brought the bill as soon as we finished our meal.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "پیشخدمت به محض اینکه غذایمان را تمام کردیم، صورتحساب را آورد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.029Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.029Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3386,
        "sentence_en": "Companies must innovate constantly to stay ahead of their competitors.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "شرکت‌ها برای جلو ماندن از رقبا باید مدام نوآوری کنند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.029Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.029Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3387,
        "sentence_en": "Constant innovation is the key to staying competitive in today's market.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "نوآوری مداوم کلید رقابتی ماندن در بازار امروز است.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.030Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.030Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3388,
        "sentence_en": "He quit his position at the bank to start his own business.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او از سمتش در بانک استعفا داد تا کسب‌وکار خودش را راه بیندازد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.030Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.030Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3389,
        "sentence_en": "We had to take a detour because the main road was closed.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "ما مجبور شدیم به دلیل بسته بودن جاده اصلی از یک مسیر انحرافی برویم.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.031Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.031Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3390,
        "sentence_en": "Always use the marked crossing to get to the other side of the street.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "همیشه برای رفتن به آن سمت خیابان از گذرگاه عابر استفاده کنید.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.031Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.031Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3391,
        "sentence_en": "The doctor recommended a routine cancer screening for all patients over fifty.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "دکتر برای تمام بیماران بالای پنجاه سال یک غربالگری روتین سرطان را توصیه کرد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.032Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.032Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3392,
        "sentence_en": "The patient needs professional medical care to recover fully at home.",
