        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.032Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.032Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3393,
        "sentence_en": "The kids are playing with a ball in the backyard.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "بچه‌ها دارند در حیاط پشتی با یک توپ بازی می‌کنند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.033Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.033Z"
      },
      {
