        "sentence_en": "You should be more cautious when walking alone at night.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "شما باید هنگام پیاده‌روی تنهایی در شب محتاط‌تر باشید.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.036Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.036Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3401,
        "sentence_en": "The heavy rain finally ceased after several hours.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "باران شدید بالاخره پس از چندین ساعت متوقف شد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.036Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.036Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3402,
        "sentence_en": "She became a global celebrity after her first movie role.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او بعد از اولین نقش سینمایی‌اش به یک شخص معروف جهانی تبدیل شد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.036Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.036Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3403,
        "sentence_en": "Finding a new job in this economy is a real challenge.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "پیدا کردن یک شغل جدید در این اقتصاد یک چالش واقعی است.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.037Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.037Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3404,
        "sentence_en": "The senators gathered in the main chamber to discuss the bill.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "سناتورها در اتاق اصلی برای بحث درباره لایحه جمع شدند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.038Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-23T04:10:22.863Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3405,
        "sentence_en": "The police had to chase the suspect through the crowded park.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "پلیس مجبور شد مظنون را در پارک شلوغ تعقیب کند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.039Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.039Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3406,
        "sentence_en": "I will always cherish the memories of our summer vacation.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "من همیشه خاطرات تعطیلات تابستانی‌مان را عزیز خواهم داشت.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.039Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.039Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3407,
        "sentence_en": "The fire chief gave the order to evacuate the building immediately.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "رئیس آتش‌نشانی دستور داد ساختمان فوراً تخلیه شود.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.039Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.039Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3408,
        "sentence_en": "The ceiling fan helps to circulate the air in the room.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "پنکه سقفی به گردش کردن هوا در اتاق کمک می‌کند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.040Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.040Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3409,
        "sentence_en": "Protesters clashed with the police during the demonstration.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "تظاهرکنندگان در طول تظاهرات با پلیس درگیر شدند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.040Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.040Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3410,
        "sentence_en": "The old building collapsed during the massive earthquake last night.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "ساختمان قدیمی در طول زلزله شدید دیشب فرو ریخت.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.040Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.040Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3411,
        "sentence_en": "Two cars collided on the highway during the heavy rainstorm.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "دو ماشین در طول طوفان و باران شدید در بزرگراه با هم تصادف کردند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.041Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.041Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3412,
        "sentence_en": "Athletes from all over the world compete in the Olympic Games.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "ورزشکارانی از سراسر جهان در بازی‌های المپیک رقابت می‌کنند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.041Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.041Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3413,
        "sentence_en": "From the evidence, we can conclude that the fire was accidental.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "از روی شواهد، می‌توانیم نتیجه بگیریم که آتش‌سوزی تصادفی بوده است.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.041Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.041Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3414,
        "sentence_en": "He finally confessed to stealing the money from the office.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او در نهایت به دزدیدن پول از اداره اعتراف کرد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.042Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.042Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3415,
        "sentence_en": "We need to find a way to resolve this conflict before it gets worse.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "ما باید راهی برای حل این درگیری پیدا کنیم قبل از اینکه بدتر شود.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.042Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.042Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3416,
        "sentence_en": "The army finally conquered the city after a long siege.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "ارتش سرانجام پس از یک محاصره طولانی شهر را فتح کرد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.042Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.042Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3417,
        "sentence_en": "The project will require a considerable amount of time and effort.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "این پروژه به مقدار قابل توجهی زمان و تلاش نیاز خواهد داشت.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.043Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.043Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3418,
        "sentence_en": "His actions often contradict his words.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "اعمال او اغلب با گفته‌هایش مخالف است.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.043Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.043Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3419,
        "sentence_en": "The new housing development has caused a lot of controversy in the neighborhood.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "پروژه جدید مسکونی باعث بحث و جدل زیادی در محله شده است.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.044Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.044Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3420,
        "sentence_en": "Is this a convenient time for us to talk?",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "آیا این زمان برای صحبت کردن ما راحت است؟",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.044Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.044Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3421,
        "sentence_en": "She found it difficult to cope with the pressure of her new job.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "کنار آمدن با فشار شغل جدیدش برای او دشوار بود.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.045Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.045Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3422,
        "sentence_en": "The Earth's core is made of solid iron and nickel.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "هسته زمین از آهن و نیکل جامد ساخته شده است.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.045Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.045Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3423,
        "sentence_en": "The numbers on the receipt do not correspond with the bank statement.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "اعداد روی رسید با صورت‌حساب بانکی مطابقت ندارند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.045Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.045Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3424,
        "sentence_en": "The city council is meeting today to discuss the new budget.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "شورای شهر امروز برای بحث درباره بودجه جدید تشکیل جلسه می‌دهد.",
