        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.050Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3437,
        "sentence_en": "He grew increasingly desperate as the search for his missing dog continued.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او با ادامه جستجو برای سگ گمشده‌اش، به تدریج ناامیدتر شد.",
