        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.050Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3438,
        "sentence_en": "She felt it was her destiny to become a doctor.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او احساس می‌کرد که پزشک شدن سرنوشت اوست.",
