        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.052Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3443,
        "sentence_en": "The new law will diminish the influence of local government officials.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "قانون جدید نفوذ مقامات محلی را کاهش خواهد داد.",
