        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.052Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3444,
        "sentence_en": "She disguised herself as a reporter to get into the press conference.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او برای ورود به کنفرانس خبری تغییر قیافه داد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.053Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.053Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3445,
        "sentence_en": "The weather has been dismal and rainy all week.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "هوا در تمام طول هفته تاریک و غمگین و بارانی بوده است.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.053Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.053Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3446,
        "sentence_en": "There was significant dissent within the party regarding the new policy.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "مخالفت قابل‌توجهی در داخل حزب در مورد سیاست جدید وجود داشت.",
