        "sentence_en": "The police will enforce the new speed limits starting next week.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "پلیس از هفته آینده محدودیت‌های جدید سرعت را اجرا خواهد کرد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.058Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.058Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3459,
        "sentence_en": "The project required an enormous amount of time and effort.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "این پروژه به مقدار عظیمی زمان و تلاش نیاز داشت.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.058Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.058Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3460,
        "sentence_en": "Please ensure the doors are locked before you leave the building.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "لطفاً قبل از ترک ساختمان، از قفل بودن درها اطمینان حاصل کنید.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.058Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.058Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3461,
        "sentence_en": "She showed great enthusiasm for the new project.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او اشتیاق زیادی برای پروژه جدید نشان داد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.059Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.059Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3462,
        "sentence_en": "The internet marked the beginning of a new era in communication.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "اینترنت آغازگر دوران جدیدی در ارتباطات بود.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.059Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.059Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3463,
        "sentence_en": "I have a few errands to run this afternoon.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "من امروز بعدازظهر چند کار کوتاه برای انجام دادن دارم.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.059Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.059Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3464,
        "sentence_en": "Good communication is essential for a successful marriage.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "ارتباط خوب برای یک ازدواج موفق ضروری است.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.060Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.060Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3465,
        "sentence_en": "The store donates any excess of stock to local charities.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "فروشگاه هر گونه زیادی موجودی را به خیریه‌های محلی اهدا می‌کند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.060Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.060Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3466,
        "sentence_en": "The researchers had to exclude several participants from the study.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "محققان مجبور شدند چندین شرکت‌کننده را از مطالعه حذف کنند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.061Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.061Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3467,
        "sentence_en": "Don't expose your skin to the sun for too long without sunscreen.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "پوست خود را بدون ضدآفتاب برای مدت طولانی در معرض خورشید قرار ندهید.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.061Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.061Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3468,
        "sentence_en": "Millions of people are facing famine due to the ongoing war.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "میلیون‌ها نفر به دلیل جنگ مداوم با قحطی روبرو هستند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.061Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.061Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3469,
        "sentence_en": "The mysteries of outer space continue to fascinate people of all ages.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "رازهای فضای بیرونی همچنان افراد در هر سنی را مجذوب می‌کنند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.061Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.061Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3470,
        "sentence_en": "The old man was too feeble to walk without help.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "پیرمرد ضعیف‌تر از آن بود که بدون کمک راه برود.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.062Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.062Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3471,
        "sentence_en": "The new law forbids smoking in all public parks.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "قانون جدید سیگار کشیدن در تمام پارک‌های عمومی را ممنوع می‌کند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.062Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.062Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3472,
        "sentence_en": "I find it hard to forgive people who lie to me.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "برای من سخت است افرادی را که به من دروغ می‌گویند ببخشم.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.063Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.063Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3473,
        "sentence_en": "My former boss called me yesterday to offer a new job.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "رئیس قبلی من دیروز تماس گرفت تا یک شغل جدید پیشنهاد دهد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.064Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.064Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3474,
        "sentence_en": "He was completely frank with me about his reasons for leaving.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او در مورد دلایلش برای ترک کردن، با من کاملاً صادق بود.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.064Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.064Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3475,
        "sentence_en": "The constant delays in the schedule really frustrate the team members.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "تأخیرهای مداوم در برنامه واقعاً اعضای تیم را ناامید می‌کند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.064Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.064Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3476,
        "sentence_en": "The company just built a gigantic warehouse on the edge of town.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "شرکت به تازگی یک انبار غول پیکر در حاشیه شهر ساخته است.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.065Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.065Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3477,
        "sentence_en": "The polished floor gleamed in the sunlight.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "کف صیقلی زیر نور خورشید می‌درخشید.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.065Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.065Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3478,
        "sentence_en": "The living room felt gloomy with all the curtains closed.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "اتاق نشیمن با تمام پرده‌های بسته، تاریک و غمگین به نظر می‌رسید.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.065Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.065Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3479,
        "sentence_en": "I am truly grateful for all the help you've given me.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "من واقعاً بابت تمام کمک‌هایی که به من کرده‌اید سپاسگزار هستم.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.066Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.066Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3480,
        "sentence_en": "She needs some time alone to grieve her father's passing.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او به مدتی زمان تنهایی نیاز دارد تا برای درگذشت پدرش عزاداری کند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.066Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.066Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3481,
        "sentence_en": "He regretted making a hasty decision without thinking it through.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او از گرفتن یک تصمیم عجولانه بدون فکر کردن به آن پشیمان شد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.066Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.066Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3482,
        "sentence_en": "Icy roads are a major hazard for drivers during the winter months.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "جاده‌های یخ‌زده یک خطر بزرگ برای رانندگان در طول ماه‌های زمستان هستند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.066Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.066Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3483,
        "sentence_en": "He gave me a hostile look during the meeting.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او در طول جلسه نگاهی خصمانه به من انداخت.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.067Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.067Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3484,
        "sentence_en": "Despite his fame, he remains a very humble person.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "با وجود شهرتش، او همچنان فرد بسیار فروتنی است.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.067Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.067Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3485,
        "sentence_en": "It’s so humid outside that my shirt is sticking to me.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "بیرون آنقدر مرطوب است که پیراهنم به تنم چسبیده است.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.067Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.067Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3486,
        "sentence_en": "The hurricane caused massive power outages across the entire state.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "این توفان شدید باعث قطعی گسترده برق در سراسر ایالت شد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.068Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-23T07:03:45.435Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3487,
        "sentence_en": "He is not stupid, just ignorant of the current situation.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او احمق نیست، فقط نسبت به وضعیت فعلی نادان است.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.068Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.068Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3488,
        "sentence_en": "He was under the illusion that he could finish the project alone.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او تحت این توهم بود که می‌تواند پروژه را به تنهایی تمام کند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.069Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.069Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3489,
        "sentence_en": "The new museum is an immense building with dozens of galleries.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "موزه جدید ساختمان عظیمی با ده‌ها گالری است.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.069Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.069Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3490,
        "sentence_en": "He tried to impress his boss with the new project results.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او سعی کرد با نتایج پروژه جدید رئیسش را تحت تاثیر قرار دهد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.069Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.069Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3491,
        "sentence_en": "The thermometer indicates that he has a slight fever.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "دماسنج نشان می‌دهد که او تب مختصری دارد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.069Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.069Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3492,
        "sentence_en": "He seemed completely indifferent to the news of his promotion.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او نسبت به خبر ترفیعش کاملاً بی تفاوت به نظر می‌رسید.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.070Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.070Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3493,
        "sentence_en": "The most industrious employees are often rewarded with a year-end bonus.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "کوشاترین کارکنان اغلب با پاداش پایان سال مورد تقدیر قرار می‌گیرند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.070Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.070Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3494,
        "sentence_en": "A single sneeze can infect everyone in the small room.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "یک عطسه می‌تواند همه افراد را در آن اتاق کوچک آلوده کند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.070Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.070Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3495,
        "sentence_en": "The quality of this cheaper brand is clearly inferior to the original.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "کیفیت این برند ارزان‌تر، به وضوح از نسخه اصلی پایین تر است.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.071Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.071Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3496,
        "sentence_en": "Several rare species of birds inhabit the island's coastal forests.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "چندین گونه کمیاب از پرندگان در جنگل‌های ساحلی جزیره سکونت دارند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.071Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.071Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3497,
        "sentence_en": "I insisted on paying for the dinner myself.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "من اصرار کردم که خودم پول شام را پرداخت کنم.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.071Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.071Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3498,
        "sentence_en": "Please don't insult my intelligence by lying to me.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "لطفاً با دروغ گفتن به من، به هوش من توهین نکن.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.072Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.072Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3499,
        "sentence_en": "The competition for the scholarship was very intense this year.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "رقابت برای بورسیه تحصیلی امسال بسیار شدید بود.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.072Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.072Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3500,
        "sentence_en": "Scientists are trying to interpret the data from the recent experiment.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "دانشمندان در تلاش هستند تا داده‌های آزمایش اخیر را تفسیر کنند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.072Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.072Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3501,
        "sentence_en": "I’m sorry to interrupt, but there’s a phone call for you.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "ببخشید که حرفتان را قطع می‌کنم، اما یک تماس تلفنی دارید.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.073Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.073Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3502,
        "sentence_en": "The constant noise from the construction site became intolerable.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "صدای مداوم از محل ساخت‌وساز غیرقابل تحمل شد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.073Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.073Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3503,
        "sentence_en": "The watchmaker carefully assembled the intricate gears of the clock.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "ساعت‌ساز با دقت چرخ‌دنده‌های پیچیده ساعت را سر هم کرد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.073Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.073Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3504,
        "sentence_en": "The army was prepared to invade the neighboring country at dawn.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "ارتش آماده بود در سپیده‌دم به کشور همسایه حمله کند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.074Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.074Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3505,
        "sentence_en": "His constant whistling began to irritate everyone in the office.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "سوت زدن مداوم او شروع به آزار دادن همه در دفتر کرد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.074Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.074Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3506,
        "sentence_en": "The doctors had to isolate the patient to prevent the virus from spreading.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "پزشکان مجبور شدند برای جلوگیری از انتشار ویروس، بیمار را جدا کنند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.074Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.074Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3507,
        "sentence_en": "He has always been jealous of his brother's success.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او همیشه به موفقیت برادرش حسود بوده است.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.075Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.075Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3508,
        "sentence_en": "The judge's decision was a victory for truth and justice.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "تصمیم قاضی پیروزی‌ای برای حقیقت و عدالت بود.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.075Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.075Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3509,
        "sentence_en": "She has a legal liability to pay for the damages.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او مسئولیت قانونی برای پرداخت خسارات دارد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.076Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.076Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3510,
        "sentence_en": "The patient suffered severe head trauma after the car accident.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "بیمار پس از تصادف رانندگی دچار آسیب جسمی شدید سر شد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.076Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.076Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3511,
        "sentence_en": "He reluctantly agreed to work overtime on a Friday night.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او از روی کراهت موافقت کرد که جمعه شب اضافه‌کاری کند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.076Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.076Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3512,
        "sentence_en": "The homeless man was dressed in dirty rags.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "مرد بی‌خانمان لباس کهنه و پاره‌پاره به تن داشت.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.077Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.077Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3513,
        "sentence_en": "Rioters began to loot the local stores during the citywide blackout.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "آشوبگران در طول قطعی برق سراسری شهر، شروع به به تاراج بردن فروشگاه‌های محلی کردند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.077Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.077Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3514,
        "sentence_en": "She used a wooden utensil to stir the thick soup.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او از یک ابزار چوبی برای هم زدن سوپ غلیظ استفاده کرد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.077Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.077Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3515,
        "sentence_en": "We don't anticipate any problems with the new software update.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "ما انتظار هیچ مشکلی را در مورد به‌روزرسانی جدید نرم‌افزار نداریم.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.078Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.078Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3516,
        "sentence_en": "The test measures both mathematical and verbal ability.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "این آزمون هم توانایی ریاضی و هم توانایی واژگانی را می‌سنجد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.078Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.078Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3517,
        "sentence_en": "Give him a chance to cool off before you ask any more questions.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "قبل از اینکه سوالات بیشتری بپرسی، به او فرصت بده تا خودش را آرام کند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.078Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.078Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3518,
        "sentence_en": "The redemption of the bonds will take place at the end of the year.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "استرداد اوراق قرضه در پایان سال انجام خواهد شد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.079Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.079Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3519,
        "sentence_en": "That is precisely what I was trying to say.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "این دقیقا همان چیزی است که سعی داشتم بگویم.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.079Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.079Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3520,
        "sentence_en": "The applicant did not meet the basic requirements for the job.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "متقاضی الزامات اولیه برای این شغل را نداشت.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.079Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.079Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3521,
        "sentence_en": "She stepped forth from the crowd to voice her concerns.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او برای بیان نگرانی‌هایش از میان جمعیت به جلو قدم گذاشت.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.079Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.079Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3522,
        "sentence_en": "The teacher gave him a demerit for talking during the lesson.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "معلم به خاطر صحبت کردن در طول درس به او یک پوان منفی داد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.080Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.080Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3523,
        "sentence_en": "An adjective usually comes before the noun in English.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "در انگلیسی معمولاً یک صفت قبل از اسم می‌آید.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.080Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.080Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3524,
        "sentence_en": "You should add an adverb to the sentence to describe the action better.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "شما باید برای توصیف بهتر عمل، یک قید به جمله اضافه کنید.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.080Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.080Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3525,
        "sentence_en": "You must follow the instructions carefully to complete the task.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "شما باید برای انجام کار، به دقت از دستورالعمل‌ها پیروی کنید.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.081Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.081Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3526,
        "sentence_en": "Please read the last sentence of the email again.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "لطفاً آخرین جمله ایمیل را دوباره بخوانید.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.081Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.081Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3527,
        "sentence_en": "Try to include this specific phrase in your introductory paragraph.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "سعی کن این جمله‌واره خاص را در پاراگراف مقدمه خود بگنجانی.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.081Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.081Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3528,
        "sentence_en": "Please fill in the blank with your phone number.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "لطفاً جای خالی را با شماره تلفن خود پر کنید.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.082Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.082Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3529,
        "sentence_en": "Please read the first paragraph of the report out loud.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "لطفاً پاراگراف اول گزارش را با صدای بلند بخوانید.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.083Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.083Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3530,
        "sentence_en": "Can you give me an example of how this software works?",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "می‌توانی یک نمونه از نحوه کار این نرم‌افزار به من بدهی؟",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.084Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.084Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3531,
        "sentence_en": "I'm taking the morning train to the city for work.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "من برای رفتن به سر کار، با قطار صبح به شهر می‌روم.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.084Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.084Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3532,
        "sentence_en": "He decided to take a shower after his long workout at the gym.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او تصمیم گرفت بعد از تمرین طولانی‌اش در باشگاه دوش بگیرد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.086Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.086Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3533,
        "sentence_en": "Most English learners struggle with choosing the right preposition.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "اکثر زبان‌آموزان انگلیسی با انتخاب حرف اضافه درست مشکل دارند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.087Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.087Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3534,
        "sentence_en": "The subject of the sentence usually performs the action.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "فاعلِ جمله معمولاً عمل را انجام می‌دهد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.087Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.087Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3535,
        "sentence_en": "I don't understand the meaning of this word.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "من معنی این کلمه را نمی‌فهمم.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.087Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.087Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3536,
        "sentence_en": "Make sure to use the singular form of the noun in this sentence.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "مطمئن شو که در این جمله از شکل مفرد اسم استفاده کنی.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.088Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.088Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3537,
        "sentence_en": "Always check your grammar before submitting an important email.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "همیشه قبل از ارسال یک ایمیل مهم، دستور زبان خود را چک کنید.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.088Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.088Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3538,
        "sentence_en": "It takes forever to match all the socks after doing laundry.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "جفت کردن تمام جوراب‌ها بعد از شستن لباس‌ها کلی وقت می‌گیرد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.088Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.088Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3539,
        "sentence_en": "Please make sure all the information on this form is correct.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "لطفاً مطمئن شوید که تمام اطلاعات این فرم صحیح است.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.089Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.089Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3540,
        "sentence_en": "There is a small mistake in the final report.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "یک اشتباه کوچک در گزارش نهایی وجود دارد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.089Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.089Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3541,
        "sentence_en": "The teacher asked the students to underline every noun in the paragraph.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "معلم از دانش‌آموزان خواست که زیر هر اسم در پاراگراف خط بکشند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.089Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.089Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3542,
        "sentence_en": "I usually do my homework right after I get home from school.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "من معمولاً درست بعد از اینکه از مدرسه به خانه می‌رسم، تکلیف انجام می‌دهم.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.090Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.090Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3543,
        "sentence_en": "She didn't know how to answer his difficult question.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او نمی‌دانست چطور به سؤال دشوار او پاسخ دهد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.090Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.090Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3544,
        "sentence_en": "Please fill in your contact information on this application form.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "لطفاً اطلاعات تماس خود را در این فرم درخواست پر کنید.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.090Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.090Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3545,
        "sentence_en": "If you have a question about the project, feel free to ask.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "اگر در مورد پروژه سوالی دارید، راحت باشید و بپرسید.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.090Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.090Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3546,
        "sentence_en": "Don't forget to put a question mark at the end of your sentence.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "فراموش نکن که در پایان جمله‌ات یک علامت سوال بگذاری.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.091Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.091Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3547,
        "sentence_en": "She is learning a new language to travel to France.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او برای سفر به فرانسه در حال یادگیری یک زبان جدید است.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.091Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.091Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3548,
        "sentence_en": "You should add more details to your report.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "شما باید جزئیات بیشتری به گزارش خود بیفزایید.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.091Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.091Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3549,
        "sentence_en": "You forgot to put a period at the end of that sentence.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "تو فراموش کردی که در انتهای آن جمله یک نقطه بگذاری.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.092Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.092Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3550,
        "sentence_en": "You should follow every instruction carefully to avoid any mistakes.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "شما باید برای جلوگیری از هرگونه اشتباه، هر دستور را به دقت دنبال کنید.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.092Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.092Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3551,
        "sentence_en": "Every complete sentence must have at least one verb.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "هر جمله کامل باید حداقل یک فعل داشته باشد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.093Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.093Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3552,
        "sentence_en": "It took him several months to complete the research project.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "چندین ماه طول کشید تا او پروژه تحقیقاتی را کامل کند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.094Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.094Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3553,
        "sentence_en": "Make sure to use the plural form of the noun here.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "حتما از صورت جمع اسم در اینجا استفاده کنید.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.094Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.094Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3554,
        "sentence_en": "The cow stood quietly in the field chewing grass.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "گاو در مزرعه آرام ایستاده بود و علف می‌جوید.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.097Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.097Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3555,
        "sentence_en": "She baked an apple pie for the family dinner.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او برای شام خانوادگی یک پایِ سیب پخت.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.097Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.097Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3556,
        "sentence_en": "He picked a pea off his plate and laughed.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او یک نخودفرنگی از بشقابش برداشت و خندید.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.098Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.098Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3557,
        "sentence_en": "The child refused to sleep without his favorite toy.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "کودک بدون اسباب‌بازیِ موردعلاقه‌اش حاضر نشد بخوابد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.095Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.095Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3558,
        "sentence_en": "I left the key on the kitchen counter this morning.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "امروز صبح کلید را روی پیشخوانِ آشپزخانه گذاشتم.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.095Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.095Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3559,
        "sentence_en": "I usually drink tea in the afternoon to relax.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "من معمولاً بعدازظهر برای آرام شدن چای می‌نوشم.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.096Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.096Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3560,
        "sentence_en": "She tied a red bow around the gift box.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او یک پاپیون قرمز دور جعبهٔ هدیه بست.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.097Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.097Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3561,
        "sentence_en": "She cracked an egg into the pan for breakfast.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او برای صبحانه یک تخم‌مرغ داخل تابه شکست.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.096Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.096Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3562,
        "sentence_en": "This shoe hurts my heel after walking a few blocks.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "این کفش بعد از چند خیابان راه رفتن پاشنهٔ پایم را درد می‌آورد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.095Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.095Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3563,
        "sentence_en": "A bee landed on my arm while I was gardening.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "هنگام باغبانی یک زنبور روی بازوی من نشست.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.096Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T15:10:50.096Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3564,
        "sentence_en": "They use barley to make bread and beer.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "آن‌ها از جو برای درست کردن نان و آبجو استفاده می‌کنند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T22:07:27.751Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T22:10:45.707Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3565,
        "sentence_en": "I eat oat with milk for breakfast every morning.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "من هر صبح برای صبحانه جو دوسر را با شیر می‌خورم.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-07T22:07:27.755Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-07T22:10:45.703Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3566,
        "sentence_en": "The app uses dark mode as the default setting.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "برنامه از حالت تاریک به عنوان تنظیم پیش فرض استفاده می‌کند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-14T03:51:08.287Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-14T04:02:27.237Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3567,
        "sentence_en": "The mobile layout keeps the controls easy to reach.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "چیدمان موبایل دسترسی به کنترل ها را آسان نگه می دارد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-14T03:51:08.307Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-06-10T15:41:31.121Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3568,
        "sentence_en": "The contact page loads quickly on my phone.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "صفحه تماس روی گوشی من سریع بارگذاری می‌شود.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-14T03:51:08.318Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-14T04:02:27.229Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3570,
        "sentence_en": "The server fetches the tenant settings before rendering the page.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "سرور پیش از رندر کردن صفحه تنظیمات مستاجر را دریافت می کند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-14T03:51:08.328Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-06-10T15:41:31.298Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3571,
        "sentence_en": "We store user data securely in the database.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "ما داده کاربر را به‌صورت امن در پایگاه داده ذخیره می‌کنیم.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-14T03:51:08.336Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-14T04:02:27.221Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3572,
        "sentence_en": "The page renders instantly after the data is loaded.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "صفحه بلافاصله پس از بارگذاری داده‌ها رندر کردن می‌شود.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-14T03:51:08.340Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-14T04:02:27.218Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3573,
        "sentence_en": "This part of the app handles user authentication.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "این بخش از برنامه احراز هویت کاربر را مدیریت می‌کند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-14T03:51:08.345Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-14T04:02:27.214Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3574,
        "sentence_en": "You can optionally enable notifications in the settings menu.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "می‌توانید به صورت اختیاری اعلان‌ها را در منوی تنظیمات فعال کنید.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-14T03:51:08.351Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-14T04:02:27.210Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3575,
        "sentence_en": "The system caches results to improve loading speed.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "سیستم ذخیره موقت نتایج را برای بهبود سرعت بارگذاری انجام می‌دهد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-14T03:51:08.355Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-14T04:02:27.206Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3576,
        "sentence_en": "The result appears immediately after you submit the form.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "نتیجه بلافاصله پس از ارسال فرم ظاهر می‌شود.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-14T03:51:08.361Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-14T04:02:27.203Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3577,
        "sentence_en": "The server streams content while the rest is still loading.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "سرور ارسال تدریجی محتوا را انجام می‌دهد در حالی که بقیه هنوز در حال بارگذاری است.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-14T03:51:08.370Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-14T04:02:27.200Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3578,
        "sentence_en": "The client interacts with the interface through simple actions.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "کاربر از طریق اقدامات ساده با رابط تعامل می‌کند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-14T03:51:08.376Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-07-06T15:32:57.714Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3579,
        "sentence_en": "Interactivity improves user engagement on modern websites.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "تعامل پذیری باعث بهبود درگیری کاربر در وب‌سایت‌های مدرن می‌شود.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-14T03:51:08.382Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-14T04:02:27.193Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3580,
        "sentence_en": "The browser displays the updated page after each change.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "مرورگر صفحه به‌روزرسانی‌شده را پس از هر تغییر نمایش می‌دهد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-14T03:51:08.385Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-14T04:02:27.189Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3581,
        "sentence_en": "We layer new features on top of the existing system.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "ما افزودن لایه ای ویژگی‌های جدید را روی سیستم موجود انجام می‌دهیم.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-14T03:51:08.389Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-14T04:02:27.185Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3582,
        "sentence_en": "This update adds new functionality to the application.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "این به‌روزرسانی قابلیت جدیدی به برنامه اضافه می‌کند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-14T03:51:08.393Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-14T04:02:27.181Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3583,
        "sentence_en": "Can you explain how this feature works in simple terms?",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "می‌توانی توضیح دادن چگونه این قابلیت کار می‌کند به صورت ساده؟",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-14T03:51:08.397Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-14T04:02:27.175Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3584,
        "sentence_en": "We compose the interface using smaller reusable components.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "ما رابط را با استفاده از اجزای کوچک قابل استفاده مجدد ترکیب می‌کنیم.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-14T03:51:08.403Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-14T04:02:27.171Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3585,
        "sentence_en": "This application helps users manage their daily tasks efficiently.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "این برنامه به کاربران کمک می‌کند کارهای روزانه خود را به‌طور کارآمد مدیریت کنند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-14T03:51:08.407Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-14T04:02:27.165Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3586,
        "sentence_en": "The Liberal won several key seats in the national election.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "حزب لیبرال چندین کرسی کلیدی را در انتخابات ملی برد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-14T07:37:37.384Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-14T07:40:05.024Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3587,
        "sentence_en": "The party plans to form a new government this week.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "حزب برنامه دارد این هفته یک دولت جدید تشکیل دادن.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-14T07:37:37.400Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-14T07:40:05.003Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3588,
        "sentence_en": "They celebrated a historic victory after years of effort.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "آنها پس از سال‌ها تلاش یک پیروزی تاریخی را جشن گرفتند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-14T07:37:37.416Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-14T07:40:04.991Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3589,
        "sentence_en": "The party secured a majority government after the final vote count.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "حزب پس از شمارش نهایی آرا یک دولت اکثریت به دست آورد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-14T07:37:37.428Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-14T07:40:04.977Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3590,
        "sentence_en": "They swept the election by winning nearly every district.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "آنها انتخابات را با بردن تقریباً هر حوزه قاطعانه بردن.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-14T07:37:37.434Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-14T07:40:04.961Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3591,
        "sentence_en": "The seat was decided in a byelection after the resignation.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "این کرسی پس از استعفا در یک انتخابات میان دوره ای تعیین شد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-14T07:37:37.449Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-14T07:40:04.950Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3592,
        "sentence_en": "The party is set to announce its final decision tomorrow.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "حزب در آستانه بودن اعلام تصمیم نهایی خود فردا است.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-14T07:42:08.548Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-14T07:43:38.929Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3593,
        "sentence_en": "They held a press conference after the final count.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "آنها یک کنفرانس خبری پس از شمارش نهایی برگزار کردند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-14T07:42:08.572Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-14T07:43:38.919Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3594,
        "sentence_en": "They won three seats in yesterday's vote.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "آنها سه کرسی را در رأی‌گیری دیروز بردند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-14T07:42:08.585Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-14T07:43:38.905Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3595,
        "sentence_en": "The scandal made the front page of every major newspaper.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "این رسوایی صفحه اول هر روزنامه بزرگ را به دست آورد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-16T23:20:15.106Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-16T23:26:25.419Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3596,
        "sentence_en": "She made a public plea for help finding her dog.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او یک درخواست عمومی برای کمک در پیدا کردن سگش انجام داد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-16T23:20:15.127Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-16T23:26:25.415Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3597,
        "sentence_en": "He decided to leave smoking after years of trying.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او تصمیم گرفت پس از سال‌ها تلاش از سیگار کشیدن دست کشیدن از.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-16T23:20:15.134Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-16T23:26:25.411Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3598,
        "sentence_en": "The committee reviewed the proposal before making a decision.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "کمیته پیشنهاد را قبل از تصمیم‌گیری بررسی کرد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-16T23:20:15.140Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-16T23:26:25.407Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3599,
        "sentence_en": "Just leave him alone for a while to calm down.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "فقط او را برای مدتی به حال خود رها کن تا آرام شود.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-16T23:20:15.145Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-16T23:26:25.403Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3600,
        "sentence_en": "The victim reported the incident to the police immediately.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "قربانی حادثه را فوراً به پلیس گزارش داد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-16T23:20:15.150Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-16T23:26:25.399Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3601,
        "sentence_en": "They described the accident as a horrific scene.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "آنها حادثه را به عنوان صحنه‌ای هولناک توصیف کردند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-16T23:20:15.153Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-16T23:26:25.396Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3602,
        "sentence_en": "The court handled the rape case with strict confidentiality.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "دادگاه پرونده تجاوز را با محرمانگی شدید بررسی کرد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-16T23:20:15.156Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-16T23:26:25.393Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3603,
        "sentence_en": "The lawyer prepared carefully for the court case.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "وکیل برای پرونده دادگاه با دقت آماده شد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-16T23:20:15.161Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-16T23:26:25.389Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3604,
        "sentence_en": "He finally decided to tell the truth about what happened.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او بالاخره تصمیم گرفت حقیقت را بازگو کردن درباره آنچه رخ داد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-16T23:20:15.164Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-16T23:26:25.385Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3605,
        "sentence_en": "She shared her story during the interview on TV.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او داستان خود را در طول مصاحبه در تلویزیون بازگو کرد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-16T23:20:15.169Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-16T23:26:25.380Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3606,
        "sentence_en": "He has conservative views on economic policies.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او دیدگاه‌های محافظه کار در سیاست‌های اقتصادی دارد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-16T23:20:15.173Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-16T23:26:25.377Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3607,
        "sentence_en": "They called on the government to take immediate action.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "آنها از دولت درخواست کردن از تا اقدام فوری انجام دهد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-16T23:20:15.178Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-16T23:26:25.372Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3608,
        "sentence_en": "They tried to stack the deck to guarantee a win.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "آنها تلاش کردند نتیجه را مهندسی کردن تا پیروزی را تضمین کنند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-16T23:20:15.183Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-16T23:26:25.368Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3609,
        "sentence_en": "They felt shut out of the decision-making process.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "آنها احساس کردند از روند تصمیم‌گیری کنار گذاشتن شده‌اند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-16T23:20:15.190Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-16T23:26:25.363Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3610,
        "sentence_en": "The opposition criticized the new policy strongly.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "مخالفان به شدت سیاست جدید را مورد انتقاد قرار دادند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-16T23:20:15.196Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-16T23:26:25.360Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3611,
        "sentence_en": "The company faced unprecedented challenges during the crisis.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "شرکت در طول بحران با چالش‌های بی سابقه روبرو شد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-16T23:20:15.205Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-16T23:26:25.355Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3612,
        "sentence_en": "We are entering unfamiliar territory with this new strategy.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "ما با این راهبرد جدید وارد وضعیت ناآشنا می‌شویم.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-16T23:20:15.209Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-16T23:26:25.350Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3613,
        "sentence_en": "He referred to the report during his presentation.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او در ارائه خود به گزارش اشاره کردن.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-16T23:20:15.213Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-16T23:26:25.345Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3614,
        "sentence_en": "She supports liberal policies on social issues.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او از سیاست‌های لیبرال در مسائل اجتماعی حمایت می‌کند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-16T23:20:15.217Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-16T23:26:25.341Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3615,
        "sentence_en": "The government announced new measures to control inflation.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "دولت اقدامات جدیدی برای کنترل تورم اعلام کرد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-16T23:20:15.220Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-16T23:26:25.336Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3616,
        "sentence_en": "She worked hard to reach her career goals.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او سخت کار کرد تا به اهداف شغلی خود دستیابی پیدا کردن.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-16T23:20:15.224Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-16T23:26:25.331Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3617,
        "sentence_en": "He checked the status of his application online.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او وضعیت درخواست خود را به صورت آنلاین بررسی کرد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-16T23:20:15.227Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-16T23:26:25.327Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3618,
        "sentence_en": "The project was largely successful despite a few delays.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "پروژه عمدتاً موفق بود با وجود چند تأخیر.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-16T23:20:15.231Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-16T23:26:25.321Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3619,
        "sentence_en": "The meeting was canceled because of the storm.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "جلسه به دلیل طوفان لغو شد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-16T23:20:15.235Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-16T23:26:25.316Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3620,
        "sentence_en": "An opposition MP raised concerns during the debate.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "یک نماینده مخالف در طول بحث نگرانی‌هایی را مطرح کرد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-16T23:20:15.238Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-16T23:26:25.313Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3621,
        "sentence_en": "He decided to cross the floor and join the ruling party.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او تصمیم گرفت تغییر حزب دادن و به حزب حاکم پیوستن.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-16T23:20:15.242Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-16T23:26:25.308Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3622,
        "sentence_en": "She decided to join the team after the interview.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او تصمیم گرفت پس از مصاحبه به تیم پیوستن.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-16T23:20:15.245Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-16T23:26:25.298Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3623,
        "sentence_en": "They vowed to uphold the principles of the organization.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "آنها قول دادند به اصول سازمان پایبند بودن به.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-16T23:20:15.255Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-16T23:26:25.294Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3624,
        "sentence_en": "They follow a long-standing family tradition every year.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "آنها هر سال از یک سنت خانوادگی دیرینه پیروی می‌کنند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-16T23:20:15.264Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-24T17:55:52.318Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3625,
        "sentence_en": "The makeup of the team changed after new members joined.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "ترکیب تیم پس از پیوستن اعضای جدید تغییر کرد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-16T23:20:15.271Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-16T23:26:25.280Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3626,
        "sentence_en": "They discussed key parliamentary procedures during the session.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "آنها در جلسه درباره روندهای پارلمانی کلیدی بحث کردند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-16T23:20:15.279Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-16T23:26:25.274Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3627,
        "sentence_en": "The jury will decide the outcome of the trial.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "هیئت منصفه نتیجه پرونده را تعیین خواهد کرد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-16T23:20:15.295Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-16T23:26:25.269Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3628,
        "sentence_en": "He gained popularity after the last election results.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او پس از نتایج انتخابات اخیر محبوبیت به دست آورد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-16T23:20:15.299Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-16T23:26:25.260Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3629,
        "sentence_en": "Thanks for your help with the project yesterday.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "از کمک تو در پروژه دیروز متشکرم.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-17T00:34:52.806Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-17T00:36:50.363Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3630,
        "sentence_en": "Please sit down and make yourself comfortable.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "لطفاً نشستن و خودت را راحت کن.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-17T00:34:52.814Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-17T00:36:50.355Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3631,
        "sentence_en": "I would rather stay home than go out tonight.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "من ترجیح دادن در خانه بمانم تا امشب بیرون رفتن.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-17T00:34:52.820Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-17T00:36:50.349Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3632,
        "sentence_en": "We decided to stay at the hotel for another night.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "ما تصمیم گرفتیم برای یک شب دیگر در هتل ماندن.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-17T00:34:52.824Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-17T00:36:50.341Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3633,
        "sentence_en": "I would prefer to talk about this in person.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "من ترجیح دادن که درباره این موضوع حضوری صحبت کنم.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-17T00:34:52.829Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-17T00:36:50.333Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3634,
        "sentence_en": "We usually go to the gym after work.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "ما معمولاً پس از کار به باشگاه رفتن.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-17T00:34:52.832Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-17T00:36:50.324Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3635,
        "sentence_en": "I would like to order something light for lunch.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "من مایل بودن که برای ناهار چیزی سبک سفارش بدهم.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-17T00:34:52.836Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-17T00:36:50.316Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3636,
        "sentence_en": "I would love to visit Italy someday.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "من خیلی دوست داشتن که روزی از ایتالیا دیدن کنم.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-17T00:34:52.841Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-17T00:36:50.303Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3637,
        "sentence_en": "I would hate to lose this opportunity.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "من متنفر بودن از اینکه این فرصت را از دست بدهم.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-17T00:34:52.847Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-17T00:36:50.295Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3638,
        "sentence_en": "Would you mind opening the door for me?",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "ممکن است لطفا در را برای من باز کردن؟",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-17T00:34:52.851Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-17T00:36:50.276Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3639,
        "sentence_en": "They tried to force him to sign the contract.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "آن‌ها تلاش کردند او را مجبور کردن به امضای قرارداد کنند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-22T00:23:07.254Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-22T02:51:37.440Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3640,
        "sentence_en": "Her experience trumped his technical skills in the interview.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "تجربه او مهارت‌های فنی او را مغلوب ساختن کرد در مصاحبه.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-22T00:23:07.287Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-22T02:51:37.424Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3641,
        "sentence_en": "Innovation can trump price in a competitive market.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "نوآوری می‌تواند در بازار رقابتی پیشی جستن قیمت را داشته باشد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-22T00:23:07.306Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-22T02:51:37.408Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3642,
        "sentence_en": "The sink is clogged, and water won’t go down the drain.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "سینک گرفته است و آب وارد لوله فاضلاب نمی‌شود.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-22T00:23:07.322Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-22T02:51:37.393Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3643,
        "sentence_en": "Rainwater flowed quickly into the street drain after the storm.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "آب باران پس از طوفان به سرعت وارد آبریز خیابان شد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-22T00:23:07.337Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-22T02:51:37.377Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3644,
        "sentence_en": "She placed a custom order for a handmade table.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او یک سفارش سفارشی برای یک میز دست‌ساز ثبت کرد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-22T00:23:07.352Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-05-05T07:57:53.116Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3645,
        "sentence_en": "The shop offers custom furniture for special requests.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "فروشگاه مبلمان خرید برای درخواست‌های ویژه ارائه می‌دهد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-22T00:23:07.367Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-22T02:51:37.347Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3646,
        "sentence_en": "His sudden anger surprised everyone in the room.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "عصبانیت ناگهانی او همه را در اتاق شگفت‌زده کرد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-22T00:23:07.384Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-22T02:51:37.332Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3647,
        "sentence_en": "I can’t put up with this noise any longer.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "من دیگر نمی‌توانم این صدا را تحمل کردن کنم.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-22T00:23:07.402Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-22T02:51:37.315Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3648,
        "sentence_en": "They plan to put up a new building downtown.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "آن‌ها برنامه دارند یک ساختمان جدید در مرکز شهر ساختن کنند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-22T00:23:07.416Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-22T02:51:37.299Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3649,
        "sentence_en": "She submitted her application for the job yesterday.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او تقاضا خود را برای شغل دیروز ارسال کرد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-22T00:23:07.431Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-22T02:51:37.283Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3650,
        "sentence_en": "His visa application was approved after two weeks.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "درخواست ویزای او پس از دو هفته تأیید شد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-22T00:23:07.446Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-22T02:51:37.268Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3651,
        "sentence_en": "She set out to build her own business from scratch.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او شروع به کار کردن کرد تا کسب‌وکار خودش را از صفر بسازد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-22T00:23:07.463Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-22T02:51:37.253Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3652,
        "sentence_en": "We set out early to avoid traffic on the highway.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "ما صبح زود شروع کردن کردیم تا از ترافیک در بزرگراه جلوگیری کنیم.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-22T00:23:07.476Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-22T02:51:37.237Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3653,
        "sentence_en": "They have a vast network of international partners.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "آن‌ها یک شبکه گسترده از شرکای بین‌المللی دارند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-22T00:23:07.494Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-22T02:51:37.222Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3654,
        "sentence_en": "He made a vast amount of money in real estate.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او مقدار هنگفتی پول در املاک به دست آورد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-22T00:23:07.508Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-22T02:51:37.206Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3655,
        "sentence_en": "The teacher takes roll at the start of every class.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "معلم در ابتدای هر کلاس حضور غیاب می‌کند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-22T00:23:07.522Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-22T02:51:37.190Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3656,
        "sentence_en": "The map shows the topography of the mountainous region.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "نقشه مکان نگاری منطقه کوهستانی را نشان می‌دهد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-22T00:23:07.537Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-22T02:51:37.173Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3657,
        "sentence_en": "The veterinarian checked the dog for any injuries.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "دامپزشک سگ را برای هرگونه آسیب بررسی کرد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-22T00:23:07.553Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-22T02:51:37.158Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3658,
        "sentence_en": "Her devotion to her family is truly admirable.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "فداکاری او نسبت به خانواده‌اش واقعاً قابل تحسین است.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-22T00:23:07.566Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-22T02:51:37.142Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3659,
        "sentence_en": "His self-sacrifice helped the team succeed in crisis.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "فداکاری او به تیم کمک کرد در بحران موفق شود.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-22T00:23:07.582Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-22T02:51:37.127Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3660,
        "sentence_en": "She shared her heartache with a close friend.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او درد دل خود را با یک دوست نزدیک در میان گذاشت.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-22T00:23:07.598Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-22T02:51:37.112Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3661,
        "sentence_en": "Losing the job caused him deep heartache.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "از دست دادن شغل باعث درد و عذاب روحی عمیق او شد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-22T00:23:07.613Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-22T02:51:37.097Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3662,
        "sentence_en": "She chose biology as her college major.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او زیست‌شناسی را به عنوان رشته خود در کالج انتخاب کرد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-22T00:23:07.648Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-22T02:51:37.080Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3663,
        "sentence_en": "His major requires a lot of lab work each week.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "رشته تحصیلی او هر هفته به کار آزمایشگاهی زیادی نیاز دارد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-22T00:23:07.670Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-22T02:51:37.063Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3664,
        "sentence_en": "Please enter the room quietly during the meeting.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "لطفاً در طول جلسه به آرامی وارد شدن اتاق شوید.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-22T00:23:07.698Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-22T02:51:37.045Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3665,
        "sentence_en": "Finish your homework; meantime, I’ll cook dinner.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "تکالیفت را تمام کن؛ در ضمن، من شام می‌پزم.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-22T00:23:07.716Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-22T02:51:37.028Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3666,
        "sentence_en": "His extreme views often spark heated debates online.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "دیدگاه‌های افراطی او اغلب بحث‌های داغ آنلاین ایجاد می‌کند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-22T00:23:07.734Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-22T02:51:37.010Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3667,
        "sentence_en": "Farmers water the crops early in the morning.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "کشاورزان محصولات را صبح زود آبرسانی کردن می‌کنند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-22T00:23:07.755Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-22T02:51:36.989Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3668,
        "sentence_en": "My eyes water when I chop fresh onions.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "چشم‌های من وقتی پیاز تازه خرد می‌کنم اشک آمدن.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-22T00:23:07.773Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-22T02:44:28.435Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3673,
        "sentence_en": "In terms of cost, this option is more affordable.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "از نظر هزینه این گزینه مقرون‌به‌صرفه‌تر است.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-22T00:23:07.868Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-22T02:44:28.419Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3675,
        "sentence_en": "Can you summarize the main points of the meeting?",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "می‌توانی نکات اصلی جلسه را خلاصه کنی؟",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-22T00:23:07.901Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-05-12T04:41:33.790Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3676,
        "sentence_en": "They buy products wholesale to reduce costs.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "آنها محصولات را به‌صورت عمده خریداری می‌کنند تا هزینه‌ها را کاهش دهند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-22T00:23:07.917Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-05-05T07:21:39.431Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3678,
        "sentence_en": "He swiped the card at the checkout counter.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او کارت را در صندوق کشیدن.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-22T00:25:20.483Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-22T02:44:28.345Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3679,
        "sentence_en": "Someone swiped my phone while I was distracted.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "کسی وقتی حواسم پرت بود گوشی من را قاپیدن.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-22T00:25:20.508Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-22T02:44:28.324Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3680,
        "sentence_en": "The cat swiped at my hand and ran away.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "گربه به دست من ضربه زدن و فرار کرد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-22T00:25:20.525Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-22T02:44:28.304Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3681,
        "sentence_en": "She took a swipe at her former boss online.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او در اینترنت از رئیس سابق خود بدگویی کردن.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-22T00:25:20.544Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-22T02:44:28.283Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3682,
        "sentence_en": "There was a stack of books on the floor.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "یک پشته کتاب روی زمین بود.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-22T00:25:20.559Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-22T02:44:28.264Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3683,
        "sentence_en": "He put the photos back into a neat stack.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او عکس‌ها را دوباره در یک دسته مرتب گذاشت.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-22T00:25:20.576Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-22T02:44:28.243Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3684,
        "sentence_en": "Please stack the boxes by the wall.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "لطفاً جعبه‌ها را کنار دیوار روی هم چیدن.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-22T00:25:20.590Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-22T02:44:28.221Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3685,
        "sentence_en": "They stacked supplies for the winter storm.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "آنها برای طوفان زمستانی وسایل را انباشته کردن.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-22T00:25:20.607Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-22T02:44:28.198Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3686,
        "sentence_en": "Dirty dishes stacked up in the sink overnight.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "ظرف‌های کثیف در سینک یک‌شبه انباشت شدن.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-22T00:25:20.623Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-22T02:44:28.174Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3687,
        "sentence_en": "She works on the front end, but knows the whole stack.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او در بخش فرانت‌اند کار می‌کند اما کل مجموعه فناوری را می‌شناسد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-22T00:25:20.638Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-22T02:44:28.149Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3688,
        "sentence_en": "The essay lacks coherence in the final paragraph.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "مقاله در پاراگراف پایانی انسجام ندارد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-22T00:25:20.652Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-22T02:44:28.128Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3689,
        "sentence_en": "There was no coherence between his ideas and actions.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "هیچ پیوستگی بین ایده‌ها و اعمال او وجود نداشت.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-22T00:25:20.667Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-22T02:44:28.100Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3690,
        "sentence_en": "They got trapped in their own folly.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "آنها در حماقت خود گرفتار شدند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-22T00:25:20.682Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-22T02:44:28.078Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3691,
        "sentence_en": "The grapevine grows along the fence in the backyard.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "درخت مو در امتداد حصار حیاط پشتی رشد می‌کند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-22T00:29:10.703Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-22T02:44:28.054Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3692,
        "sentence_en": "The tulips bloom brightly in the spring garden.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "لاله‌ها در باغ بهاری به‌طور درخشانی شکوفه می‌دهند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-22T00:29:10.723Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-22T02:44:28.033Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3693,
        "sentence_en": "A white lily floated gently on the water.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "یک زنبق سفید به آرامی روی آب شناور بود.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-22T00:29:10.739Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-22T02:44:28.012Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3694,
        "sentence_en": "She picked a small violet from the garden.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او یک بنفشه کوچک از باغ چید.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-22T00:29:10.753Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-22T02:44:27.992Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3695,
        "sentence_en": "He wore a carnation on his jacket at the wedding.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او در مراسم عروسی یک میخک روی کت خود داشت.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-22T00:29:10.768Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-22T02:44:27.973Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3696,
        "sentence_en": "Chrysanthemums bloom in late fall with vibrant colors.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "داوودی‌ها در اواخر پاییز با رنگ‌های زنده شکوفه می‌دهند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-22T00:29:10.782Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-22T02:44:27.954Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3697,
        "sentence_en": "The geranium sits on the windowsill in a small pot.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "شمعدانی روی طاقچه در یک گلدان کوچک قرار دارد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-22T00:29:10.793Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-29T12:09:08.160Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3698,
        "sentence_en": "The old oak provides shade during hot afternoons.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "درخت بلوط قدیمی در بعدازظهرهای گرم سایه ایجاد می‌کند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-22T00:30:35.182Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-24T18:25:45.335Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3699,
        "sentence_en": "This table is made of solid oak.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "این میز از چوب بلوط ساخته شده است.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-22T00:30:35.207Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-24T18:25:58.539Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3700,
        "sentence_en": "Tall cypress trees line the path to the house.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "درختان سرو بلند مسیر خانه را پوشانده‌اند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-22T00:30:35.223Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-05-05T07:34:35.472Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3701,
        "sentence_en": "They announced their engagement at a family dinner.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "آنها نامزدی خود را در یک شام خانوادگی اعلام کردند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-22T00:31:39.251Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-22T02:44:27.857Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3703,
        "sentence_en": "His proposal surprised her during the vacation.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "خواستگاری او در طول تعطیلات او را شگفت‌زده کرد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-22T00:31:39.293Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-22T02:44:27.791Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3704,
        "sentence_en": "She accepted his proposal without hesitation.",
