        "updatedAt": "2026-04-29T09:00:39.803Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3853,
        "sentence_en": "I believe that you can do this.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "من باور دارم اینکه تو می‌توانی این کار را انجام دهی.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-29T08:48:33.664Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-04-29T09:00:39.794Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3854,
        "sentence_en": "The old bike was covered in rust.",
