        "updatedAt": "2026-05-04T04:50:01.328Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3895,
        "sentence_en": "Stop messing about and finish your work.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "وقت تلف کردن را متوقف کن و کارت را تمام کن.",
        "createdAt": "2026-05-03T02:24:11.617Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-05-04T04:50:01.313Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3896,
        "sentence_en": "They spent the afternoon messing about in the park.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "آنها بعدازظهر را در پارک یللی تللی کردن گذراندند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-05-03T02:24:11.635Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-06-27T11:51:11.624Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3897,
        "sentence_en": "We met in the mid of the street.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "ما در وسط خیابان ملاقات کردیم.",
        "createdAt": "2026-05-03T02:24:11.651Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-06-27T16:52:51.689Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3898,
        "sentence_en": "He left in mid conversation.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او در نیمه گفتگو ترک کرد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-05-03T02:24:11.668Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-05-04T04:50:01.263Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3899,
        "sentence_en": "They developed advanced missile technology.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "آنها فناوری موشکی پیشرفته توسعه دادند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-05-03T02:24:11.685Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-05-04T04:50:01.247Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3900,
        "sentence_en": "They net off expenses against the revenue.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "آنها هزینه‌ها را در برابر درآمد خالص کردن می‌کنند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-05-03T02:24:11.701Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-05-04T04:50:01.230Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3901,
        "sentence_en": "The workers netted off the construction area.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "کارگران منطقه ساخت‌وساز را ایجاد منتطقه محافظت شده کردند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-05-03T02:24:11.717Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-05-04T04:50:01.214Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3902,
        "sentence_en": "He had nary a clue what was happening.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او نه حتی یک سرنخ از آنچه اتفاق می‌افتاد نداشت.",
        "createdAt": "2026-05-03T02:24:11.737Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-05-04T04:50:01.198Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3903,
        "sentence_en": "The net profit increased this quarter.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "سود خالص این فصل افزایش یافت.",
        "createdAt": "2026-05-03T02:24:11.752Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-05-04T04:50:01.181Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3904,
        "sentence_en": "You have no obligation to accept the offer.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "تو هیچ الزام برای پذیرفتن پیشنهاد نداری.",
        "createdAt": "2026-05-03T02:24:11.770Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-05-04T04:50:01.162Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3905,
        "sentence_en": "Teaching is a rewarding occupation.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "آموزش یک حرفه رضایت‌بخش است.",
        "createdAt": "2026-05-03T02:24:11.789Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-06-25T14:25:43.955Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3906,
        "sentence_en": "His comment caused offense at the meeting.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "نظر او در جلسه توهین ایجاد کرد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-05-03T02:24:11.806Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-06-27T16:49:22.440Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3907,
        "sentence_en": "She took offense at his rude tone.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او از لحن بی‌ادبانه‌اش دلخوری پیدا کرد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-05-03T02:24:11.822Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-05-04T04:43:23.067Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3908,
        "sentence_en": "He was charged with a serious offense.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او به یک قانون شکنی جدی متهم شد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-05-03T02:24:11.844Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-05-04T04:43:23.051Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3909,
        "sentence_en": "Any offense against the rules will be punished.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "هر تخطی از قوانین مجازات خواهد شد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-05-03T02:24:11.872Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-05-04T04:43:23.034Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3910,
        "sentence_en": "She spoke in an optimistic tone about the future.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او با لحنی خوش بینانه درباره آینده صحبت کرد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-05-03T02:24:11.887Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-05-04T04:43:23.017Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3911,
        "sentence_en": "Her positive outlook helped her succeed.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "دور نمای مثبت او به موفقیتش کمک کرد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-05-03T02:24:11.906Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-05-04T04:43:23.000Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3912,
        "sentence_en": "Their growth outstripped all competitors.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "رشد آنها از همه رقبا سبقت گرفت.",
        "createdAt": "2026-05-03T02:24:11.924Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-05-04T04:43:22.983Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3913,
        "sentence_en": "The road was fully paved last year.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "جاده پارسال کاملاً سنگفرش شده بود.",
        "createdAt": "2026-05-03T02:24:11.940Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-05-04T04:43:22.966Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3914,
        "sentence_en": "His comments were very pertinent to the issue.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "نظرهای او به موضوع بسیار به جا بودند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-05-03T02:24:11.959Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-05-04T04:43:22.952Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3915,
        "sentence_en": "She made a pertinent remark at the right time.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او در زمان درست نکته‌ای به موقع گفت.",
        "createdAt": "2026-05-03T02:24:11.975Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-05-04T04:43:22.937Z"
      },
