        "updatedAt": "2026-05-04T04:43:22.922Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3917,
        "sentence_en": "A pile of clothes covered the chair.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "توده‌ای از لباس‌ها صندلی را پوشانده بود.",
        "createdAt": "2026-05-03T02:24:12.012Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-05-04T04:43:22.906Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3918,
        "sentence_en": "They made a pile of leaves in the yard.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "آنها در حیاط کپه‌ای از برگ‌ها درست کردند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-05-03T02:24:12.033Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-05-04T04:43:22.890Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3919,
        "sentence_en": "Air pollution is a serious problem in big cities.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "آلودگی هوا در شهرهای بزرگ مشکل جدی است.",
        "createdAt": "2026-05-03T02:24:12.055Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-05-04T04:43:22.874Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3920,
        "sentence_en": "They built a small pond behind the house.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "آنها یک آبگیر کوچک پشت خانه ساختند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-05-03T02:27:04.484Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-05-04T04:43:22.859Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3921,
        "sentence_en": "He lost all his possessions in the fire.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او همه اموالش را در آتش‌سوزی از دست داد.",
