        "updatedAt": "2026-05-04T04:43:22.815Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3924,
        "sentence_en": "He questioned the premise of the entire plan.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او فرض قبلی کل برنامه را زیر سؤال برد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-05-03T02:27:04.571Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-05-04T04:43:22.800Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3925,
        "sentence_en": "This trend is prevalent among young people.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "این روند میان جوانان رایج است.",
