        "updatedAt": "2026-05-04T04:43:22.785Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3926,
        "sentence_en": "The disease is prevalent in rural areas.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "این بیماری در مناطق روستایی شایع است.",
        "createdAt": "2026-05-03T02:27:04.616Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-05-04T04:43:22.770Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3927,
        "sentence_en": "Mistakes were prevalent in the early reports.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "اشتباهات در گزارش‌های اولیه فراوان بودند.",
