        "updatedAt": "2026-05-04T04:43:22.755Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3928,
        "sentence_en": "The funeral procession was long and silent.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "مشایعین مراسم خاکسپاری طولانی و ساکت بودند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-05-03T02:27:04.666Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-05-04T04:43:22.740Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3929,
        "sentence_en": "His words prompted her to take action.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "حرف‌های او باعث شد او اقدام کند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-05-03T02:27:04.682Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-05-04T04:43:22.722Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3930,
        "sentence_en": "The delay prompted complaints from customers.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "تأخیر موجب شکایت مشتریان شد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-05-03T02:27:04.696Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-05-04T04:43:22.707Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3931,
        "sentence_en": "She worked hard to prosper in her career.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او سخت کار کرد تا در حرفه‌اش موفق شود.",
        "createdAt": "2026-05-03T02:27:04.711Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-05-04T04:43:22.692Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3932,
        "sentence_en": "They hoped to prosper in the new market.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "آنها امیدوار بودند در بازار جدید کامیاب شوند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-05-03T02:27:04.726Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-05-04T04:43:22.677Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3933,
        "sentence_en": "The business began to prosper quickly.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "کسب‌وکار به‌سرعت شروع به رونق یافتن کرد.",
