        "updatedAt": "2026-05-04T04:43:22.663Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3934,
        "sentence_en": "The company imposed punitive measures on violators.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "شرکت اقدامات تنبیهی را بر متخلفان اعمال کرد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-05-03T02:27:04.757Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-05-04T04:43:22.647Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3935,
        "sentence_en": "Strict punitive measures were introduced at school.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "اقدامات تادیبی سخت‌گیرانه‌ای در مدرسه معرفی شد.",
