        "updatedAt": "2026-05-04T04:43:22.632Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3936,
        "sentence_en": "The law includes punitive measures for serious crimes.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "قانون شامل اقدامات کیفری برای جرایم جدی است.",
        "createdAt": "2026-05-03T02:27:04.788Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-05-04T04:43:22.617Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3938,
        "sentence_en": "The quadrangle was filled with visitors.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "محوطه پر از بازدیدکنندگان بود.",
        "createdAt": "2026-05-03T02:27:04.831Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-05-04T04:43:22.601Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3939,
        "sentence_en": "Solar radiation heats the Earth's surface.",
