        "updatedAt": "2026-05-04T04:43:22.541Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3943,
        "sentence_en": "She recognized her old friend instantly.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او دوست قدیمی‌اش را فوراً به جا آورد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-05-03T02:27:04.916Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-05-04T04:43:22.526Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3944,
        "sentence_en": "Do you recognize this place?",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "آیا این مکان را می‌شناسی؟",
        "createdAt": "2026-05-03T02:27:04.932Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-05-04T04:43:22.511Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3945,
        "sentence_en": "He finally recognized his mistake.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او بالاخره اشتباهش را متوجه شد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-05-03T02:27:04.947Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-05-04T04:43:22.496Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3946,
        "sentence_en": "He seemed reluctant about the decision.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او نسبت به تصمیم مخالف به نظر می‌رسید.",
        "createdAt": "2026-05-03T02:27:04.964Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-05-04T04:43:22.481Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3947,
        "sentence_en": "His behavior was morally reprehensible.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "رفتار او از نظر اخلاقی سزاوار سرزنش بود.",
        "createdAt": "2026-05-03T02:27:04.984Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-06-27T12:05:18.121Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3948,
        "sentence_en": "Such actions are socially reprehensible.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "چنین کارهایی از نظر اجتماعی زشت هستند.",
