        "updatedAt": "2026-05-04T04:07:15.382Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 4030,
        "sentence_en": "Her eyes were filled with woe.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "چشمانش پر از غم بود.",
        "createdAt": "2026-05-03T02:28:44.923Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-05-04T04:07:15.362Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 4031,
        "sentence_en": "The poem expressed deep woe.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "شعر حزن عمیقی را بیان می‌کرد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-05-03T02:28:44.941Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-06-26T05:38:24.091Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 4032,
        "sentence_en": "The war brought woe to many families.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "جنگ برای خانواده‌های بسیاری فلاکت آورد.",
