        "updatedAt": "2026-05-04T04:07:15.322Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 4033,
        "sentence_en": "They suffered great woe after the disaster.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "آنها پس از فاجعه مصیبت بزرگی را تحمل کردند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-05-03T02:28:44.975Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-05-04T04:07:15.305Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 4034,
        "sentence_en": "Financial troubles added to his woe.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "مشکلات مالی به گرفتاری او افزود.",
        "createdAt": "2026-05-03T02:28:44.992Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-05-04T04:07:15.290Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 4035,
        "sentence_en": "He wrapped the present for her birthday.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او هدیه را برای تولدش کادو کرد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-05-03T02:28:45.021Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-05-04T04:07:15.272Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 4036,
        "sentence_en": "Add yeast to help the dough rise.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "مخمر اضافه کن تا خمیر بالا بیاید.",
        "createdAt": "2026-05-03T02:28:45.040Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-05-04T04:07:15.256Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 4037,
        "sentence_en": "He spoke with a steady cadence.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او با آهنگی یکنواخت صحبت کرد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-05-03T02:28:45.055Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-05-04T04:07:15.239Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 4038,
        "sentence_en": "This jacket is a real bargain at that price.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "این کت با آن قیمت واقعاً ارزان است.",
        "createdAt": "2026-05-03T02:30:14.046Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-05-04T04:07:15.220Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 4039,
        "sentence_en": "Gas emissions were detected near the pipeline.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "نشت گاز نزدیک خط لوله تشخیص داده شد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-05-03T02:30:14.069Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-05-04T04:07:15.201Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 4040,
        "sentence_en": "I expect a response by tomorrow.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "من تا فردا انتظار پاسخ دارم.",
        "createdAt": "2026-05-03T02:30:14.085Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-05-04T04:07:15.185Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 4041,
        "sentence_en": "He received detention for breaking school rules.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او به خاطر شکستن قوانین مدرسه بازداشت شد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-05-03T02:30:14.101Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-05-04T04:07:15.169Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 4042,
        "sentence_en": "Don't take your friends for granted.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "دوستانت را بدیهی فرض نکن.",
        "createdAt": "2026-05-03T02:30:14.116Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-05-04T04:07:15.152Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 4043,
        "sentence_en": "They lined up several meetings for next week.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "آنها چند جلسه را برای هفته آینده برنامه‌ریزی کردند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-05-03T02:30:14.134Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-05-04T04:07:15.133Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 4044,
        "sentence_en": "Please step aside and let others pass.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "لطفاً به کنار برو و بگذار دیگران عبور کنند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-05-03T02:30:14.151Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-05-04T04:07:15.113Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 4045,
        "sentence_en": "We need to stick to our budget this month.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "این ماه باید به بودجه‌مان پایبند بمانیم.",
