        "updatedAt": "2026-05-04T04:07:15.096Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 4046,
        "sentence_en": "The project received funds from the government.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "پروژه از دولت بودجه دریافت کرد.",
