        "updatedAt": "2026-05-04T04:07:15.078Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 4047,
        "sentence_en": "The teacher tried to elicit answers from students.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "معلم تلاش کرد پاسخ‌ها را از دانش‌آموزان بیرون بکشد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-05-03T02:30:14.198Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-05-04T04:07:15.062Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 4048,
        "sentence_en": "It's hard to elicit meaning from his vague words.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "استنباط معنا از حرف‌های مبهم او دشوار است.",
        "createdAt": "2026-05-03T02:30:14.211Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-05-04T04:07:15.045Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 4049,
        "sentence_en": "The survey helped elicit useful feedback.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "نظرسنجی به استخراج بازخورد مفید کمک کرد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-05-03T02:30:14.223Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-05-04T04:07:15.025Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 4050,
        "sentence_en": "We need further information before deciding.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "پیش از تصمیم‌گیری به اطلاعات بیشتری نیاز داریم.",
