        "updatedAt": "2026-05-04T04:07:14.987Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 4052,
        "sentence_en": "They launched an enquiry into the incident.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "آنها تحقیقی درباره حادثه آغاز کردند.",
