        "updatedAt": "2026-05-04T04:07:14.950Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 4054,
        "sentence_en": "They offered a discount on all items.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "آنها برای همه کالاها تخفیف ارائه کردند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-05-03T02:30:14.291Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-05-04T04:07:14.933Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 4055,
        "sentence_en": "The audience applauded loudly after the show.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "تماشاگران بعد از نمایش با صدای بلند تشویق کردند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-05-03T02:30:14.304Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-05-04T04:07:14.913Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 4056,
        "sentence_en": "This area is designated for parking only.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "این محدوده فقط برای پارکینگ تعیین شده است.",
