        "updatedAt": "2026-05-04T04:07:14.889Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 4057,
        "sentence_en": "He is the designated driver tonight.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او امشب راننده مشخص شده است.",
        "createdAt": "2026-05-03T02:30:14.333Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-05-04T02:03:27.668Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 4058,
        "sentence_en": "This plan gives us a clear advantage.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "این برنامه به ما یک مزیت روشن می‌دهد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-05-03T02:30:14.348Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-06-26T05:11:03.596Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 4059,
        "sentence_en": "I tried to get him on the phone.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "من تلاش کردم با او تلفنی تماس برقرار کنم.",
