        "updatedAt": "2026-05-04T02:03:27.628Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 4060,
        "sentence_en": "The entire team agreed with the decision.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "کل تیم با این تصمیم موافق بود.",
