        "updatedAt": "2026-05-04T02:03:27.571Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 4063,
        "sentence_en": "He spoke about the moral degradation of society.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او درباره پستی اخلاقی جامعه صحبت کرد.",
