        "updatedAt": "2026-05-04T02:03:27.537Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 4065,
        "sentence_en": "He joined a political party last year.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او سال گذشته به یک حزب سیاسی پیوست.",
