        "updatedAt": "2026-05-04T02:03:27.501Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 4067,
        "sentence_en": "He lives somewhere toward the city center.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او جایی حول و حوش مرکز شهر زندگی می‌کند.",
