        "updatedAt": "2026-05-04T02:03:27.386Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 4073,
        "sentence_en": "The old building collapsed during the storm.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "ساختمان قدیمی هنگام طوفان فروپاشید.",
