        "updatedAt": "2026-05-04T02:03:27.368Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 4074,
        "sentence_en": "The cookie began to crumble in my hand.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "کلوچه در دستم شروع به فروریختن کرد.",
