        "updatedAt": "2026-05-04T02:03:27.312Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 4077,
        "sentence_en": "She is making steady progress at work.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او در کار پیشرفت پایداری دارد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-05-03T02:34:01.518Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-05-04T02:03:27.291Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 4078,
        "sentence_en": "The editor emended several errors in the text.",
