        "updatedAt": "2026-05-04T02:03:27.259Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 4080,
        "sentence_en": "She is very empathetic toward her patients.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او نسبت به بیمارانش بسیار همدل است.",
        "createdAt": "2026-05-03T02:34:01.569Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-05-04T02:03:27.241Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 4081,
        "sentence_en": "He was sympathetic to their situation.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او نسبت به وضعیت آن‌ها دلسوز بود.",
        "createdAt": "2026-05-03T02:34:01.580Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-05-04T02:03:27.225Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 4082,
        "sentence_en": "He started a small business enterprise.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او یک بنگاه تجاری کوچک راه‌اندازی کرد.",
