        "updatedAt": "2026-05-04T02:03:27.174Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 4085,
        "sentence_en": "It was a strange episode in his career.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "این یک واقعه عجیب در حرفه او بود.",
