        "updatedAt": "2026-05-04T02:03:27.102Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 4089,
        "sentence_en": "Cost is an important factor in the decision.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "هزینه یک عامل مهم در تصمیم است.",
