        "updatedAt": "2026-05-04T02:03:27.086Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 4090,
        "sentence_en": "You must factor in all the risks.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "تو باید همه خطرها را در نظر بگیری.",
