        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "شکارچی هیولا یک شمشیر نقره ای برای هیولاها حمل می کرد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-06-27T21:53:36.139Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-06-27T21:53:36.139Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 4429,
        "sentence_en": "The sorcerer raised his hand slowly.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "جادوگر دستش را آرام بالا برد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-06-27T21:53:36.144Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-07-06T17:39:30.602Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 4430,
        "sentence_en": "The mage opened the ancient door.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "جادوگر در قدیمی را باز کرد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-06-27T21:53:36.147Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-07-06T17:46:48.027Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 4431,
        "sentence_en": "Can you describe the man you saw?",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "می توانی مردی را که دیدی توصیف کنی؟",
        "createdAt": "2026-06-27T21:53:36.152Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-06-27T21:53:36.152Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 4432,
        "sentence_en": "She took the initiative and called the client.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او پیشقدم شد و به مشتری زنگ زد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-06-27T21:53:36.156Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-06-27T21:53:36.156Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 4433,
        "sentence_en": "We used a third-party company for delivery.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "ما برای تحویل از یک شرکت ثالث استفاده کردیم.",
        "createdAt": "2026-06-27T21:53:36.159Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-06-27T21:53:36.159Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 4434,
        "sentence_en": "He installed a third-party app on his phone.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او یک برنامه غیر رسمی روی گوشی اش نصب کرد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-06-27T21:53:36.163Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-06-27T21:53:36.163Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 4435,
        "sentence_en": "She stood by the window.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او کنار پنجره ایستاد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-06-27T21:53:36.166Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-06-27T21:53:36.166Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 4436,
        "sentence_en": "My grandfather always repeats that old proverb.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "پدربزرگم همیشه آن ضرب المثل قدیمی را تکرار می کند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-06-27T21:53:36.170Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-06-27T21:53:36.170Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 4437,
        "sentence_en": "That saying reminds me of my mother.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "آن گفته مرا یاد مادرم می اندازد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-06-27T21:53:36.174Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-06-27T21:53:36.174Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 4438,
        "sentence_en": "He quoted a famous saying during the speech.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او در طول سخنرانی یک جمله معروف را نقل کرد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-06-27T21:53:36.177Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-06-27T21:53:36.177Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 4439,
        "sentence_en": "She learned a new idiom in English class.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او در کلاس انگلیسی یک اصطلاح جدید یاد گرفت.",
        "createdAt": "2026-06-27T21:53:36.181Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-06-27T21:53:36.181Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 4440,
        "sentence_en": "We were fortunate to find a safe apartment.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "ما خوش بخت بودیم که یک آپارتمان امن پیدا کردیم.",
        "createdAt": "2026-06-27T21:53:36.185Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-06-27T21:53:36.185Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 4441,
        "sentence_en": "You are lucky to have such kind friends.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "تو خوش شانس هستی که چنین دوستان مهربانی داری.",
        "createdAt": "2026-06-27T21:53:36.190Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-06-27T21:53:36.190Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 4442,
        "sentence_en": "She is practical and solves problems quickly.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او عملگرا است و مشکلات را سریع حل می کند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-06-27T21:53:36.194Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-06-27T21:53:36.194Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 4443,
        "sentence_en": "His pragmatic approach helped the team move forward.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "رویکرد عملگرای او به تیم کمک کرد جلو برود.",
        "createdAt": "2026-06-27T21:53:36.197Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-06-27T21:53:36.197Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 4444,
        "sentence_en": "Mina is a doer, not just a planner.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "مینا اهل عمل است، نه فقط برنامه ریز.",
        "createdAt": "2026-06-27T21:53:36.202Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-06-27T21:53:36.202Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 4445,
        "sentence_en": "Let's call it a day and finish tomorrow.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "بیا کار را برای امروز تمام کنیم و فردا تمامش کنیم.",
        "createdAt": "2026-06-27T21:53:36.205Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-06-27T21:53:36.205Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 4446,
        "sentence_en": "We were tired and called it a night.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "ما خسته بودیم و شب را تمام کردیم.",
        "createdAt": "2026-06-27T21:53:36.208Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-06-27T21:53:36.208Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 4447,
        "sentence_en": "After one more game, we called it a night.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "بعد از یک بازی دیگر، ما دیگر ادامه ندادیم.",
        "createdAt": "2026-06-27T21:53:36.211Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-06-27T21:53:36.211Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 4448,
        "sentence_en": "He put a freshener inside the car.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او یک خوشبو کننده داخل ماشین گذاشت.",
        "createdAt": "2026-06-27T21:53:36.215Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-06-27T21:53:36.215Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 4449,
        "sentence_en": "The air freshener made the room smell clean.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "خوشبو کننده هوا باعث شد اتاق بوی تمیزی بدهد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-06-27T21:53:36.219Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-06-27T21:53:36.219Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 4450,
        "sentence_en": "I bought a fresh loaf from the bakery.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "من یک قرص نان تازه از نانوایی خریدم.",
        "createdAt": "2026-07-13T17:27:33.841Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-07-13T17:27:33.841Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 4451,
        "sentence_en": "Take one tablet after breakfast.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "بعد از صبحانه یک قرص بخور.",
        "createdAt": "2026-07-13T17:27:33.859Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-07-13T17:27:33.859Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 4452,
        "sentence_en": "Employees should speak up when a policy feels unfair.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "کارمندان باید وقتی سیاستی ناعادلانه است نظر اعتراضی خود را بیان کنند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-07-13T17:27:33.864Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-07-13T17:27:33.864Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 4453,
        "sentence_en": "I'll check into the billing issue this afternoon.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "من امروز بعدازظهر مشکل صورتحساب را بررسی می کنم.",
        "createdAt": "2026-07-13T17:27:33.869Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-07-13T17:27:33.869Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 4454,
        "sentence_en": "Nina is engaged to her college boyfriend.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "نینا با دوست پسر دوران دانشگاهش نامزد کرده است.",
        "createdAt": "2026-07-13T17:27:33.875Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-07-13T17:27:33.875Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 4455,
        "sentence_en": "She stretched out on the chaise by the window.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او روی صندلی راحتی کشیده کنار پنجره دراز کشید.",
        "createdAt": "2026-07-13T17:27:33.879Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-07-13T17:27:33.879Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 4456,
        "sentence_en": "They gave us a freebie with our order.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "آنها همراه سفارشمان یک چیز رایگان به ما دادند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-07-13T17:27:33.887Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-07-13T17:27:33.887Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 4457,
        "sentence_en": "She curates a playlist for every road trip.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او برای هر سفر جاده ای یک فهرست پخش را گلچین می کند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-07-13T17:27:33.902Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-07-13T17:27:33.902Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 4458,
        "sentence_en": "The editor curates articles for the weekly newsletter.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "سردبیر مقاله ها را برای خبرنامه هفتگی با دقت انتخاب می کند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-07-13T17:27:33.907Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-07-13T17:27:33.907Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 4459,
        "sentence_en": "The company introduced a blanket ban on personal devices.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "شرکت یک ممنوعیت کلی برای دستگاه های شخصی وضع کرد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-07-13T17:27:33.914Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-07-13T17:27:33.914Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 4460,
        "sentence_en": "Each user can change their notification settings.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "هر کاربر می تواند تنظیمات اعلان خود را تغییر دهد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-07-13T17:27:33.930Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-07-13T17:27:33.930Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 4461,
        "sentence_en": "We finally met in person last Friday.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "ما بالاخره جمعه گذشته حضوری ملاقات کردیم.",
        "createdAt": "2026-07-13T17:27:33.934Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-07-13T17:27:33.934Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 4462,
        "sentence_en": "The old station became a shelter for vagrants.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "ایستگاه قدیمی به پناهگاهی برای ولگردها تبدیل شد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-07-13T17:27:33.937Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-07-13T17:27:33.937Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 4463,
        "sentence_en": "Police found a vagrant sleeping under the bridge.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "پلیس یک بی خانمان خیابانی را در حال خواب زیر پل پیدا کرد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-07-13T17:27:33.940Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-07-13T17:27:33.940Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 4464,
        "sentence_en": "The novel follows a vagabond traveling across the country.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "رمان زندگی یک ولگرد را در سفر سراسر کشور دنبال می کند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-07-13T17:27:33.945Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-07-13T17:27:33.945Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 4465,
        "sentence_en": "He lived as a vagabond, moving from town to town.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او مانند یک خانه به دوش از شهری به شهر دیگر می رفت.",
        "createdAt": "2026-07-13T17:27:33.949Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-07-13T17:27:33.949Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 4466,
        "sentence_en": "He became a drifter after leaving his hometown.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او پس از ترک زادگاهش به یک آدم سرگردان تبدیل شد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-07-13T17:27:33.951Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-07-13T17:27:33.951Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 4467,
        "sentence_en": "She avoids dating drifters with no steady plans.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او از رابطه با آدم های بی ثباتی که برنامه ثابتی ندارند دوری می کند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-07-13T17:27:33.954Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-07-13T17:27:33.954Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 4468,
        "sentence_en": "A lone wanderer crossed the empty field at sunset.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "یک پرسه زن تنها هنگام غروب از زمین خالی عبور کرد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-07-13T17:27:33.956Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-07-13T17:27:33.956Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 4469,
        "sentence_en": "The story follows a wanderer searching for a home.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "داستان یک آواره را دنبال می کند که دنبال خانه می گردد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-07-13T17:27:33.960Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-07-13T17:27:33.960Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 4470,
        "sentence_en": "A loiterer stood outside the store for an hour.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "کسی که بی هدف جایی می ایستد یا می چرخد، یک ساعت بیرون فروشگاه ماند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-07-13T17:27:33.963Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-07-13T17:27:33.963Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 4471,
        "sentence_en": "A bum slept on the bench near the station.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "یک ولگرد روی نیمکت نزدیک ایستگاه خوابید.",
        "createdAt": "2026-07-13T17:27:33.966Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-07-13T17:27:33.966Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 4472,
        "sentence_en": "That bum has not worked in months.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "آن بی کار ماه هاست کار نکرده است.",
        "createdAt": "2026-07-13T17:27:33.969Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-07-13T17:27:33.969Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 4473,
        "sentence_en": "Do not call him a bum just because he failed.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "فقط چون شکست خورد، او را بی عرضه صدا نکن.",
        "createdAt": "2026-07-13T17:27:33.972Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-07-13T17:27:33.972Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 4474,
        "sentence_en": "The vet treated a stray found near the highway.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "دامپزشک یک حیوان ولگرد را که نزدیک بزرگراه پیدا شده بود درمان کرد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-07-13T17:27:33.975Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-07-13T17:27:33.975Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 4475,
        "sentence_en": "Stop meddling in your sister's private life.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "دست از فضولی کردن در زندگی خصوصی خواهرت بردار.",
        "createdAt": "2026-07-13T17:27:33.980Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-07-13T17:27:33.980Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 4476,
        "sentence_en": "His parents keep meddling in their marriage.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "والدینش مدام در ازدواج آنها دخالت بیجا می کنند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-07-13T17:27:33.984Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-07-13T17:27:33.984Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 4477,
        "sentence_en": "The manager stepped in to help the new employee.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "مدیر برای کمک به کارمند جدید وارد شد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-07-13T17:27:33.986Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-07-13T17:27:33.986Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 4478,
        "sentence_en": "Police stepped in to control the growing crowd.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "پلیس برای کنترل جمعیت رو به افزایش وارد شد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-07-13T17:27:33.989Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-07-13T17:27:33.989Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 4479,
        "sentence_en": "A teacher intervened before the argument became a fight.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "یک معلم پیش از اینکه بحث به دعوا تبدیل شود مداخله کرد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-07-13T17:27:33.991Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-07-13T17:27:33.991Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 4480,
        "sentence_en": "He always butts in while I am explaining something.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او همیشه وقتی چیزی را توضیح می دهم وسط حرفم می پرد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-07-13T17:27:33.994Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-07-13T17:27:33.994Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 4481,
        "sentence_en": "Do not butt in while we are handling this problem.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "وقتی داریم این مشکل را حل می کنیم وسط کارمان نپر.",
        "createdAt": "2026-07-13T17:27:33.997Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-07-13T17:27:33.997Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 4482,
        "sentence_en": "I played around with the camera settings all afternoon.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "تمام بعدازظهر با تنظیمات دوربین ور رفتم.",
        "createdAt": "2026-07-13T17:27:34.000Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-07-13T17:27:34.000Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 4483,
        "sentence_en": "Play around with the layout until it feels right.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "چیدمان را امتحان کن تا مناسب به نظر برسد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-07-13T17:27:34.003Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-07-13T17:27:34.003Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 4484,
        "sentence_en": "The kids were playing around in the backyard.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "بچه ها در حیاط پشتی شیطنت می کردند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-07-13T17:27:34.006Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-07-13T17:27:34.006Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 4485,
        "sentence_en": "He keeps playing around with an important deadline.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او همچنان این مهلت مهم را جدی نمی گیرد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-07-13T17:27:34.010Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-07-13T17:27:34.010Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 4486,
        "sentence_en": "We cannot play around when customers are waiting.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "وقتی مشتری ها منتظرند، نمی توانیم وقت تلف کنیم.",
        "createdAt": "2026-07-13T17:27:34.013Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-07-13T17:27:34.013Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 4487,
        "sentence_en": "The puppy loves to play around with the children.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "توله سگ دوست دارد با بچه ها بازیگوشی کند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-07-13T17:27:34.015Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-07-13T17:27:34.015Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 4488,
        "sentence_en": "Call me as soon as you get home.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "به محض اینکه به خانه رسیدی با من تماس بگیر.",
        "createdAt": "2026-07-13T17:27:34.018Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-07-13T17:27:34.018Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 4489,
        "sentence_en": "Maya is coming to dinner as well.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "مایا هم برای شام می آید.",
        "createdAt": "2026-07-13T17:27:34.021Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-07-13T17:27:34.021Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 4490,
        "sentence_en": "The report is clear and concise as well.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "گزارش واضح و همچنین مختصر است.",
        "createdAt": "2026-07-13T17:27:34.024Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-07-13T17:27:34.024Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 4491,
        "sentence_en": "He speaks French and Spanish as well.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او فرانسوی و نیز اسپانیایی صحبت می کند.",
        "createdAt": "2026-07-13T17:27:34.027Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-07-13T17:27:34.027Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 4492,
        "sentence_en": "The apartment is affordable and close to work as well.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "آپارتمان مقرون به صرفه است و علاوه بر آن به محل کار نزدیک است.",
        "createdAt": "2026-07-13T17:27:34.030Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-07-13T17:27:34.030Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 4493,
        "sentence_en": "She handles billing as well as customer support.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او امور صورتحساب و همچنین پشتیبانی مشتری را انجام می دهد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-07-13T17:27:34.033Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-07-13T17:27:34.033Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 4494,
        "sentence_en": "She hugged her son before he left for school.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "او پیش از رفتن پسرش به مدرسه، او را بغل کرد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-07-13T17:27:34.036Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-07-13T17:27:34.036Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 4495,
        "sentence_en": "The team embraced the new remote-work policy.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "تیم سیاست جدید دورکاری را پذیرفت.",
        "createdAt": "2026-07-13T17:27:34.039Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-07-13T17:27:34.039Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 4496,
        "sentence_en": "We walked uphill for nearly an hour.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "ما نزدیک یک ساعت در سربالایی راه رفتیم.",
        "createdAt": "2026-07-13T17:27:34.043Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-07-13T17:27:34.043Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 4497,
        "sentence_en": "The trail goes downhill after the lake.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "مسیر بعد از دریاچه سر پایینی می شود.",
        "createdAt": "2026-07-13T17:27:34.046Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-07-13T17:27:34.046Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 4498,
        "sentence_en": "The road is too steep for this old car.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "این جاده برای این ماشین قدیمی خیلی پر شیب است.",
        "createdAt": "2026-07-13T17:27:34.049Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-07-13T17:27:34.049Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 4499,
        "sentence_en": "This diner is our regular spot after work.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "این غذاخوری پاتوق همیشگی ما بعد از کار است.",
        "createdAt": "2026-07-13T17:27:34.052Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-07-13T17:27:34.052Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 4500,
        "sentence_en": "We hang out at the park after work.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "ما بعد از کار در پارک دور هم هستیم.",
        "createdAt": "2026-07-13T17:27:34.056Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-07-13T17:27:34.056Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 4501,
        "sentence_en": "That cafe is our favorite hangout downtown.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "آن کافه پاتوق موردعلاقه ما در مرکز شهر است.",
        "createdAt": "2026-07-13T17:27:34.066Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-07-13T17:27:34.066Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 4502,
        "sentence_en": "The basement became a hangout for local teens.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "زیرزمین به جای دورهمی نوجوانان محلی تبدیل شد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-07-13T17:27:34.069Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-07-13T17:27:34.069Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 4503,
        "sentence_en": "The pharmacy is close to my apartment.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "داروخانه نزدیک آپارتمان من است.",
        "createdAt": "2026-07-13T18:36:30.121Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-07-13T18:40:05.918Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 4504,
        "sentence_en": "This store sells cheap furniture.",
        "sentence_en_meaning_fa": "این فروشگاه مبلمان ارزان می فروشد.",
        "createdAt": "2026-07-13T18:46:36.499Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-07-13T18:51:16.549Z"
      }
    ],
